<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">LK Lammaː Ruu tɔ̃vɨng riinɛ</book>
  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ruu tɔ̃vɨn au shɛ a Luka naa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lk</para>
  <para style="mt2">RUU TƆ̃VƗN AU SHƐ A</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKA NAA</para>
  <para style="imt">Yutasinɛ</para>
  <para style="im">Shɔ gbete bee laabeenɛm ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Luka u ɓa Yahudawa ɓa ama pɛ likita, sɔ̃n ɓa shɔzɛ gbete atette Yesɔ jadɔɔyi naa shɔ laabeenɛ Ɗanyaruubii gãsiyi gbete i sha Yesɔ ruubii ɓa. Ruu tɔ̃vɨn au shɛ a Luka naa tasirɛ nɛ Yesɔ kɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete raa shɔ Israila a shɔzɛ a koo piti kpai. Luka beenɛ Yesɔ Uɓeyelapa suru ɓau nyarɛ aru u &lt;&lt;N ti shɔ raayi ruu tɔ̃vɨn&gt;&gt; (4.18). Shɔ bee ruu sisɨn puru ntanɛtɔ a ɓuzɨnni, Luka au gɨn-gɨn a shɔ gaa a wuniyɛ sha ruu Yesɔ anɛtɔ, au yisinɛni naa Yesɔ gẽ lapatɛ sha sɔ̃ntɔ. Shɔ laabeenɛm sha tɛttɔ a laabeenɛ Yesɔ jashonɛ akɨnti gbete Yesɔ gẽ lapa yɛ, a nɔgbete kirisayi sisɨn ãnɛ bayɛ a satirɛ a koo piti kpai.</para>
  <para style="ip">U riinɛ 2 a 6 au pɛsiyɛ, tuu ɓɛɛ jo vivishonɛ waanɛ a shɔ kpaa a yɛti ruu tɔ̃vɨn mikɔ shɛɛli, naa ruuɓere Ɗashonɛlapa soo a jagavivaa i nyageenɛ aɗagbete shɔ yee Yesɔ yɛ, Yesɔ a wɛrɛ Ɗa naa jajja a ruuɓusinɛ e shɔ Samarita tɔ̃vɨn a mɛrɛ̃ɛ̃ au niiyɛ. A yɛti ruu tɔ̃vɨn kpai shɔ ã kaka ba a ruu Ɗa gakinɛ, Ɗa Suru, soroyi vishonɛ a Yesɔ ɗɔvishonɛ, a Ɗalapa shɔ ruuvini yaasinɛ.</para>
  <para style="iot">Vi au Ɓuzɨn yɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">Yutasinɛ (1.1-4)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yɔhana shɔ Batizima yeenɛ u banɛ a Yesɔ ɓɛɛni (1.5-2.52)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yɔhana shɔ batizima ɗɔvishonɛ (3.1-20)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesɔ batizima pɛlinɛ a sisɨnntanɛ (3.21-4.13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesɔ vishonɛ au pɛli a shɔnɔɔ a Galili (4.14-9.50)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yunɛ Galili anɛ Urushalima (9.51-19.27)</para>
  <para style="io1">Dii maanzii au wasinaa Yesɔ u si maani Urushalima ni (19.28-23.56)</para>
  <para style="io1">Uɓeyelapa yunɛ saa, shɛlinɛ, au gẽnɛni (24.1-53)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Yutasinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />N gee a nyatɛ Tiyofolos:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Shɔzɛ waanɛ gbeteyi ã yuu i bee vigbete Ɗalapa pɛli au tete yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />I bee vigbete shɔ geliuyɛ a shɔ gbete i zɛ viu ai nɔɔ a gɨngɨn a shɔ gbeteyi i waanɛ nya ruuba yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />kɛɗɔn ma shɔwɛrɛ Tiyofolos aru gbetenkɔ, n ang yuu n bili vim tɛttɔ piti kpai yunɛ au gɨn-gɨn, n zɛrɛ tɔ̃tɔ n bee vi sɔ̃njo aa yuuni. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />N pɛli vim aru gbete a zɛ vitɔ̃vɨng piti kpai a vigbete shɔ mataa yɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ sha Yɔhana shɔ Batizima lee yenɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Aɗagbete Hiridu usi kpati a Yahudiya yɛ, shɔ nyawaanɛ siɗɔn u nii nɛ Zakariya, shɔ gbete i shovi a Abija; ɓeso nii nɛ Elizobe; tɛu a Haruna laduru. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />I ziti piti kpai i shɔ tɔ̃vɨn a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn ni, i gɨn Uɓeyelapa nya ruubii lalas au nya-ãsinɛni. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />I jaa si ɓa aru Elizobe u si sutɔri, Elizobe a ɓɛvɔ Zakariya ni siyi kpẽ tɛttɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Lewɔɔ Zakariya u ɗɔgbete pɛliu vishonɛ nyawaanɛ a jaa Ɗa gakinɛ, sijou lee arɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Ji shɔ nyawaanɛ a jaa Ɗa i vi pɛlinɛ, Loti lɔurɛ nɛu bu zɨriya laakusɨn ayuu lazãa. Kɛɗɔn Zakariya yɛ Uɓeyelapa jaa Ɗa rɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Aɗagbete Zakariya u ɗɔɔ zɨriya laakusɨn bunɛ, mɔɔ i shi a ɓili i ɗɔɔ Ɗa gakinɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Ɗa jashonɛ lapa shɛ au ɗekɨn, a ka-nakn lazãa aɗɔgbete bu zɨriya laakusɨn ɗɔnyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Naa Zakariya zɛutɛ, a zaa waanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Ama Ɗa jashonɛ lapa geliu nɛ: &lt;&lt;Mɔkɔ nta setinɛ, Zakariya! Ɗalapa nta a gakinɛtɛ, mɛsou Elizobe yɛ yeraa javɔshɔ. A ãu nii nɛ Yɔhana. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />A yɛ nta binyatɔ̃nɛtɔ a sisɨn puruni waanɛ, shɔzɛ waanɛ i yɛ nta binyatɔ̃nɛtɔ naa shɔ kɛ yeunɛ yɛ! <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Jau yɛ ɔ̃ shɔ pẽniba a Uɓeyelapa ɗekɨn ni. Yɛ ɓoo mii gbete u kaka ɗɔnyɛ ɓa, yunɛ au lee yenɛ yɛ ɔ̃ a Ɗa suruni, <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Ukɔ yɛ sɔri shɔ Isireila waanɛ a Uɓeyelapa Ɗalapa ɗɔbii. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Ukɔ yɛ, yɛ a Uɓeyelapa ɗekɨn, yɛ ɔ̃ shɔgbete vitɛu kaka ɓa naa Ɗa jashonɛ Iliya. Yɛ musi jaayi yuu a ɓeye ni nyazɔ, yɛ pɔ̃ shɔgbete i gɨn Ɗa nya ãsinɛ ɓa i lɛri ayuu vi wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ pɛlinɛ; yɛ toli Uɓeyelapa shɔ nya ɗɔgbete u kpayi a ɗɔgbete i gauyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zakariya geli Ɗa jashonɛ nɛ,&lt;&lt; kɛ ɔ̃nɛ nankɔ n yɛn zɛ kɛpi koviya? N kpẽtɛttɔ, maso kpẽ sɔ̃ntɛ jo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Ɗa Jashonɛ lapa kasiu nyanɛ,&lt;&lt;N kɔn Jibirilu, N shi a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn, ukɔ shonrɛ n nwanya a mokɔni n gelaa ruu tɔ̃vɨn. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Ama a ji ã sisɨn ɓa aru gbete n gelaa yɛni ɓa, yɛ ɔ̃ nizɛ a dɔɔɗa tɔ̃vɨn. Aru gbete a jo ã sisɨn ɓa a yɛ nwanya dɔɔɓa see leegbete ang gelaami ɔ̃tɛ nizɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Shɔ ga Zakariya rɛ ji shɛ ɓa tɛ̃ɛti niɓa i ji zɛ vigbete zãriu shɛnɛ yɛti jaa Ɗa yɛ ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Naa shɛ ɓilitɛ jaa Ɗa ni ji nwari nya ɓa. I kpaa sisɨnrɛ nɛ Ɗalapa ɓeliu nɔɔ mintɛ a yɛti jaa Ɗa ni, tasiyi vi a naa ama ji nwanya ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Aɗagbete Zakariya u ɗaa vi pɛlinɛ yisi nyatɛ a jaa Ɗa ni sɔɔ wɛrɛ-rɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />A kɨntiuni ɓeso Elizobe tosi jaarɛ, ji ya wɛrɛu ɓa shɛlɛ maani. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />Elizobe shanɛ&lt;&lt;Dɔdɔrim Uɓeyelapa pɔ̃sin naatɛ, shɛshintɛ a yusẽni a shɔ ɗekɨn ni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ sha Yesɔ ɗaa yeenɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Aɗagbete Elizobe usi shɛlɛ maangbete a jaani yɛti yɛ, Ɗalapa sho Ɗa jashonɛ lapa Jibirilu a komɔɔ Galili gbete shɔ ɓaanɛ Nazara. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />Ɗa jashonɛ lapa ruu shanɛ ɗɔn a nyara gbete i maruu nɛi tɛzɔ a shɔwɔ u nii nɛ Yusufu, upɛ kpati Dauda shɔ laduru. Nyarau u nii nɛ Mariyamu. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Ɗa jashonɛ lapa au ɗɔbiirɛ a shanɛ, a ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ binyatɔ̃nɛ! Uɓeyelapa u a mokɔni, Ɗa tasaa vɔɔ susãritɛ biini waanɛ!<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Mariyamu yɔri yuutɔ waanɛ aru Ɗa jashonɛ lapa ruumni, ji zɛ vigbete u ruu shayɛ ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Ɗa jashonɛ lapa geli Mariyamu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Mɔkɔ nta setinɛ Mariyamu; a kpaa tɔ̃vɨntɛ a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn ni. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />A yɛ kpaa yɛti a yee jaa, a ãu nii nɛ Yesɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Yɛ ɔ̃ pẽniba, shɔ yɛ ɓaunɛ shɔgbete pẽniba vitɛu kaka ɓa ɓɛjaa. Uɓeyelapa Ɗalapa pɔ̃urɛ u ɔ̃ kpati nagbete ɓɛwuru Dauda ɔ̃ yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Ukɔ yɛ roo kpati a Yakubu laduru dandang; u kpati roonɛ yɛ sɔ̃nya ɓa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Maryamu geli Ɗa jashonɛ lapa nɛ,&lt;&lt;N pɛ nyarã, vim yɛ ɔ̃ kɛpikoviya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Ɗa jashonɛ lapa kasi nya nɛ,&lt;&lt; Ɗa suru yɛ no aa yuu, Ɗalapa kaka yɛ ɔ̃ moni. Aruumkɔ Ɗa suru shɔyɛ ɓaunɛ Ɗa jaa. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Kpaa sisɨn pɛ a mɛzɔ̃u Elizobe bi. Shɔ shanɛ yɛ kpaa jaa ɓa, ama u a yɛtini shɛlɛ maangbete, piti au kpẽnɛni kpai. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Aruumkɔ viwɔɔ tɛ Ɗalapa kaka ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Mariyamu kasi nyanɛ,&lt;&lt;N pɛ Uɓeyelapa jawɛrɛ, Mɛnɛ u ɔ̃ kɔɔ nankɔ.&gt;&gt;A Ɗa jashonɛ lapa yaurɛ a yɛrɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mariyamu yɛrɛ gee Elizobe nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />A ɗɔukɔ Mariyamu yuu gbãgbã yɛnɛ tipi wɔɔ adɔɔ kɔpɔ a ɓuzɨn komɔɔ tipi Yahudiya. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />A to Zakariya wɛrɛ gee Elizobe nyarɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Naa Elizobe nta Mariyamu nya geenɛtɛ, u jaɓẽreti ribii au yɛti. Ɗa suru kuki Elizobe nyawu. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Elizobe ɓeli nya a kaka nɛ: &lt;&lt;Mɔkaa ɔ̃rɛ shɔ gbete Ɗa tasiu susãri a bi atete soroyi, jaa gbete aa yɛtim Ɗa u tasiu susãri a biniǃ <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Pɛvi tɔ̃vɨn shɔpi kpanrɛ viya, Uɓeyelapa ɓini ang ɗɔ nyageenɛ viya? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Naa nta nyageenɛtɛ, jaa gbete ang yɛti nta sisɨn puru a guli bi rɛ. A sisɨn puru yɛ ɔ̃ kɛpikovi <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />a sisɨn puru yɛ ɔ̃ kɛpikovi akɛ ã sisɨn nɛ a vi gbete Uɓeyelapa nya ruubii shayɛni ɔ̃tɛ nizɛ viya!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Marayamu soo Ɗa bɛlinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Ama Mariyamu shanɛ, &lt;&lt;N sisɨn a ɗɔɔ Uɓeyelapa bɛlinɛ;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />N suru a ɗɔɔ yɛti puru ntanɛ aru Ɗalapa u n shɔ raanɛ, <verse eid="LUK 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />aru kpaa sisɨntɛ ang biini, n pɛ u jadɔɔ gbete ɓa viwɔɓa. Yunɛ dɔdɔrim shɔ yɛ ɓannɛ shɔ sɨsɨn puru, <verse eid="LUK 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />aru vi pẽniba shɔgbete vitɛu kaka ɓa Ɗalapa ukɔ pɛlinrɛ. U nii nɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ; <verse eid="LUK 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />yunɛ laduru shom yɛnɛ laduru wɔ tasiu shɔ gbete i basiu nii raa ntanɛtɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />U vi shonɛ pɛ̃niba au pɛliyɛ, sãti shɔ yuu basinɛyitɛ a vigbete i kasi pɛlinɛni. <verse eid="LUK 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Nosi kpati pẽnibayitɛ ai laa ɔ̃nɛ kpatini, a bassi shɔ gbeteyi i ɓa viwɔ ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Shari shɔwɔ̃tɛ a vi tɔ̃vɨn, a ã shɔ vinaa i naa nɛi yɛ a naa waati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">sã ruugbete ma au ɓeuruutɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">pɔ̃si u jawɛrɛ Isireilayi naatɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />&lt;&lt;kpaa sisɨntɛ nta Ibirayi raatɛǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Mariyamu ɔ̃ a Elizobe ni mɛnɛ lee taati kɛɗɔn a yɛ wɛrɛ rɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɔhana shɔ Batizima dii yeenɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Naa Elizobe ɗaa jaa yeenɛ pɛlitɛ, a yee jaarɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />U shɔ nyakãsiriyi au shɔbiiyini i nta yɛti purutɔ waanɛ nɔgbete Uɓeyelapa ntau raayɛ, i piti kpai i nta yɛti purutɔ a wunini. <verse eid="LUK 1:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Naa jaau pɛlitɛ lumɔ gbete, i yeriu sharɛ, siyi tɔnɛ nɛi ãu niinɛ Zakariya, a ɓeye knti <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />ama u ɓini shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɓa! u nii nɛ Yɔhana.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />I hɨunɛ, &lt;&lt;Aa shɔbiiyi pi nii nankɔ piya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />I tasi naarɛ a Beye bi, u nii yɛ ɔ̃ kɛnɛ-iviya. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Ɓeye Zakariya nɛ shɔu ãng vi vibeenɛ pɛ, a bee virɛ, &lt;&lt;U nii nɛ Yɔhana.&gt;&gt;I piti kpai ɔ̃rikɛ viibii zaanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />U nya ɓelirɛ tɛ̃ɛti, a gaa nya nwanɛrɛ, u ɗɔ Ɗa bɛlinɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />I shɔ nyakãsiri seti pɛli kpai, shɔ dɔti nya yɛnɛ komoo kɔpɔ tipi Yahudiya piti kpai. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Kopiya gbete nta vim kpai kɛɗɔn i lɛrirɛ i hɨnɛ,&lt;&lt;Jau yɛ ɔ̃ kɛ-iviya?&gt;&gt;Aru gbete shɔ zɛtɛttɔ nɛ Uɓeyelapa kaka a ukɔni.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zakariya sha vigbete kanɛ ɗekɨn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Yɔhana ɓeye Zakariya Ɗa suru si au sisɨn ni a sha Ɗalapa nya ruubii nɛ:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />&lt;&lt;U bɛli Uɓeyelapa nɛ, shɔ Isireilayi Ɗalapa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">Atɛ pɔ̃si ɓɛshɔzɛyi naatɛ, raayitɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Ãu shɔgbete rautɛ vitɛu kaka ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">a ɓɛjawɛrɛ Dauda laduru,<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Nogbete ma au jashonɛyi wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ si tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃yɛ<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />nɛn yɛn rautɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">au shɔnopɔ̃yi naani a shɔgbeteyi iji kasiu zɛnɛ ɓa i naani kpai.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />A shanɛ nɛn yɛn nta u mɛuruyi raatɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">u kpaa sisɨn aru gbete ma a wuniyɛni.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Tɛnɛ sisɨn zaza au ɓɛuru Ibirayi:<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />ma nɛn rautɔ au shɔnopɔ̃yi naani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">nɛn yaurɛ u kpaa nyaba nɔgbete u shɔshing vi shɔnɛ seti ɓa biini ɓa,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />nɔgbete u ɔ̃ shɔ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:75">a ɗagbete u a suruni kpai.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />&lt;&lt;Mɔkɔ, n jaa, shɔ yɛ ɓaanɛ Ɗa jashɔnɛ pẽniba shɔ gbete vitɛu kaka ɓa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">A yɛ, yɛ a Uɓeyelapa ɗekɨn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">a tɔ̃riu nyaba,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />a geli u shɔbiiyi nɛ shɔ rayitɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">a nyaba gbete shɔ yasiyi ruuvini yɛ,<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />U Ɗalapa pɛ shɔgbete nta shɔ raatɔ a ɔrinɛni gbikiri-gbikiri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">yɛ pɔ̃siu ɗɔsẽsẽ shɔraanɛtɔ a kunyasi u too au bi<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />U tasi a kolapa ɗɔsẽsẽ a shɔgbeteyi i ɔ̃ a ɗɔkɨnrii bi kpai, a shɔ gbete i ɔ̃ a jasuru au vɔtɛyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">u tasiu nyaba nɔgbete au ɔ̃ a yɛti binyatɔ̃nɛ yɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Jau barɛ abi a suru ni ɔ̃ a kakani a nyaba gɨnnɛ. ɔ̃ aɗɔgbete shɔ ɓa ɗɔnni ɓa yɛ, yɛnɛ lee gbete shɛ a Isireila ɗekɨn aru nyawaanɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesɔ lee yeenɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />A ɗauni kpati pẽniba Kayisa Agɔstu sho nyanɛ shɔu bee shɔ nii a tipi Rooma kpai. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Naa shɔ ganɛ gbete shɔ gaa yɛ shɔ pɛlitɛ, a ɗauni Kiriniyu ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ gɔmna tipi Siriya ni. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Kɛɗɔn kopiya yɛ jou wɛrɛ koo nɛ shɔu been nii.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Kɛɗɔn Yusufu yaa tipi Nazara a Galili, a yɛ komɔɔ Baitalami gbete a Yahudiya ɗɔɔ shɔ yee kpati Dauda ɗɔnyɛ.Yusufu yɛ ɗɔwa aru uji Dauda ɓɛshɔbiiyi kɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Yusufu yɛjo a Mariyamu ni gbete si matɛtɔ nɛn yɛ tɛutɔ. Ɓeso usi jaani yɛti. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Aɗagbete isi Baitalami yɛ, Mariyamu ɗaa jaa yeenɛ tɛsirɛ, <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Yeu jamarirɛ, a liu a fãrã a yɔu a ɗɔɔ shɔ tɛri vivaayi vishaanɛ ɗɔnyɛ aru jaa roonɛ si ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jagavivaayi i a Ɗa jashonɛ lapayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />A nya kagbete tipi wakɔ gãsi jagavivayi i roo a ɓili, i ɗɔgbete ai tɛtti vivaayi yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Ɗa jashonɛ lapa shɛ ai bi, Ɗa bassinɛ koli ɗɔu kpɛlɛng kpɛlɛng i nta sɛtitɔ waanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Ama Ɗa jashonɛ lapa geliyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔkɔ zaanɛ! N n-tɔɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn, gbete yɛ sɨ shɔ yɛti puru piti kpai. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Nɛnkɔ a Dauda komoo shɔ yerɔɔ shɔ gbete yɛ rawɔtɛ Uɓeyelapa kirisi! <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Shomkɔ yɛ tasɔɔrɛ: Ɔ yɛ kpaa jabẽrẽti shɔ liutɛ fãrã, shɔ yɔutɛ a vivaayi ɗɔvishanɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Ɓa shɔ zɛnɛni ɓa, Ɗa jashonɛ lapa a kɨ̃nkɨ̃n waanɛ ikɛ nonɛ a Ɗa jashonɛ lapayi, i ɗɔgbete i tɔ̃ɔ̃ sɔɔ i bɛlinɛ Ɗalapa yɛ i shanɛ,<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />&lt;&lt;Bassinɛ yɛnɛ Ɗalapa bi a kolapa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">a kotipi binyatɔ̃nɛ u ɔ̃ a shɔ gbete Ɗalapa nta tɔ̃vɨn tɔ ayini!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Naa Ɗa jashonɛ i yaitɛ i sɔ kolaparɛ, jaga vivawi i geli zɔnɛ, &lt;&lt;U yɛ Baitalami nɛ u zɛ vimpɛ au nɔɔ, gbete Uɓeyelapa geliuyɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Nankɔ i yɛrɛ i kpa Mariyamu a Yusufu ni, i zɛ jau rootɛ a vivaayi ɗɔvishanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Naa jagavivaayi i zɛ jabɛ̃rɛ̃tiutɛ, i geli Mariyamu a Yusufu ni vigbete Ɗa jashonɛ lapayi i sha a jau yuu. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Shɔgbete i nta vigbete jagavivaayi shayɛ, viu ãkɛ vibii zaanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Marayamu kpaa sisɨn arum piti kpai a lɛri au sisɨn gbikiri-gbikiri. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Jagavivaayi sɔrɛ, i ɗɔ soo ntonɛ a Ɗa nii bɛlinɛni aru vigbete i nta ai zɛyɛ ni piti kpai; ɔ̃ji nagbete Ɗa jashonɛ lapayi geliyi yɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ ãu niinɛ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Akɨnti dii mangtaa, naa ɗa shaa yeenɛ atɛ, shɔ ãu niinɛ Yesɔ, nii gbete Ɗa jashonɛ lapa ãu yɛ si ɓini ji tosiu ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ ã Yesɔ a jaa Ɗa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Naa dii atɛ Yusufu a Marayamu ni aru i sɔki vikɔ̃linɛ nagbete Musa laa beenɛ nya ãsinɛ shayɛ. I tu jau i yɛ Urushalima awuni aru i ã Uɓeyelapa. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />(Naa gbete shɔ bee yɛ a Uɓeyelapa labeenɛ nya ãsinɛ,&lt;&lt;Kopi jamari javɔshɔ gbete shɔ yee yɛ shɔ ã Uɓeyelapa&gt;&gt;), <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Kɛɗɔn Yusufu i sɛ koro ziti iyɛ Urushalima nɛi nti viyuu ãnɛ awuni naa Uɓeyelapa labeenɛ nya ãsinɛ shayɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />A ɗauni shɔwɔ si ɗɔn u nii nɛ Siman shɔgbete u wɛrɛ si a Urushalima, U si shɔ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ, shɔ Ɗalapa seti ntanɛ u a ɗɔu gayɛ nɛn zɛ Isireilayi naa raanɛ pɔgɔtɔ, Ɗa suru si awuni. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Ɗa suru tasiu tɛttɔ nɛyɛ vɔɓa sɛtɛ zɛ kirisi anɛ tɛttɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Ɗa Suru tu Siman n-tiu a jaa Ɗa. Naa Yesɔ ɓeye a ɓini i ntiutɛ a jaa Ɗa ni nɛ shɔu pɛliu nɔgbete Uɓeyelapa shayɛ, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Siman tu jau a naa a dɔ̃ri Ɗa rɛ:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />&lt;&lt; Uɓeyelapa, a pɔ̃ vigbete u maa si a moni yɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">Dɔdɔrim, Uɓeyelapa yasaa a jawɛrɛ naa nɛ u vɔpɛ a yɛti binyatɔ̃nɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Ang nɔɔ n zɛ a shɔraanɛ tɛ,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />Gbete a pɛli a shɔ ɗekɨn piti kpai,<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Shompɛ ɗɔsɛ̃sɛ̃ gbete tasi shɔgbete ɓa yahudawa ɓa i nyaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">a bassinɛ yɛnɛ a shɔbii Isireilayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Jau ɓini a ɓeyeni viu pɔ̃yirɛ i maa naatɛ a nosisɨn aru vigbete gbete shɔ sha a jau yuu yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Siman shanɛ Ɗa u tasiyi vɔɔ susãri abiini, geli ɓini Marayamu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Jam Ɗalapa lɔurɛ nɛu pɔ̃ shɔ waanɛ a isireila gãsiyi i yɛ niitɔ gãsiyi i yɛ ranaatɔ. Jau yɛ ɔ̃kɛ Ɗalapa vitasinɛ gbete shɔ yɛ kasiɓa. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />A nankɔ i vikɔ̃linɛ gbete i ɓusi ai sisɨn yɛ ɓɛlitɔ. Yɛ kɔ sisɨntɔ naa zali yɛ ɓɛɛ aa sisɨn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Ɗa jashonɛ wɔsi ɗɔn upɛ soro shɔ ɓaunɛ Ana kpɛtɛttɔ, Fanuwel ɓɛɛ jaa shɔ tipi Ashir. Shɔ tɛurɛ ɔ̃ saa maanzi shɛli a wɛrɛ vɔshɔ ni. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />U si suvɔ, u saa laa nɛ̃ɛti a tu nɛ̃ɛt (84). Ji yaa jaa Ɗa ɓa ko legbete; zɨmba a niti ni u ɗɔɔ Ɗa gakinɛ a nya manɛ ni. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />A ɗauni aa sɔ̃n tɛ̃ɛti a dɔ̃ri Ɗa a nwanya sɔ̃njo a jajau yuuni a shɔ gbete i ɗɔ showenɛ nei ga nɔgbete Ɗalapa yɛ raa shɔ Urushalimayi yɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yusufu a Mariyamu i so Nazara</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Naa Yusufu a Marayamu ni i yisi vigbete Uɓeyelapa labeenɛ nya ãsinɛ shayɛtɛ kpai, i sokɛ Galili i wɛrɛkoo Nazara. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Jau barɛ a lakirɛ; Ɗalapa ãu sẽẽrɛ̃tɔ, Ɗa tasiu vɔɔ susãritɔ abiini.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ jakasa to jaa Ɗa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Ko-pi saa shopiya Yesɔ ɓeye a ɓini ni iyɛ Urushalima tɔ aru yumusinɛ pasika. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Yesɔ si saa kopi atu ziti, i yɛ ɗɔ yumusinɛ pasika sɔ̃njo nagbete i yɛli a saa-saa yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Naa yumusinɛ pasikau sɔ̃ nyatɛ, i sɔ wɛrɛ rɛ, ama Yesɔ jakasa ji gɨn yi ɓa adɔɔ niɓa ɔ̃ a Urushalima. Yesɔ ɓeye a ɓini ni iji zɛba nɛu ɗɔɔ akɨnti ɓa, <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />I tunɛ mɛnɛ u ai teteni, i raa lee gbete i jo zɛu ɓa a gau ɗɔ kãnɛrɛ ai shɔbiiyi tete a ɓesayini. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />I ji kpau ɗɔ ɓa, kɛɗɔn i sɔɔ Urushalimarɛ i ɗɔgbete i kãu ɗɔyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Akɨnti lee taati i kpau a ɗɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ a jaa Ɗa a shɔmala Yahudiyawayi tete, u ɗɔ showenɛ ai nya aru hɨlinɛ ni. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Shɔ gbete ai wesho au nya kasinɛ ɔ̃ri kɛ vibii zaanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Yesɔ ɓeye a ɓini ni i zɛurɛ a sɛti pɛlitɔ, kɛɗɔn ɓini geliunɛ,&lt;&lt; Ma jaa, a pɛliu kɛ piruvi nankɔ viya? Meye a nkɔ ni u kã ɗɔ ɓa jitɔ waanɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Yesɔ risiyi nyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ kãng ɗɔ pi ruviya? Ɔ ji zɛba nɛ kɔritɔ n ɔ̃ a maye wɛrɛ ɓaya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Ama i ji ntau nya risi nɛu ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ sɔɔ Nazara kɛ ayini u ɗɔ showenɛ ai nya. Ɓini sɨ vim piti kpai au sisɨn. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Piti kpai Yesɔ ba abi a sẽẽrɛ̃ni a yɛ ɗekɨn awuni, Ɗalapa ntau tɔ̃vɨntɔ shɔ gãsi ma i nta tɔ̃vɨn jo.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yɔhana shɔ Batizima ãnɛ nyawaanɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Si kpati Tibariyo roo kpatitɛ saa kopi tu maani kpati pẽniba; kayisa Bilatu usi gɔmna Yahudiya, Hiridu usi sɔ̃njo gɔmna a Galili, ɓezɔ̃ Filibu u sɔ̃njo gɔmna Ituriya a tipi Tirakoniti. Lisaniya usi pɛ gɔmna tipi Abilen, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Ana a Kayifa ikɔ ɔ̃rɛ yupɛ̃ni shɔlansi pɛ̃niba, a ɗauni Ɗalapa nyaruubii a si Yɔhana Zakariya ɓɛɛ jaa u si ɗɔpɨnsi. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Kɛɗɔn Yɔhana zaa nya ɓooti Urudu piti kpai, u ɗɔ Ɗa nya ruubii waanɛ nɛ&lt;&lt;Ɔ yaa ruuvini pɛlintɔ Ɗalapa yɛ yasɔɔ ruuvinitɔ shɔu pɛlɔɔ Batizima.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Nagbete Ɗa jashonɛ Ishaya labeenɛ shayɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">&lt;&lt;Shɔwɔ ɗɔn u ɗɔ nya ɓaanɛ a ɗɔgbete laa ɓa ɗɔmɓa shanɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">&lt;Ɔ tɔ̃ri Ɗalapa nyaba nɛ, ɔ kɔriu ɗɔ tɛnɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">ɔ shiritɔ gbororo nɔgbete yɛ tɛɛ aɗɔnyɛ.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Ko-pi too gbete piya shɔu gɔlitɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">ko-pi kɔpɔ pɛ̃tɛ̃rɛ̃ shɔpiya a kɔpɔni pɛ̃niba shɔu sãkitɔ piti kpai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">nyaba walinɛ gbete shɔ sɔɔ toti bayɛ shɔ tɔ̃ritɔ gbororo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">ɗɔ gɔgɔlɔki shɔu yikitɔ,<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Shɔzɛ a lakoo piti kpai i yɛ zɛ Ɗalapa shɔraanɛtɔǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Moo shɔzɛ i a Yɔhana ɗɔbii neu pɛliyi Batizima. A geliyinɛ&lt;&lt;Jasɔɔ miyi! Pi gelɔɔ pi nɛ ɔ yɛ ranaatɔ a raboonɛ gbete Ɗalapa kɛ n ti nɛm piya? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Ɔ pɛli jo vigbete au yɛ tasinɛ ɔ yaa ruuvinitɛ. Ɔ yaa shalinɛ nɛ awɔ nɔɔ nɛ Ibirayi upɛ uɓeye. N gelɔɔtɛ Ɗalapa yɛ tuu tarim dɔɔtɔ u risi Ibirayi jawuriyiǃ <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Shɔ pɔ̃ nya kpalitɛ a dɔɔ gɨnri laa; nɛn ɗanɛ lagbete au ji rɛɛ jaa ɓa nɛ shɔu kɔrɛ shɔu lɔki yaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Kɛɗɔn mɔɔyi hɨunɛ, u yɛ pɛli kɛpikoviya?<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Yɔhana kasi nyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔgbete au visinbii kɛ ɔ̃nɛ ziti ɔ̃riutɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u ã shɔwɔjo gbete au ɓa awuni ɓa yɛ, shɔgbete u vishaanɛ a ɗɔnni i vɔsitɔ a shɔgbete au ɓɛɛ ɓayɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Shɔ saa bɛnɛ i a sɔ̃njo nɛu pɛliyi Batizima. i hɨunɛ,&lt;&lt; Shɔmala, u yɛ pɛli kɛpikoviya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Geliyinɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔkɔɔ tɛnɛ saa nɛ u tɛɛ vigbete shɔ tɔnɛ ɔ tɛyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Shɔ diimanɛ gãsiyi i hɨu sɔ̃njo nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ukɔ fa? U pɛli ɓɛɛ kɛpikoviya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">A geliyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔkɔɔ tɛ saa nɛ a shɔ naa a kaka ko ɔ yeeri shɔ nya ayuu nɛ lɛsi ruutɛ. Ɔ pɔ̃ sisɨn jo avigbete shɔ shorɔɔyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Shɔzɛ piti kpai i tɛɛ sisɨn nɛ, Yɔhana kɔ yɛ ɔ̃ kirisi ya? <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Kɛɗɔn Yɔhana geliyi piti kpai nɛ, &lt;&lt;N pɛlɔɔ Batizima a mii, ama shɔwɔ kanɛ ang knti gbete tɛnttɛtɔ a kakani. N ji yɛɓa nɔgbete n kaliu rii kodɔɔ yɛ ɓa. U kɔ yɛ pelɔɔ Batizima a Ɗa suru wɔsɔ̃n a yaa. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />U sikɨn a naani, yɛ deri gãri viu u wɛsi a ɓili u tɛ̃u nɔɔ a mbuntɛ; ama yɛ too gãri vi a yaa gbete niki ɓayɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Yɔhana nwari shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn a nyaba tottot nɛ shɔu ya ruuvini pɛlinɛtɔ.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Ama Yɔhana mari kpati Hiridu tɔ, aru Hirodiya ɓɛzɔ̃ ɓeso au tɛyɛ a vikɔ̃linɛ gbete pɛliyɛni piti kpai, <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />kɛɗɔn Hiridu pɛli vikɔ̃linɛ gbete au tɛɛ kaka ruugbete au maa Yɔhana a jaahm.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɔhana pɛli Yesɔ Batizima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Akɨnti gbete Yɔhana pɛli shɔ Batizimatɛ piti kpai, Yesɔ ma Yɔhana pɛliu Batizima sɔ̃njorɛ. Yesɔ u si ɗɔɔ Ɗa gakinɛ see kolapa ɓɛlirɛ, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Ɗa suru no au yuu naa koro. Shɔ nta yee nya shɛ a kolapa nɛ, &lt;&lt; Mɔkaa n jaa ang yɛti ɔriyɛ, n nta sisɨn purutɛ a mokɔni waanɛ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ laduru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Aɗagbete Yesɔ gaa vishɔnɛ, usi mɛnɛ saa bmati atu kopi (30). Usi wujaa, shɔ tunɛ neu pɛ Yusufu jaa, shɔgbete upɛ Heli jaa, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli u Matthat jaa, Matthat u Leewi jaa, Leewi u Milki jaa, Milki u Janayi jaa, Janayi u Yusufu jaa. <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yusufu u Matatiya jaa, Matatiya u Emo jaa, Emo u Nahum jaa. Nahum u Azaliya jaa, Azaliya u Najaya jaa. <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />A Najaya u Mahata jaa, Mahata u Matatiya jaa, Matatiya u Shimeya jaa, Shimeya u Yusufu jaa, Yusufu u Yahuda jaa. <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />A Yahuda u Yuwana jaa, Yuwana u Resa jaa. Resa u Zerubabe jaa, a Zerubabe u Shalitiyel jaa, Shalitiyel u Neri jaa. <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />A Neri u Meliki jaa, Meliki u Adi jaa, Adi u Kosam jaa, a Kosam u Elimadam jaa, Elimadam u Eri jaa, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />a Eri u Joshuwa jaa. Jashuwa u Eliyiza jaa. Eliyiza u Matata jaa. Matata u Leevi jaa. <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Leevi u Simiyon jaa. Simiyon u Yahuda jaa, Yahuda u Yusufu jaa. Yusufu u Jonam jaa, Jonam u Eliyakim jaa, Eliyakim u Maliya jaa. <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Maliya u Mena jaa, Mena u Matata jaa, Matata u Natang jaa, Natang u Dauda jaa, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Dauda u Jessi jaa. Jeesi u Obida jaa, Obida u Buwaza jaa, Buwaza u Salamuna jaa, Salamuna u Nashong jaa, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nashong u Aminada jaa, Aminada u Adi jaa, Adi u Arama jaa. Arama u Heziron jaa, Heziron u Periza jaa, Periza u Yahuda jaa, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yahuda u Yakubu jaa, Yakubu u Ishayaku jaa, Ishayaku u Ibirayi jaa, Ibirayi u Tera jaa. Tera u Nashɔn jaa, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nashɔn u Saruja jaa. Saruja u Riyu jaa , Riyu Pelek jaa, Pelek u Eba jaa. Eba u Sheela jaa, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Sheela u Kaana jaa. Kaana u Arafasa jaa. Arafasa u Sheem jaa, Sheem u Nuhu jaa. Nuhu u Lamek jaa, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lamek u Mɛtusela jaa, Mɛtusela u Nuhu jaa. Nuhu u Jared jaa, Jared u Mahalale jaa, Mahalale u kaana jaa. <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kaana u Enosh jaa, Kaana u Shiitu jaa, Shiitu u Adamu jaa, Adamu u Ɗalapa jaa.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ nta Yesɔ sisɨn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesɔ sɔatɛ a ɓooti Urudu a Ɗalapa suruni abi, Ɗalapa suru turɛ ntiu jalaa. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />A ɗɔ japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ ntau sisɨn dɔɔ laziti. A ɗauni piti kpai ji shavi wɔ ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ geliunɛ, &lt;&lt;akɛ ɔ̃nɛ Ɗalapa jaa, risi tarim u ɔ̃ borodi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Ama Yesɔ kasi nyanɛ, &lt;&lt; Ɗalapa nya ruubii shanɛ, ɓa borodi kɔ raa Shɔrɛ shɛli ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Kɛɗɔn japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ tuu sɔ̃n yɛnɛ ɗɔ wɔɔ a lapa a tasiu vinoshɛ̃- noshɛ̃ a koo piti kpai, geliunɛ, <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />&lt;&lt;N yɛn ãa vim piti kpai a kakani,&gt;&gt;Japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ geliunɛ, Shɔ ãn tɛttɔ a naa kpai, n yɛn ã sɔ̃njo shɔgbete n lɔyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />&lt;&lt;Vim piti kpai yɛ ɔ̃ a ɓɛɛ kɔ, kɛɗɔn, a kɛ sɔ̃sinɛ ang ɗekɨn a geeng nya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesɔ kasi nyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɗalapa nya ruu bi shanɛ, a gee jo Ɗalapa nya kɔ shɛli!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Kɛɗɔn japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ turɛ yɛnɛ Urushalima a pɔ̃u a yujaa Ɗa gakinɛ gagala, a geliunɛ, &lt;&lt; Akɛ ɔ̃nɛ Ɗa jaa, kɔbii nɛ aɗɔm a tasi tipi,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />aruumkɔ Ɗalapa nya ruubii shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɗalapa yɛ ãsi nya au jashonɛ lapayi bi nɛi kɔatɔ tɔ̃vɨn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Sha sɔ̃n nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɗa jashɔnɛ i yɛ sã a naatɔ aru a yɛ kɔdɔɔrɛ a tari.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ kasi nyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɗa nya ruu bi shanɛ, &lt;Mɔkɔ nta Uɓeyelapa a Ɗalapa sisɨn nɛ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Naa japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ yisi Yesɔ sisɨn ntanɛ a vi totot, a yau sɔ̃nrɛ.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ gau vishonɛ a Galili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yesɔ sɔɔ Galili rɛ a Ɗa suru ni bi, u ruubii ra tipiu piti kpai. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Mati shɔvi a ɗɔgbete Yahudawa i toli nya i nwaa ruu yɛ, kopiya bɛliutɔ.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ ɓɛ̃ɛ̃ Yesɔ ruubii a Nazara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ yurɛ yɛkɛ Nazara, ɗɔgbete bayɛ, naa gbete pɛli lee-lee yɛ a lee susunɛ yɛ jaa Ɗa gakinɛ. Yulapa a ɓali Ɗa nya ruubii. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Shɔ ãu vigbete shɔ bee vi aɗɔnyɛ Ɗa jashonɛ Ishaya beeyɛ a naa ɓɛlirɛ a kpaa ɗɔgbete shɔ beenɛ:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />&lt;&lt;Ɗa suru u a nkɔni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">aru ukɔ lɔnrɛ nɛn n ti shɔraayi Ɗalapa nya ruubii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Ukɔ shonrɛ nɛn dɔti nya nɛ shɔgbete shɔ mayi yɛ shɔ yayi naatɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">a shɔnogbãti i nɔɔ ɓɛlitɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">nɛn kali shɔgbete a shɔ meyi yɛ naatɔ,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />nɛn geli shɔ nɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:19">leu atɛ gbete Uɓeyelapa yɛ raa u shɔzɛ yɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Yesɔ li vigbete shɔ bee vi aɗɔnyɛ a ã shɔ jaa Ɗa tɛtti a naa a ɔ̃ kɛ tipi. Shɔgbeteu ai si jaa Ɗa i tɛ̃ɛriu nɔɔ bi pururu kpai, <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Naa Yesɔ geliyitɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɗa nya shanɛ ɔ̃nɛm nizɛ awɔ shoni nɔgbete ɔ ntarɛ shɔ ɓali yɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />I piti kpai i bɛliu rɛ a ɔ̃rikɛ vibii zaanɛ au nya shanɛni. I shanɛ, &lt;&lt; N ɓa Yusufu ɓɛjaa ɓaya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yesɔ geliyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;N zɛtɛtɔ ɔ yɛ gelin ruɓusinɛmtɔ, Likita gataa yuunɛ.&gt;&gt; Ɔyɛ gelin wɔsɔ̃n nɛ, nɛn yɛrɛ nɛ pɛli vibii zaanɛm jo a wɛrɛ koo naa a pɛli ɓam Kapanahum yɛ.<verse eid="LUK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />N gelɔɔ vimtɛ, &lt;&lt;Yesɔ sha sɔ̃n tɔti,&gt;&gt; Ɗa jashonɛ shɔ basiyi ɓa ai wɛrɛ koo niɓa.<verse eid="LUK 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Ɔ weshɔpɛ ang nya: si nizɛ kɔ suvɔyi isi waanɛ a Isirela a aɗagbete Iliya usi ɗɔnyɛ, mii siɓa saa taati au ɗiti 3.5 vaawɔ̃ɔ raa koou piti kpai. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />A nan ni piti Ɗalapa ji sho Iliya ɓa a Isireila shɔwɔ ɗɔbiini ɓa, ama shɔ sho Iliya ɓɛjo a suvɔyi ɗɔbii Zarefat a tipi Sidɔn. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Shɔzɛ waanɛ ai ɓoraa a vɔrɔ kobii shɔgbete isi a tipi Isirela aɗagbete Ɗa jashonɛ Iliya usi a ɗɔuniyɛ; &lt;&lt;I ji gati ɓa ko gbete, ama ɓɛɛ Naaman shɔ tipi Siriya kɔ gati ɓɛjo sheli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Naa shɔgbete isi a ɗɔgbete Yahudawa i toli nya i sha ruu ɗɔnyɛ i nta vimtɛ, i sisɨn lɛsi waanɛ, <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />I yulaparɛ i gɔ̃ Yesɔ rɛ i shɛshiu ɓili kati ai koomɔɔni, i turɛ i ntiu yukɔpɔ lapa aɗɔgbete shɔ marii komoo aɗɔnyɛ. i kasinɛ nɛi dɔ̃ukɛ a nyepuru tipidi. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Ama Yesɔ tɛɛ a mɔɔyi atette a sãu nyaba a yɛrɛ.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jaa gbete u a suru kɔ̃linɛ a ɗɔnni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ yɛkɛ Kapanahum, komɔɔ gbete a Galili yɛ, aɗɔgbete mati shɔvi a lee susunɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />I piti kpai viwu ɔ̃rikɛ vibii zaanɛ au vimatinɛ ni, aru Yesɔ nwanya a kakani.<verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />A ɗɔgbete Yahudawayi toli nya aru ruu waanɛ shɔwɔ siɗɔn a raamani bi; kɛɗɔn kanya a kakani, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />A shanɛ,&lt;&lt;A! kasi ivi a ukɔ ni viya, Yesɔ shɔ Nazara? A aɗɔm nɛn lɛsiutɔ ya? N zɛtɛtɔ ko a piya: Apɛ Ɗalapa jashonɛ lapa wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesɔ lasi, raamãu nyanɛ&lt;&lt; Zɨnya nɛ a shɛ jau biini yaunɛ!&gt;&gt; Raamau lɔki jau a tipi a shɛrɛ au biini ɓau lɛsinɛ niɓa.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Viwu ɔ̃ri shɔwi vibii zaanɛ ai geli zɔnɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔmpɛ ruu gbete pi nankɔ piya? Nya ãsinɛ a kakani jam ãsi raama nyanɛ i shɛkati i shɛrɛ viya!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Yesɔ nya ruubii raa ɗɔ a tipiu kpai.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ gati shɔzɛ waanɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesɔ yaa ɗɔgbete Yahudawayi i toli nya i nwa ruu ɗɔn kɛ a yɛ Siman wɛrɛ. Siman ɓɛkpɛni usi a vɔrɔ norini, shɔ nwari Yesɔ nyarɛ a yuuni. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yesɔ yɛrɛ a shi au nya ɗɔ roonɛ a geli noriu nɛ u yau naa nɛ, suu yulaparɛ a kãriyi vishanɛrɛ.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />A kɨntiuni a ɗaɗarɛ shɔgbete ai ɓɛsa isi vɔrɔyɛ i n-tiyi a Yesɔ ɗɔbii; pɔ̃si naarɛ i gatirɛ piti kpai. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Raama shɛki a shɔzɛ bi waanɛ, &lt;&lt;I kaa nyanɛ apɛ Ɗalapa jaa!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">Yesɔ ãsi raamawi nya ji yai ɓanɛ i nwanyarɛ ɓa, Aru viya i zɛtɛttɔ nɛu ukɔ kirisi.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ mati shɔvi a aɗɔgbete Yahudawayi i toli nya i nwa ruu ɗɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Naa dii katɛ Yesɔ ya komɔu kɛkati, a yɛkɛ ɗɔgbete yɛ ɔ̃ a yɔbm yɛ. Shɔ gau ɗɔ kãnɛrɛ, naa i kpautɛ i kasiu zãrinɛ nɛu yɛ ɗɔwɔɓa. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Ama Yesɔ geliyinɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ̃rintɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ n yɛrɛ n nwa Ɗa nya ruubii aru Ɗa kpati roonɛ a komɔɔ wɔyi, aru viya Ɗalapa shonnɛ n pɛlijo ukɔ a koo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ nwa Ɗalapa nya ruubii a ɗɔgbete Yahudawa i toli nya i nwa ruu aɗɔn a kotipiuni piti, aru pɛ ruumkɔ shɔ shourɛ.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ gaa u jadɔyi nya ɓaanɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Lewɔɔ Yesɔ u ɗɔ shinɛ a nya ɓooti wapo Janisara shɔ kpaa bi awuni māāni nɛi nta Ɗa nya ruubii. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Yesɔ zɛ latosi ziti a nya ɓooti; Ama shɔ jazɨng sãnɛyi i yarɛ i ɗɔɔ jang sɔkinɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yesɔ to a latosi wɔ gbete si Siman ɓɛɛ a geliunɛ nɛu gisi latosiu pɛ a yɛti mii. Yesɔ ɔ̃kɛ yɛti latosiu kɔ a mati shɔ ruu Ɗalapa kɛkn.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Naa yisi nya nwanɛtɛ, a geli Siman nɛ,&lt;&lt;Gisi latosiu pɛ tete mii jamba, mokɔ a mɛsayini ɔ tɛ̃ɛ jang a mii ɔ sã jazɨng pɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Siman kasi nyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Mashɔwɛrɛ,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;U ntalitɛttɔ zɨnzɨn u ji sã viwɔɔ ɓa, ama akɛ shanɛ nankɔ, n yɛn tɛ̃ɛ jangtɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />I tɛ̃ɛ jangrɛ i sã jazɨng waanɛ naa jang kɛ ntanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Kɛɗɔn i ɓaa ɓɛsa vishonɛyi nyarɛ nei arɛ nei pɔ̃siyi naa jo. I arɛ i yiki jazɨng a latosiu ziti piti lot naakɛ lunɛ yɛti mii.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Naa Siman Bituru zɛtɛ nankɔ, a taa yugboti a Yesɔ ɗekɨn a shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Yukati ang ɗɔbiini, Uɓeyelapa! N pɛ shɔruuvini!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Bituru a shɔ gãsiyini ɔ̃rikɛ vibii zaanɛ aru jazɨng waanɛ ai sãmini. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Si sɔ̃njo nankɔ a Yakubu a Yɔhana Zɛbadi ɓɛjaayi, Bituru shɔ nyakãsiriyi. Yesɔ geli Siman nɛ, &lt;&lt; Mokɔ zaanɛ; yunɛ dɔdɔrim yɛnɛ ɗekɨn a yɛ sãkɛ shɔzɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />I zaa latosi rɛ yɛnɛ nyasasa i yaa vi piti kpai i gɨn Yesɔ rɛ.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ gati shɔ vibii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Yesɔ usi a komɔɔ shɔwɔ siɗɔn vibii pɛliutɔ abi kpai. Naa zɛ Yesɔ tɛ, a ta yugbuti au ɗekɨn a gakiu rɛ nɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔmala, akɛ kasinɛ a gating pɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesɔ gɨn naarɛ a ɗɨurɛ.&lt;&lt;N kasitɛ,&gt;&gt;Yesɔ kasi nyarɛ. &lt;&lt;gatinɛ!&gt;&gt; Kɛɗɔn jau gatirɛ tɛ̃ɛ̃ti. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yesɔ ãsiu nyanɛ,&lt;&lt;Mokɔ geli shɔ wɔnɛ, ama sã nyabanɛ a yɛ shɔlansi ɗɔbii u zɛatɔ; ɗau tasi shɔnɛ a gatitɛ, a ã viyuu ãnɛ naa Musa ãsi nyayɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Ama Yesɔ ruubii raa koou piti kpai, mɔɔyi arɛ nɛi weshɔ au nya nɛu gatiyitɔ ai vɔrɔni. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Ama Yesɔ yɛ ɗɔgbete shɔɓa ɗɔmɓa, aru u gaki Ɗa.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ gati shɔ gbete u bi vɔ kagbete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />A lewɔɔ Yesɔ usi ɗɔɔ vimatinɛ, shɔ Farisiyayi a shɔmala nya ãsinɛyi isi ɗɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ a ɗɔuni, i shɛ komɔɔ a tipi Galili, Yahudiya a Urushalima. Uɓeyelapa kaka shɔ gatinɛ si Yesɔ ni. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Shɔwɔyi i tuu shɔgbete u bi vɔ kagbete a siri. I kã nyaba gbete i n-tiu wɛrɛu aru i pɔ̃u a Yesɔ ɗekɨn, <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />ama aru gbete shɔ si waanɛ, i ji kpaa nyaba gbete i yɛ tosiuyɛ ɓa. Kɛɗɔn i turɛ i n-tiu yujaa lapa gbete shɔ mau lapatɔ zali, i ɓɛli yujaaurɛ, i tosiu kɛkn a shɔ tete au sirini a Yesɔ ɗekɨn. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Naa Yesɔ zɛyi sisɨn ãnɛtɛ, a geli jaunɛ,&lt;&lt;N yasaa ruuvinitɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Shɔmala nya ãsinɛ a Farasiyayi i gaa shalinɛ ai nɔɔ nɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔm ɓɛɛ piya gbete sha vikɔ̃linɛ a Ɗa yuu piya! Ɗalapa kɔ sheli yasi shɔ ruuvinirɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesɔ zɛyi sisɨn tɛttɔ a geliyi nɛ,&lt;&lt;A ruu ivi ɔ lɛri awɔ sisɨn ɗɔkɔviya? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Pi shɔpi pɛlaa shɔ shanɛ,&lt;Ɗalapa yasaa ruuvinitɛ,&gt;ko Yulapanɛ a raarɛ? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />N yɛn tasɔɔtɔ nɛ, shɔzɛja u kaka shɔ ruuvini yasinɛ aɗɔn a koo.&gt;&gt;Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geli jaa gbete u bi vɔ kagbeteu nɛ,&lt;&lt;N gelaatɛ, yulapanɛ, a tuu siri a yɛ wɛrɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Tɛ̃ɛ̃ti jau yulaparɛ ai ɗekɨn piti kpai, a tuu siri gbete roo ɗɔnyɛ, a yɛ wɛrɛrɛ u ɗɔ Ɗalapa bɛlinɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />I piti kpai viu ɔ̃rii vibii-zaanɛ! A setini waanɛ, i bɛli Ɗalapa, i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;U zɛ vibii zaanɛ wɔɔ nɛmtɛǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ ɓaa leevi nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />A kɨntiuni, Yesɔ shɛrɛ a zɛ shɔ sabɛnɛ tɛnɛ, u niinɛ leevi, u ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛ a yɛti jaa sabɛnɛ tɛnɛ. Yesɔ geliunɛ,&lt;&lt;Gɨn npɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Leevi yulaparɛ, a yaa vi piti kpai a gɨn Yesɔ rɛ.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Kɛɗɔn Leevi pɛli Yesɔ vi yumusunɛ pẽniba au wɛrɛ, atette shɔzɛtiyi si shɔ sabɛnɛ tɛnɛ waanɛ a shɔ gãsiyini. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Farasiyayi a shɔmala nya ãsinyi gbete ai tete i hɨ Yesɔ jadɔyi nɛ. &lt;&lt;Aru ivi ɔ shaavi a ɓoonɛni a shɔ sabɛnɛ tɛnɛyini a shɔruuvini ni viya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesɔ kasinyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔ gbagbalayi kã likitan ɓa, ama see shɔgbete i vɔrɔyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />N jo a ɓa nɛn ɓaa shɔ wɔsɔ- wɔsɔ nya ɓa, ama n arɛ a shɔruuviniyi yuu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruu hɨnɛ ayuu nya manɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Shɔ gãsiyi i geli Yesɔ nɛ,&lt;&lt;Yɔhana jadɔyi i ma nyatɔ a lee-lee a Ɗa gakinɛni, Farasiyayi i jadɔyi i pɛli sɔ̃njo nankɔ; ama a jaɗɔyi i pɛli ɓɛjo ɓa aru iviya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesɔ kasiyinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ zɛnaa yɛ pɛlikati shɔ sotɛnɛ ɓɛsayi i ɓẽẽ vishanɛ alee yumusunɛ aɗagbete shɔ sotɛnɛ u doo a yini ya? Yɛ pɛli ɓa! <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Dii yɛ atɔ a shɔyɛ tuu shɔ sotɛnɛu ai ɗɔbiini, kɛɗɔn iyɛ ma nyatɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yesɔ geliyi ruɓusinɛ wɔsɔ̃n nɛː &lt;&lt;Shɔ gbete yɛ nta jafãrã sɔɔ nɛn rɛɛ u gbaali a wuniyɛ piya? Shɔu kɛ pɛlinɛ, yɛ nta jafãrã sɔɔtɔ, usɔu yɛ yɛɓa au gbaalini ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Shɔwɔɔ gbete yɛ tuu mii inabi sɔɔ nɛn tɛ̃ɛ a jaduuko gbaali yɛ ɓa, aru mii inabi sɔɔ yɛ sã jaduukoutɔ, mii inabiu yɛ zɨkitɔ, jaduuko u lɛsirɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Mii inabi sɔɔ ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ shɔ tẽu a jaduuko sɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Shɔgbete kɛ ɓoo mii inabi gbaalinɛ, yɛ kasiu u sɔɔ boonɛ ɓa.&lt;U gbaaliu pɛ tɔ̃vɨn,&gt;au shayɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ruu hɨnɛ ayuu lee susunɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />A lee susunɛ Yesɔ u ɗɔɔ tɛɛnɛ a dɔjaa. U jadɔyi kaki shɔ yuu vishaa, i kpãã a naa, i shaarɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Shɔ farasiya gãsiyi i hɨnɛ, &lt;&lt;Aru ivi ɔ pɛli vigbete nya ãsinɛ zãritɔ a lee susunɛ viya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesɔ kasiyinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ jo ɓali vigbete Dauda pɛliyɛ a ɗagbete i nta nwo a shɔbiiyini ɓaya? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />To wɛrɛ Ɗa a tuu borodi gbete shɔ ã Ɗalapa yɛ a shaarɛ, a ã u shɔ dɔɔranɛyi rɛjo. Shɔm ma nyaãsinɛ zãritɔ see shɔlansi ikɔyi shaarɛ sheeli.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ sɔ̃ri nya ruunɛ, &lt;&lt;Jashɔzɛ Uɓeyelapa ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ lee susunɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ gati jaa gbete au naa vɔyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Sɔ̃n a lee susunɛ wɔɔ Yesɔ yɛrɛ a mati shɔvi aɗɔgbete shɔ Yahudawayi i toli nya i nwa ruu aɗɔn. Jawɔɔ siɗɔn gbete u nakɨn vɔtɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Shɔmala nya ãsinɛ a farasiyayi gãsi i kã nyaɓa Yesɔ sãnɛ nɛ ji pɛliɓa vi ntoɓa, i taa nɔɔ au bi nɛi zɛkɨn ko yɛ gati shɔ kati a lee susunɛ niya. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Ama Yesɔ zɛyi sisɨntɔ a geli jau nɛ,&lt;&lt;Yulapanɛ a apɛ ɗekɨn mi.&gt;&gt;Jau yuurɛ a shirɛ a ɗɔuni. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geliyinɛ, &lt;&lt;N hɨ ɔ pɛ: Nya ãsinɛ shanɛ u pɛli ivi a lee susunɛni viya? Nya ãsinɛ kasinɛ shɔu pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng ya ko shɔu lɛsitɔya? Shɔu raa shɔ suruya ko shɔu nyɔtɔ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />A kɨn nɔɔ ai bi piti kpai, kɛɗɔn a geli jau nɛ,&lt;&lt;Gɨn naa nɛ.&gt;&gt;Jau pɛlirɛ, u naa gati sɔ̃nrɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />I sisɨn lɛsi waanɛ i gaakɛ nyaba kãnɛ vigbete iyɛ pɛli a Yesɔni.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ lɔu jashonɛ kopi atu ziti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />A ɗawuni Yesɔ gɛ̃kɛ kɔpɔ lapa ɗɔ Ɗa gakinɛ zɨzɨ dii gbɛɛsɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Naa dii kaatɛ, a ɓaa u jadɔyi nya a zɔ̃ kopi atu ziti ai tetteni, a ɓai nii nɛ jashonɛyi: <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Siman gbete baunɛ Bituru a ɓɛzɔ̃ Anduru, Yakubu, Yɔhana, Filibu, Batalomi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matiyu, a Toma, a Yakubu Alifa ɓɛjaa a Siman shɔgbete ɔrinɛ u tipiu kpaa ɔ̃nɛ yuu, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yahuda Iskariyoti Yakubu ɓɛjaa a Yahuda Isikariyoti au mɛli Yesɔ yɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ mati shɔvi a gati shɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Naa Yesɔ notɛ a yukɔpɔ au jashonɛyini, a shikɛ aɗɔ wati au jadɔyini waanɛ. Mɔɔ waanɛ gbete i ali a tipi Yahudiya a koomɔɔ Urushalima wɔyi shɛ a tipi Taya a Sɔdom gbete maani a nya waponi: <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />I arɛ nɛ i nta ruu a Yesɔ nya wɔɔ aru u gatiyi vɔrɔ abi, shɔgbete suru kɔ̃linɛ pɛli waanɛ i au ɗɔbii a gatirɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Shɔ piti i kasinɛ i ɗiu naa bi, kaka gbete shovi awuni yɛ shɛ au bi a gatiyirɛ piti kpai.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Binyatɔ̃nɛ a sisɨn vɨri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesɔ kn nɔɔ au jadɔyi bi a shanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">Vɔu tasɔɔ susãri biini shɔraayi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">kpati roonɛ a Ɗa wɛrɛ ɔ ɓɛkɔ!<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Vɔu tasɔɔ susãri biini shɔgbete i nta nwo dɔdɔrim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">a ɗekɨn ɔ yɛ putɔ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Vɔu tasɔɔ susãri biini shɔgbete ɔ ɗɔ sɨnɛ dɔdɔrim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">aru ɔ yɛ latitɔ ɗekɨn ni!<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Vɔu tasɔɔ susãri biini naa shɔji kasɔ ruubii ɓa, shɔkɛ ɓɛ̃ɛ ɔ ruubiinɛ, shɔkɛ dãwɔnɛ, shɔkɛ shanɛ nɛ ɔ shɔ kɔ̃linɛ aru n yuu shɔzɛja!<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Ɔ nta yɛti purutɔ shɔkɛ pɛlɔɔnɛ nankɔ, ɔ sasa a sisɨn puru, aru Ɗalapa pɔ̃sɔɔ vitɛ pẽniɓa a kolapa. mɛuruyi i pɛli Ɗa jashonɛyi sijo nankɔ.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Ama gɨn kɔnɛ ɗɔn ɓuruni shɔgbete ɔ vinaa ɗɔn dɔdɔrim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">ɔ nta tɔ̃vɨntɛ gboti!<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Gɨn kɔnɛ ɗɔn shɔgbete ɔ putɛ dɔdɔrim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">aru nwo yɛ sɨwɔtɔ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Gɨn kɔnɛ ɗɔn shɔgbete ɔ ɗɔɔ latinɛ dɔdɔrim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">ɔ yɛ lɛritɔ waanɛ sɨnɛni!<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Gɨn kɔnɛ ɗɔn shɔkɛ bɛlɔɔnɛ piti kpai; aru mɛuruyi i pɛli janyagadi nyayelinɛ si jo nankɔ.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔnopɔ̃yi ɔrinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />Ama n gelɔɔtɛ shɔgbete ɔ wesho a nyam: ɔ ɔri ɔ shɔnopɔ̃tɔ, ɔ pɛli shɔgbeteyi bẽẽ ɔ ruubii vitɔ̃vɨngtɔ, <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />ɔ tasi shɔgbete i wirɔɔ yɛ vɔɔ susãri biini, ɔ gaki shɔgbete i tasɔɔ raayɛ i Ɗa tɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Shɔgbete kɛ wāànɛ a kashinya, a tesiu kawɔ sɔ̃n u wāà sɔ̃nrɛ ɗɔn tɔti; shɔu kɛ raa fãrã bizunɛ nɛ a ãu a fãrã tosinɛ sɔ̃n tɔti. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Shɔgbete kɛ gaki vinɛ aa naa a ãutɔ, naa shɔgbeteu kɛ tuu a vinɛ, mokɔ hɨnɛ toti. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Pɛli shɔ jo vigbete a kasinɛ shɔu pɛlaayɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Akɛ ɔrinɛ shɔgbete ai ɔraayɛ, ɔ tɛɛ vɔɔ susãri kɛpi aru viya? Ko shɔ ruuviniyi ma i ɔri shɔgbete ai ɔriyɛ tɔ! <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Akɛ pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng nɛ shɔgbete ai pɛlaayɛkɔ sheli, ɔ tɛɛ vɔɔ susãri kɛpi aru viya? Ko shɔruuvini ma i pɛlitɔ nankɔ ni! <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Ɔ kɛ kɔ̃si vinɛ shɔgbete ai yɛ sɔraa yɛ ko sheli, ɔ tɛɛ vɔ susãri kɛpi aru viya? Ko shɔruuviniyi ma i kɔ̃si jo shɔgbete ai sɔriyi nɔgbete ai tɛsiyɛ! <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Ama ɔ ɔri ɔ shɔ nopɔ̃yitɔ, ɔ pɛliyi vitɔ̃vɨng; ɔ kɔ̃siyi vitɔ ɔ kã sɔrinɛɓa. Kɛɗɔn ɔyɛ kpa vigbete Ɗalapa pɔ̃sɔɔyɛtɔ, ɔyɛ ɔ̃ Ɗalapa kiriri jaa. Aruviya Ɗalapa pɛli shɔgbete i dɔ̃ri ɓayɛ tɔ̃vɨntɔ a shɔ fooyi ni. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Ɔ ɔ̃ shɔ -shɔraa ntanɛ naa ɔ Uɓeyelapa nta shɔ raayɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔkɔ yeeri shɔ ruunɛ yuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />Ɔ kɔ yeeri shɔ ruunɛ yuu, ɔkɔma Ɗalapa yɛ yeerɔɔ ruu ɓa yuuni ɓa; ɔkɔ tɔnɛ shɔwɔnɛ u shɔ ruuvini, Ɗalapa ma sha ɓa nɛ ɔ shɔ ruuvini ɓa; Ɔ yasi shɔ ruuvinitɔ, Ɗalapa ma yɛ yasɔɔ jo. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Ã shɔ vitɔ, Ɗalapa yɛ ãwɔ sɔ̃njo. Ɔ waa vimanɛ shɔyɛ yisɔɔ lot, yɛ tɛ̃ɛ̃ gãsi a ɓili, shɔ yɛ tɛ̃rɔɔ wɔ a naa nɔgbete ɔ yɛ sã yɛ. &lt;&lt;Waa vimanɛ gbete ɔ masi shɔvi awuni, Ɗalapa yɛ masa sɔ̃njo a ukɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yesɔ geliyi ruuɓusinɛ shɔm nɛ, Shɔ nɔgbãti yɛ sãri shɔ nɔgbãti wɔ laba ɓa; ko kɛ pɛlinɛ i yɛ tɛ̃ɛ a to. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Javimatinɛ yɛ tɛɛ shɔmala ɓa; ama javimatinɛ kɛ yisi vimatinɛ nɛ yɛ ɔ̃ kɛ naa u shɔmala.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />A zɛ jaa laa pɛ̃tɛ̃rɛ̃ pi kovi a mɛzɔ̃u nɔɔ, ama aji zɔ̃ laa gbete pẽniba aa nɔɔm ɓa viya? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />A yɛ geli mɛzɔ̃u pi kovi nɛ,&lt;&lt;Sokɔ, mazɔ̃ n zɔ̃sa jaa laa pɛ̃tɛ̃rɛ̃ pɛ aa nɔɔ,&gt;&gt; ama a ɓɛɛ a nɔɔ pẽniba aji zɛɓa? Shɔ -shɔ ɗakinɛmiyi! Ɔ gaa zɔ̃nɛpɛ laa pɛ̃niɓa gbete awɔ nɔɔmi, n ɗa ɔ kpa ɗɔ zɛnɛ kɨn tɔ̃vɨn a zɔ̃si mɛzɔ̃u ɓɛɛ kɛkɨn.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">laa au jaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />&lt;&lt;Laa tɔ̃vɨn yee jaa foo ɓa, ko laa kɔ̃linɛ u yee jaa tɔ̃vɨn ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Kopi laa gbete piya shɔ zɛu nii jo au jaa gbete yeeyɛ a hã sɨnti ɓa a kɔkɔni ɓa ko laa shaanɛ a bi kɔkɔ ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Shɔ tɔ̃vɨn ntijo vitɔ̃vɨng au ɗɔ visɨnɛ gbete au sisɨn, shɔ foo ntijo vifoo au ɗɔ visɨnɛ ni. Aru viya nya shajo vigbete shɛ a sisɨn yɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ kpẽnɛ a shɔrãn ɗɔ manɛyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />&lt;&lt;Ɔ ɓaa nya nɛ ivi &lt;Uɓeyelapa, Uɓeyelapa viya,&gt; ɔ pɛli sɔ̃nɓa vigbete n gelɔɔyɛ ɓa? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Shɔgbete kanɛ ang ɗɔbii kɛ wesho nɛ vigbete n geliuyɛ kɛ gɨnnɛ, N yɛn tasɔɔ nɔgbete ɔ̃yɛtɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />U naa shɔgbete au, gɨn dojaa, a gbã a dii gbikiri-gbikiri a gaa manɛrɛ ayuu tari. Mii lɔrɛ waa ɗɔurɛ ji zɨtiɓa, aru viya maa ɗɔu aɗɔ tɔ̃vɨn. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Ama shɔgbete kɛ wesho nɛ ang nya ji gɨn n nyaɓa u naa shɔgbete au maa wɛrɛ, jo gbã dɔjaa gbikiri-gbikiri ɓayɛ; naa miikɛ lɔnɛ kɛ waa wɛrɛunɛ yɛ zɨi kɛtɔ yɛ sãki ɗette-ɗette!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ gati yupɛ̃ni sɔja Roma jawɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Naa Yesɔ yisi shɔ nya nwaarinɛtɛ, a yɛkɛ Kapanahum. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Si yupɛ̃ni sɔja Roma wɔ jawɛrɛ gbete u shɔwɛrɛ ntau tɔ̃vɨntɔ; usi vɔrɔ kpɔkpɔk naa kɛ vɔnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Naa yupɛ̃niu nta Yesɔ ruubiitɛ, sho yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayirɛ nɛu ɓau nya u apɛ u gating jawɛrɛ pɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />I yɛ Yesɔ ɗɔbiirɛ i gakiu nɛ sɔkɔ-sɔkɔ, &lt;&lt;Aru jam tɔ̃ɔtɛ u kpaa a naa pɔ̃nɛtɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Ɔriu shɔ biyitɔ u au yuu maariu yahudawayi ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛtɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Yesɔ yɛrɛ a yini, U siɓa wɛrɛni kpɛkpɛlɛ niɓa a ɗagbete shɔ yupɛ̃ni sojau sho ɓɛsayi nɛi geliutɔ, Shɔmala, mokɔ yɔraa yuunɛ. N jo tesiɓa nɔgbete a yɛ ang wɛrɛɓa, <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />ukɔ sɨnrɛ n zɛnaa n ji tesiɓa n a ɗɔbii ɓa ang yuu ɓa. Ãsi ɓɛjo nya, n jawɛrɛ yɛ gatitɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />N kɔma n shɔwɔyi naa, sojayi sɔ̃njo ang naani. Nkɛ geli shɔmnɛ, &lt;&lt;U yɛnɛ! see yɛrɛ; Nkɛ geli shɔmnɛ, Apɛ!&gt;&gt; see arɛ; Nkɛ pɔ̃ng jawɛrɛnɛ, &lt;&lt;Upɛli vim! See pɛlirɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Naa Yesɔ nta vimtɛ, manaa kɛ a nosisɨng; a zaanɔɔ a mɔɔ gbete i gɨu dɔɔ yɛ bi a geliyi nɛ,&lt;&lt;N gelɔɔtɛ, n jo kpaa shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ wɔɓa naa jam niɓa, ko a tipi Isirela!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Shɔ yupɛ̃niu jashonɛyi sɔrɛ i kpau jawɛrɛu gatitɛ.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ yuusi suvɔwɔ jaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />A kɨntiuni Yesɔ yɛ komɔɔ wɔ gbete shɔ ɓaanɛ Nain, u jadɔyi i gɨu a dɔɔ a mɔɔyini waanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Naa atɛ a nya komɔɔ wuni, shɔ tuu vɔrɔtɛ shɔ kaanɛ awuni. suvɔ jaa sijo jau kɔ sheeli, suu sijo atette mɔɔ pẽniɓau ni. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Naa Uɓeyelapa zɛutɛ, ntau raatɔ au sisɨn ni, kɛɗɔn ageliunɛ, &lt;&lt;mokɔ sɨnɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Kɛɗɔn a zaarɛ a ɗinaa abi vɔrɔuni, shɔgbete i tuu vɔrɔyɛ i shirɛ. Yesɔ shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Jakasam! Yulapanɛ, nkɔng gelaarɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Shɔvɔrɔu yulaparɛ ɔ̃rɛ a gaa nya nwanɛrɛ, Yesɔ tuu rɛ ã ɓinirɛ a naa.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Seti pɛliyi piti kpai i bɛli Ɗa rɛ. I shanɛ&lt;&lt;Nkɔ janyagadi pɛ̃niba atɛ au teteǃ &gt;&gt; I sha sɔ̃n nɛ &lt;&lt;Ɗalapa au shɔbiiyi ɗɔ raanɛtɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Yesɔ ruubii raa tipi Yahudayi piti kpai.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɔhana shɔ Batizima jashɔnɛyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Naa Yɔhana jadɔyi i geliu vimtɛ piti kpai, a ɓa shɔzɛ ziti nya ai tete, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />a shoyirɛ a Uɓeyelapa ɗɔbii nɛi hɨu nɛ,&lt;&lt;Mɔkaa ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete Yɔhana shɔ Batizima ãnɛ nwanya au yuu nɛ yɛ arɛ ya? ko u ga shɔwɔ toti ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Naa i atɛ Yesɔ ɗɔbii i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Yɔhana shɔ Batizima ãnɛ shanɛ u hɨ a pɛ moka ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete shanɛ yɛ ayɛ ya, ko u ga shɔwɔya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />A ɗauni Yesɔ gati shɔvɔrɔi jitɔ waanɛ, a vɔrɔni noshɛ-noshɛ, suru kɔ̃linɛni a shɔ nɔgbãtiyini kpai. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Yesɔ kasi Yɔhana shɔ Batizima ãnɛ jashonɛ nyanɛ, Ɔ sɔnɛ ɔ geli Yɔhana shɔ Batizima vigbete ɔ zɛyɛ a shɔgbete ɔ ntayɛni; shɔ dɔɔ gbutuyi i raatɔ, shɔ vibiiyi i kpaa gatinɛtɔ, shɔ -shoo gbãtiyi i nta ruutɔ, vɔrɔ yulapatɔ, shɔraayi i nta Ɗalapa nya ruubii jo piti. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Ɗa tasi shɔgbete i jo kɔ dɔɔɓa ang yuuni ɓayɛ vɔɔ susãri biini.<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Akɨnti gbete Yɔhana shɔ Batizima ãnɛ jashonɛyi i yaa ɗɔutɛ, Yesɔ gaa nyanwaanɛ a Yɔhana yuu a mɔɔyi ɗekɨn:&lt;&lt;Ɔ yɛ Yɔhana ɗɔbii aɗɔgbete shɔ ɓa ɗɔm yɛ, ɔ kasi ivi zɛnɛ viya? Ɔ kasi wisi pẽniba gbete sɔrɔ rooriyɛ zɛnɛ ya? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Ɔ yɛ ɗɔ ivi zɛnɛ viya? Ɔ yɛ shɔgbete ai tosi fãrã tɔ̃vɨn ɗɔ zɛnɛ ya? Shɔgbete ai tosi iri fãrãn yɛ i nta tɔ̃vɨn i ɔ̃ a kpati nyaba wɛrɛ! <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Ɔ gelin pɛ, ɔ yɛkɛ ɗɔ ivi zɛnɛ viya? Ɗa jashonɛya? Nn nizɛ, ama ɔ zɛ vigbete au tɛɛ Ɗa jashonɛtɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Yɔhana u pɛ shɔgbete a shɔ beeu ruubii a labeenɛ nɛ: &lt;Ɗalapa shanɛ, n yɛn sho n jashonɛ aa ɗekɨn u ɓelɔɔ nyaba tɔ.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Yesɔ geliyi nɛ, n gelɔɔtɛ, Yɔhana tɛɛ jaa gbete shɔ yeeyɛ tɛttɔ piti kpai a banɛni. Ama shɔgbete u pɛ̃tɛ̃rɛ̃ a ɗɔu Ɗa roo kpatiyɛ tɛɛ Yɔhana tɛ banɛni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Mɔɔyi kpai i ntau ruutɔ; a shɔ saabɛnɛ tɛnɛyini i kasitɔ nɛ Ɗa nya ruubii pɛ ruu tɔ̃vɨn, i kasirɛ Yɔhana pɛliyi Batizima rɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Ama shɔ farisiyayi a shɔmala nya ãsinɛ ni i bɛ̃ɛ Ɗa nya ruubi gɨnnɛ a noni ijo tɛ Batizima gbete Yɔhana pɛli shɔyɛ ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesɔ yɛ ɗekɨn nɛ,&lt;&lt;N yɛn tɛsi shɔ jakɨntimiyi kɛ a iviya? I kɛ naa iviya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />I ɔ̃ naa jajayi gbete i ɔ̃ a nya lumoyɛ. I ɗɔ zɔ nya ɓaanɛ,&lt;&lt;U ɗɔgbete u warɔɔ viyumusinɛyɛ, ɔ ji sasaɓa! U tɔ̃ so vɔrɔ,!&gt;&gt; ɔji sɨnɓa! <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Yɔhana shɔ Batizima arɛ, ji shaaviɓa ji ɓo mii ɓa, ɔ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;U rãama biini&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Yesɔ shɔzɛ jaa arɛ, shaarɛ a ɓoorɛ,Ɔ shanɛ Ɔ kn nɔɔpɛ jam bi! U shɔvi ãnɛ roo a ɗɔɔ mii ɓoonɛ kɔzai, shɔ saabɛnɛ tɛnɛyi a shɔruuvini ɓɛsa. <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Ɗalapa sẽrɛ̃ au pɛlinɛni shɔyɛ zɛu tɔ̃vɨn jo a shɔgbete i tɛyɛ bi.<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ a Siman shɔ Farasiya wɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Shɔ farisiya wɔ ɓaa Yesɔ nya nɛu a ɗɔ vishanɛ au wɛrɛ, Yesɔ yɛu wɛrɛurɛ a ɔ̃rɛ a shaavirɛ awuni. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Aɗɔ komɔɔuni suwɔ si ɗɔuni shɔruuvini kpishik. suu ntarɛ nɛ Yesɔ ɗɔɔ vishanɛ a farisiya wɔɔ wɛrɛ, yulaparɛ a n ti noo gbete u sẽẽ ɗɔn tɔ̃vɨn sũru-sũru a jakotoro lot u saa yuni. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />A shi a Yesɔ knti, au ɗɔ dɔɔ, u ɗɔ sɨnɛ a miri tɛnɛni au dɔɔ. A sɔ̃u dɔɔ au suyu, a tɔ̃kiu dɔɔurɛ a tɛ̃riu nosũsũrɛ aɗɔn. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Naa shɔ farisiya wɔ zɛ vimtɛ, a sha au sisɨng nɛ,&lt;&lt;Jam si tɔnɛ nɛn ɔ̃ jo janyagadi nizɛ, si zɛ sumtɛ ko u piya, gbete au ɗiliu naa abiimyɛ; si zɛ suum ɔ̃nɛ ruuvini gbete ɔ̃yɛtɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesɔ nwanyarɛ a geliunɛ,&lt;&lt;Siman, n kasaa viwɔ gelinɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Siman kasi nyanɛ,&lt;&lt;Nn, shɔmala,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;gelinɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />&lt;&lt;Shɔwɔyi si ziti i kɔ̃ saa a shɔ saa nyakɔpɔ ãnɛyi naa,&gt;&gt;Yesɔ gaa nɛ. Shɔzɛ gbete wɔ kɔ̃ saa lazɔrɔ laamāāni ɓa māāni (500), shɔzɛwɔ kɔ̃ sɔ̃nkɛ lazɔrɔ laa ziti atu kop (50). <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Shɔwi nyaba saau sɔrinɛ si ɓa, a yasiyi saaurɛ piti kpai. &lt;&lt;Shɔu yɛ ɔriu ba piya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Siman kasi Yesɔ nɛ&lt;&lt;N zɛ naa, shɔgbete au ɓɛ si bang yɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Yesɔ risi Siman nyanɛ, a shatɛ tɔ̃vɨn, <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ zanɔɔ a suu bi a geli Siman nɛ,&lt;&lt;A zɛ suum tɛya? N a wɛrɛ, a ji ãng mii ɓa nɛn sodɔɔ awuni ɓa, ama suu sorin dɔɔtɛ au muru a sɔ̃li sɔ̃n au suyu. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />A ji kɔ̃tin naa ɓa biini ɓa, ama n ɓɛ tɔnɛ a wɛrɛm jo yang dɔɔ tɔ̃kinɛ ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />A ji n ting noo zeetung ɓa nɛn sɔ̃ yuu ɓa, ama suum sɔ̃rin dɔɔtɛ a nɔɔ sũrũsũrũ ni. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />N gelaatɛ, kɛɗɔn, u bɔrɔɔ ruuvini au pɛli ɓam shɔ yasiutɛ. Ama shɔgbete shɔ yasiu ruuvini pẽtẽrẽm yɛ tasi ɔrinɛjo fɛ̃ɛ̃.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Kɛdɔn Yesɔ geli suu kɛnɛ, &lt;&lt;A ruuvini shɔ yasaa tɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Shɔgbete ai ɔ̃ a ɗɔɔ vishaanɛ a ɗɔuniyɛ i geli zɔnɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔm pi au yasi shɔruuvini piya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Ama Yesɔ geli suu nɛ, &lt;&lt;A sisɨn ãnɛ raatɛ; yɛnɛ a yɛti puru ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Suu gbeteyi i gɨn Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />A kɨnti ni Yesɔ yuurɛ yɛkɛ komɔɔ wɔ pɛ̃niba a jakomɔɔ, a waa Ɗa nya ruu bi kɛ ɗɔu kɔ aru kpati roonɛ a Ɗalapa wɛrɛ. U jadɔyi kopi tu ziti isi a wuni. <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />A suyi gbete shɔ shɛshiyi suru kɔ̃linɛ a vɔrɔ bi: Marayamu(shɔgbete si shɔ ɓaunɛ Madaliya), shɔ gbete shɔ shɛshi u rãama manzii a biiyɛ; <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Yuwana, shɔgbete ɓɛvɔ Kuza yupɛ̃ni au shovi a kpati Hiridu wɛrɛ; wɔɔ Susana, a soro wɔyini waanɛ, i shovi ai vinaa i kã Yesɔ au jadɔyi nɛyi pɔ̃siyi naa.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruɓusinɛ a shɔ jaa lanɛ yuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Shɔ a Yesɔ ɗɔbii jitɔ a zɔnzɔn a komɔɔ-komɔɔ; naa shɔ mɔɔ pɛ̃niba i toli nyatɛ, Yesɔ geliyi ruɓusinɛm: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />&lt;&lt;Jawɔ shɛrɛ nɛn ɓa zee au jaa. Naa zɔ zɔvitɛ au jaayɛ, wɔyi tɛ̃ɛ̃ a nyaba, a ɗɔukɔ shɔ nalirɛ a dɔɔ, janoyi i arɛ shaarɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Wɔyi tɛ̃ɛ a ɗɔ tari, naa batɛ, i vɔkirɛ aru gbete ɗɔ zaza siɓa ɗɔuniɓa. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Wɔyi tɛ̃ɛ a ɗɔ kɔkɔ, i tarɛ i ba a nyazɔ a kɔkɔni, kɔkɔ ɓaliurɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Wɔyi tɛ̃ɛ a tipi tɔ̃vɨn; vishau tarɛ barɛ i shɛshi nɔɔ, laa maani ko-pi gbete piya.&gt;&gt; Yesɔ sɔ̃ri nyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ weshopɛ, ɔ sho ntanɛ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ ɗɔn ɔ ntarɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dɔɔ ruɓusinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Naa Yesɔ jadɔyi i hɨu dɔɔ ruɓusinɛtɛ? <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />A kasi nyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ruɓusinɛ aru Ɗa kpati roonɛ shɔ ãwɔtɛ, ama shɔwɔyi shɔ geli a yɛti ruɓusinɛ, a ruu gbete i yɛ kɨnnɔɔ i zɛɓa, i wesho i kpakaraɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ tadɔɔ ruɓusinɛ a shɔ jaa ɓanɛ yuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />Nkɔ gɨngɨn ruɓusinɛ yɛm: Zɔvi ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Ɗalapa nya ruubii. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Zɔvi gbete au shishi a nyaba ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete i ntarɛ; japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ tuu kati ai sisɨni aru gbete iyɛ ã sisɨng ɗɔn nɛ shɔyɛ rairɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Zɔvi gbete au tɛ̃ɛ a ɗɔ tari ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete ai nta ruum i tɛ a yɛti puru. Ama tɔɓa ai sisɨni ɓa; i ã sisɨng ji fɛ̃ɛ̃ wezee ama naa shɔkɛ ntai sisɨnɛ, i wesi tɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Zɔvi gbete au shishi a yɛti kɔkɔ ɓɛɛ shɔgbete ai kɛ nta ruumnɛ; ama vi kotipi a ruu vinaa ni a tɔ̃vɨn ntanɛni tui i sisɨng kati au yuuni i jaa jo zɔ̃ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Ama zɔvi gbete au tɛ̃ɛ a tipi tɔ̃vɨn yɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete ai kɛ nta ruumnɛ i sã a sisɨn tɔ̃vɨn i gɨn nyatɔ i yaa naa ɓa sete yee jaatɛ.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pitila gbete shɔ pɔ̃ a yulayɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />Shɔwɔ yɛ dɔɔ pitila ɓa nɛn kukitɔ a gbenti nyaɓari ɓa ko u sɨn a tɔ̃ ɗɔroonɛ ɓa, ama i sɨ a yuu laa, nɔgbete shɔ zɛ yaau yɛ naa shɔkɛ tɔnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Vigbete shɔkɛ ɓusinɛ shɔ shɛshi ɓilitɔ, a vigbete shɔkɛ kukinɛ shɔyɛ tasi a ɗɔsẽsẽ. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Ɔ kɔyuutɔ, a nɔgbete ɔ weshoyɛni, aru iviya shɔgbete ai vi ɗɔnyɛ shɔ ã vijo ikɔ, ama shɔgbete ai viɓa naani ɓa shɔyɛ raa jaa shɔgbete ai naa yɛ kati.<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ ɓini a ɓɛzɔyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Yesɔ ɓini a ɓɛzɔ̃yini i arɛ nɛi kasi Yesɔ zɛnɛ, ama ijo kpau zɛnɛ ɓa shɔ si bang. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Shɔwɔɔ geli Yesɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Mini a mɛzɔ̃yi i shitɛ ɓili i kasaa zɛnɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Ama Yesɔ kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Mani a mazɔ̃yini pɛ shɔgbete ai wesho a Ɗa nya ruu bi i shovi a wuniyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ lasi sɔrɔ nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Lewɔɔ ɗɔn Yesɔ to yɛti latosi au jadɔyi a geliyinɛ, &lt;&lt;U tɛ nya ɓooti da.&gt;&gt;Kɛɗɔn i yulaparɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Naa i ɗɔɔ yɛnɛ, Yesɔ to noroorɛ. Ɓai zɛnɛni ɓa sɔrɔ yuu a mii wapo a kakani mii gaa yɛti latosiu tonɛrɛ, siyi a yukɔnɛ waanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Yesɔ jadɔyi i yɛu ɗɔbiirɛ i nisiurɛ, i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Mashɔwɛrɛ, Mashɔwɛrɛ! Ukɛ sharu vɔnɛnɛ!&gt;&gt;Yesɔ yulapare lasi sɔrɔurɛ a mii ãlinɛni; i roorɛɛ, a ɗɔukɔ mii a sɔrɔni i shi shik. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Yesɔ geliu jadɔyinɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔ sisɨng ãnɛ kɛpiya?&gt;&gt;Ama ɔ̃rikɛ vibii zaanɛ a setini, i yɛ ɗekɨn a zɔ gelinɛni nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shom piya? Au ãsi sɔrɔ nya a sɔrɔ miini i gɨu nyatɔ piya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ gati shɔgbete rãma ni biiyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yesɔ au jadɔyi i tɛ nya ɓooti Garasa ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ tɛnɛ ɓooti Galili. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Naa Yesɔ notɛ, i kpɛsi zɔ a shɔwɔni a komɔɔ wuni shɔgbete au si a rãamani biiyɛ. Si rãamau ɔ̃ tɛttɔ au bi tɛ̃ɛtɛ̃ɛ si to ranɛtɛ a tɔ̃ɔ wati ɔ̃ ɓa a wɛrɛ ni ɓa, si ɔ̃li a yusàà. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Naa zɛ Yesɔ tɛ, kaa nya a kakani, a nwesi au dɔɔ, a shati nyanɛ,&lt;&lt;Yesɔ, Ɗalapa pẽniba gbete vitɛu kaka ɓa jaa! A kasi ivi ang nkɔni viya? N gakaatɔ, mokɔ tasin raanɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Sha shom aru Yesɔ ãsi suru kɔ̃linɛ nya nɛu shɛ kati jau biini. Aru rãamau lɔriu tɛttɔ a tipi lee- lee, si shɔ mau dɔɔ tɛttɔ a naani a saganya a jaa, ama lɔɔri saganyau tɔ rãamayi i gɔ̃kiurɛ i n-tiu ɗɔgbete laa ɓa bang ɓayɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesɔ hɨunɛ,&lt;&lt;A niinɛ iviya?&gt;&gt;jau kasi nyanɛ&lt;&lt;N niinɛ &lt;Lijiyon,&gt; &gt;&gt;aruviya rãamayi au bi waanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Rãmãwi gaki Yesɔ nɛ, ukɔ ɗɔ̃yinɛ a too gbikiri-gbikiri. <verse eid="LUK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Gãnya isi mɛsɛ̃ɛ a ɗɔuni maani, i ɗɔ nya shaanɛ a dɔkɔpɔ. Kɛɗɔn rãamawi i gaki Yesɔ rɛ nɛu ãi naa a gãnya wayi ɗɔbii, a ãi naarɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />I shɛrɛ a jau biini i tɔkɛ gãnyawi bikɔ. A ɗɔuni gãnyawi piti kpai i yuurɛ yɛnɛ yɛti mii wapo. <verse eid="LUK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Shɔgbete i ga gãnyawi i zɛ vigbete a ɗɔɔ yɛnɛyɛtɔ, kɛɗɔn i yurɛ i dɔti nya a komɔɔ a yɛti jauni piti kpai. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Shɔ shɛɓili nɛi zɛ vigbete shɔ pɛliyɛ, naa i atɛ Yesɔ ɗɔbii, i kpaa shɔgbete rãamayi shɛu biiyɛ ɔ̃tɛ a Yesɔ dɔɔ, tosi fãrã gbete u yɛti kasiyɛ, i nta seti piti kpai. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Shɔgbete i zɛ viuyɛ ikɔyi geli shɔ nɔgbete jau gatiyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Kɛɗɔn shɔ ɗɔwi piti kpai i geli Yesɔ nɛ u yuu kati a koouni, aru i nta setitɔ waanɛ. Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ to yɛti latosi a ya ɗɔurɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Shɔgbete a rãama shɛ au biiyɛ gaki Yesɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt;N yɛpɛ mokɔni.&gt;&gt;Ama Yesɔ ãu naa a kawɔ, a shanɛ, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />&lt;&lt;Yɛ wɛrɛnɛ a geli shɔ vigbete Ɗalapa pɛlaayɛ.&gt;&gt; Jau to yɛti komɔɔ, u ɗɔgbete geli shɔ vigbete Yesɔ pɛliuyɛ.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yayiru ɓɛjaa soro a suugbete ɗinaa a Yesɔ fãrã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Naa Yesɔ sɔtɛ a tɛnɛ nya ɓooti wapo da, shɔwi i tɛu naa kaziti, aruviya isi a ɗɔgbete i gauyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Ama shɔwɔ ɗɔn shɔ ɓaunɛ Yayiru arɛ; usi yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛ. A nwesi a Yesɔ dɔɔ a gakiu rɛ nɛu yɛn wɛrɛ, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />aruviya u jasoro ɗɔn gbete, u saa kopi atu ziti, kɛ vɔnɛ. Naa Yesɔ yɛtɛ yɔbm, shɔ kɨntiu kɛ tete. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Ai tetteni suwɔɔ ɗɔn au sharaa kpaa sigani saa kopi atu ziti suu nisi vigbete au wuniyɛ kpai a shɔ likitayi naa, shɔwɔ ji gatiu ɓa ai tete niɓa. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Suu arɛ shɔ tete a ɗii Yesɔ nya fãrã a kakɨnti, u siga shirɛ nɔgbete. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesɔ hɨnɛ,&lt;&lt;Pi ɗin naa pi bi piya?&gt;&gt;Kopiya pa nya ɗɔn, Bituru shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔmala, shɔwi i kɨntaatɛ a tete i ɗɔgbete i bɔ̃ɔ̃ ayɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Ama Yesɔ shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔwɔ ɗin naatɛ biini, n zɛtɛttɔ aɗagbete kaka shɛ ang biiyɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Suu zɛrɛ naa shɔ zɛu tɛttɔ, a shɛrɛ zanɛni a ta a yugboti a Yesɔ dɔɔ. A shɔ noo piti kpai, a geliu vigebte sɨurɛ ɗiu fãrã yɛ a nɔgbete gatiyɛni. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yesɔ geli suu nɛ,&lt;&lt;Jasum, a sisɨn ãnɛ pɔ̃tɛ a gatitɛ. Yɛnɛ a sisɨn puru.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Aɗagbete Yesɔ usi ɗɔ ruum shanɛ, jashonɛwɔ arɛ a yupɛ̃ni wɛrɛ a geli Yayirunɛ,&lt;&lt;A jaa vɔtɛ, mokɔ yɔri shɔmalanɛ tɔkɨn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Ama Yesɔ ntarɛ a geli Yayiru nɛ,&lt;&lt;Moka nta setinɛ; ã ɓɛjo sisɨng, yɛ gatitɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Naa to wɛrɛutɛ, ji yaa shɔwɔ ɓa nɛu to a wuni niɓa see Bituru,Yɔhana, Yakubu, a jau ɓeye a ɓini. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Shɔgbete isi ɗɔuyɛ i ɗɔ sɨnɛ a lɛrinɛ a yuu jauni. Yesɔ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ sɨn ɓa; jau jo vɔɓa jasuu ɓɛji ɗɔ noro roonɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />I piti kpai i latiu tɔ, aruviya i zɛtɛttɔ nɛ jau vɔtɛtɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Ama Yesɔ tuu jau a naa a ɓau nyarɛ,&lt;&lt;Yulapanɛ majaa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />U suru sɔɔrɛ, jasuu yulaparɛ nɔgbete, see Yesɔ ã nyanɛ shɔu ãu vishanɛnɛ u shapɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />U ɓeye a ɓini ɔ̃rikɛ vibii zaanɛ, ama Yesɔ ãsiyi nyanɛ ikɔ geli shɔwɔnɛ aru vigbete a shɔ pɛlimni.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ sho u jaɗɔyi kopi tu ziti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Akɨnti gbete Yesɔ ɓaa u jaɗɔyi kopi tu ziti nya ɗɔgbete, a ãyi kaka gbete i yɛ shɛshi suru kɔ̃linɛ i gati ko-pi vɔrɔ shɔpiya, <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Kɛɗɔn a shoyirɛ nɛi yɛrɛ i nwari shɔ ruu Ɗa kpati roonɛ, i gati shɔ vɔrɔyi. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Yesɔ geliyi nɛ: &lt;&lt;Ɔkɔɔ tuu viwɔnɛ a naani ɔkɔɔ sa labaanɛ a naani, ko jaduu, ko vishaanɛ, ko saa, ko fãrã wɔɔ ɔkɔɔ tunɛ a naani. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />wɛrɛ gbete ɔkɛ tonɛ shɔkɛ tɛwɔ naa nɛ aɗɔn ɔ ɔ̃ a ɗɔukɔ anɛ leegbete ɔ yaa komɔuyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Ɗɔgbete shɔji tɛwɔɔ naa ɓa kpai, ɔ yaa koutɔ ɔ kuti zaburu gbete awɔ dɔɔ ɔ yɛrɛ, zaburu sɔ̃nɛ ukɔ ɔ̃kɛ naa shɔ gɔyi yuusho.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ jadɔyi i shɛrɛ i raki jakomɔɔ piti kpai i ɗɔyi nwari shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn i gati shɔvɔrɔyi ko-pi ɗɔpiya.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hiridu yuu rinɛ aru Yesɔ ko ɔ̃rɛ piya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Aɗagbete Hirudu kpati Galili, nta vigbete a ɗɔɔ yɛnɛtɛ, u yuu rikutulu, aru shɔ gãsiyi i shanɛ Yɔhana shɔ Batizima ukɔ yulaparɛ a suruni, <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />shɔwɔyi shanɛ Ɗa jashonɛ Iliya ukɔ shɛrɛ, shɔwɔyi sha sɔ̃njonɛ shɔzɛ gbete a tete Ɗa jashonɛ tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃ ukɔ yurɛ a suruni. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Hirudu shanɛ, &lt;&lt; Nkɔng pɔ̃rɛ shɔ ko Yɔhana yuutɛttɔ. Shɔ gbete nkɛ nta ruunɛ au yuunimi kɛpiya?&gt;&gt;Hirudu pɛli ɓɛɛjo nyaɓa nɔgbete yɛ zɛ Yesɔ yɛ.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ shaari shɔzɛ laa ziti tu kopi ɓa maani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Akɨnti gbete Yesɔ jashonɛyi i sɔtɛ aɗɔgbete i yeuni i geli Yesɔ vigbete i pɛliyɛ piti kpai. A tuyirɛ i yɛ komɔɔ gbete shɔ ɓaanɛ Besaida ji yuu. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Naa mɔɔwi ntatɛnɛ Yesɔ a ɗɔwa i gɨurɛ yɛnɛ ɗɔuni. Yesɔ tɛyi naarɛ a nwarii ruu Ɗa kpati roonɛ, gati shɔgbete yi kã gatinɛyɛ kpai.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Naa ɗa yɛtɛ a ɗɔɔ yinɛ, Yesɔ jaɗɔyi kopi tu ziti i au ɗɔbii i shanɛ, Yaa mɔɔyi naa nɛ, aru i yɛrɛ i kãli vishaanɛpɛ a jakomɔɔ a jaa gbete i ɗɔmiyɛ a ɗɔɔ roonɛni, aru shɔ ɓa a ɗɔnni ɓa<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Ama Yesɔ geliyinɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔkɔɔ ãi vishaanɛ jo i shaapɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">I kasinyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Vigbete u a wuniyɛ borodi maani sheeli a jazɨn ziti,&gt;&gt; a kasinɛ ukɔɔ yɛrɛ u wori bɔrɔ mɔɔmiyi vishaanɛ piti kpai ya? <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Vɔshɔ gbete isi a ɗɔuyɛ mɛnɛ laa ziti tu kopi ɓa maani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Yesɔ geli u jadɔyinɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ pɔ̃ mɔɔyinɛ i ɔ̃nli a kn kn ko pi kn gbete piya u ɔ̃ shɔzɛ laa ziti tu kopi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Akɨnti gbete Yesɔ jadɔyi i pɛlitɛ nagbete geliyiyɛ, mɔɔyi ɔ̃likɛ tipi. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yesɔ tuu borodi maanirɛ a jazɨng zitini a kɨnnɔɔ lapa, a dɔ̃ri Ɗa a dalirɛ, kɛɗɔn a ã u jaɗɔyi nɛi vɔsi mɔɔyinɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Shɔzɛ piti kpai i shaarɛ i tesiyirɛ i yaa gãsi, Yesɔ jaɗɔyi i toli u dalinɛ ɓuti kopi tu ziti.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bituru ã tɔ̃vɨn nɛ Yesɔ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ kirisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Lewɔɔ Yesɔ u si ɗɔɔ Ɗa gakinɛ a yɔbm, u jaɗɔyi i au ɗɔbii, Yesɔ hɨnɛ,&lt;&lt;Mɔɔyi shalinɛ n piya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />I kasiunya nɛ,&lt;&lt; Shɔ gãsi i shanɛ mɔkaa Yɔhana shɔ Batizima ãnɛ; shɔwɔyinɛ Ɗa jashɔnɛ Iliya; shɔwɔyi sɔ̃njonɛ, shɔzɛ gbete a tete Ɗa jashonɛ tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃ uku sɔrɛ a suruni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Yesɔ hɨyinɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔkɔɔ fa ɔ shabɛɛnɛ nkɛ piya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Bituru kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Mɔkaa Kirisi, shɔgbete shɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ nwanya ayuu u raaɓoonɛ a vɔnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ gɔ̃yi yuusho waanɛ nɛ ikɔi geli shɔwɔnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />A geliyi sɔ̃nnɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ Shɔzɛja u ɓɔraa waanɛ shɔpẽni ɗɔlaa i bɛ̃u ruubiitɔ, jinankɔ yupɛ̃ni jaa Ɗa a shɔmala nya-ãsinɛ Musa i yɛ bẽu ruubiitɔ, ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ shɔ nyou vɔrɔ ama a knti lee taati yɛ yulapa a suruni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geliyinɛ: Shɔgbete kasing gɨnnɛ piti kpai ɔ̃riutɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ u bẽu yuutɔ,&lt;&lt;U tɛ raaɓoonɛ gbete yɛ ɓoo ang yuu nakaziti ko-pi lee piya u gɨnrɛ&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Shɔgbete kɛ tɔnɛn kasin suru raanɛ, u suru yɛ raariu naatɔ, ama a surukɛ raananɛ ang yuu a yɛ kpaa sɔ̃ntɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Shɔzɛ yɛ kpaa ivi tɔ̃vɨn a kotipim piti kpai u tɛu sururɛ viya? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Shɔukɛ nta usẽnɛ ang ruubii dɔdɔrim ang vimatinɛ ni, Nkɔng Shɔzɛja n kanɛ aɗɔ bassinɛ a ɓeye ɗekɨn a Ɗa jashonɛ lapa wɔsɔ-wɔsɔni n yɛn ntau usẽjo. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />N gelɔɔtɛ nizɛ, shɔ gãsiyi gbete i ɗɔɔ shinɛ aɗɔm i yɛ vɔɓa setɛ i zɛ Ɗa kpatinɛ roonɛtɛ.<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ bi kɔsinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Si mɛnɛ dii maantaa a Yesɔ sha ruumyɛ, Yesɔ tuu Bituru, Yɔhana a Yakubu a gẽ kɔpɔ ɗɔɔ Ɗa gakinɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Aɗagbete Yesɔ u ɗɔɔ Ɗa gakinɛ, kɛɗɔn u nɔkɨn kɔsirɛ, u fãrã rii puru kpɛlɛng-kpɛling. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />A ɗɔukɔ tɛ̃ɛ̃ti shɔzɛ ziti i shɛrɛ i ɗɔɔ nyanwanɛ awuni, ikɔi si Musa a Iliya, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />i shɛ a kolapa bassinɛ, i ɗɔgbete i nwanya a Yesɔni aru nya gbete yɛ vɔyɛ u yisi nya Ɗalapa vishonɛ gbete ãuyɛ, gbete yɛ vɔɔ a Urushalimayɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Bituru au shɔ dɔɔranɛyi gãsiyini isi a a nɔrɔ gbikiri-gbikiri, ama i yulapa i zɛ Yesɔ basinɛtɔ a shɔzɛ zitiyini gbete i shi a Yesɔni. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Naa shɔwi i yaa Yesɔ ɗɔbii yɛ, Bituru geli Yesɔ nɛ,&lt;&lt;Mashɔwɛrɛ, pɛ vitɔ̃vɨng gbete u a ɗɔnkɔ. u yɛ tɔ̃ri taali ɗɔɔ taati--gbete a ɓɛɛ gbete Musa ɓɛɛ gbete wɔsɔ̃n Iliya ɓɛɛ.&gt;&gt;(Bituru ji zɛ vigbete shayɛ ɓa.)<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Si Bituru doo a ɗɔɔ nyanwanɛ sabuu kukiyi nyawu, naa sabuu kukiyitɛ Yesɔ jaɗɔyi i nta seti rɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Yenya shɛ a yɛti saɓuukɔ gbete shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔnkɔ ɔ̃rɛ majaa, gbete n lɔyɛ; ɔ weshotɔ au nyani.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Naa yenyau shiitɛ, Yesɔ u jo a yɔbm sheeli a ɗɔuni. Yesɔ jaɗɔyi i ɔ̃ a nyani, iji geli shɔwɔ ruu vigbete i zɛyɛ a ɗauni ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ gati javɔshɔ gbete u suru kɔ̃linɛ a biini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />A dii gadi Yesɔ au jaɗɔyi taati i ɗɔgbete i nɔ a kɔpɔ, kɛɗɔn mɔɔ waanɛ i arɛ i kpɛsi Yesɔ rɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Jawɔɔ a yɛti mooyi ɓa nya a kakani a shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔmala, n gakaatɔ nta majaa raajɔ, n jaa ji ukɔ sheeli. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Zɛpɛ suru-kɔ̃linɛ sãurɛ, lewɔɔ suruu pɔ̃urɛ u kaa nya-vɔɔ lapa-lapa, Suruu zaautɔ a shɛshiu pupuru a nya, yau naa ɓa nɛu yɛrɛ ɓa ntariu nɔrɔ abi waanɛǃ <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />N gaki a jaɗɔyi i shɛshi suru kɔ̃linɛu pɛ, iji zɛnɔɔ ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesɔ kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ jakɨntimiyi gbete ɔ sisɨn anɛ ɓang a shɔ lanɛmiyi, n yɛn ɔ̃kɛ saa nɛkɨn a ɔkɔɔni viya? Ɔ kasinɛn ɔ̃kɛ pikovi a ɔkɔɔni n ɗan yawɔrɛ viya?&gt;&gt; Kɛɗɔn a geli jau nɛ, &lt;&lt;N ti mɛjaunɛ yɛm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Naa javɔshɔu ɗɔɔ anɛ suru kɔ̃linɛ turɛ a lou a tipi, u bi a ɗɔɔ zaanɛ. Ama Yesɔ lasi suru kɔ̃linɛrɛ, a gati jaaurɛ a ãu ɓeyerɛ a naa. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Shɔzɛ piti kpai ɔ̃rii vibii zaanɛ aru gbete i zɛ Ɗalapa kaka shɔgbete vitɛu kaka ɓayɛ.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesɔ nwanya sɔ̃n au ruu vɔnɛ</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Si shɔ doo ɗɔɔ zaanɛ a vigbete Yesɔ pɛliyɛ, Yesɔ geli u jaɗɔyi nɛ, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />&lt;&lt;Ɔ wesho tɔ̃vɨn, ɔkɔɔ suki vigbete nkɛ gelɔɔ nɛmnɛ! Shɔyɛ mɛli Shɔzɛja kɛtɔ a shɔzɛ naa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Ama u jadɔyi iji zɛ vigbete Yesɔ nwanya a yuuni ɓa. Shɔ ɓusu ruumtɔ aru gbete i yɛ zɛrɛ, ikɔ ma i nta seti Yesɔ hɨntɔ ayuu ruumni.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pi ɔ̃rɛ pẽniɓa piya?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ jaɗɔyi i gaa nya masinɛ ai nɔɔ nɛ pi ɔ̃rɛ pẽniɓa ai tetteni piya. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesɔ zɛ vigbete i lɛri ai sisɨn tɛttɔ, kɛɗɔn a tuu jajja pẽtẽrẽ a shiriu a ɗekɨn. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Yesɔ geli u jaɗɔyinɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔgbete kɛ tɛ jajja pẽtẽren naa nɛ ang nii tɛpɛ nkɔng, shɔgbete kɛ tɛng naa nɛ tɛ shɔgbete shong-yɛ, shɔgbete ɔ̃rɛ pẽtẽrẽ au tetteni piti kpai ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ pẽniɓa tɛɛ gãsitɛ kpai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yɔhana shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Mashɔwɛrɛ, u zɛ jawɔ kɛ shɛshi suru kɔ̃linɛ aa nii, u zãruutɔ aru gbete u ɓa au tetteni ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yesɔ kasinya nɛ, ɔkɔɔ zãruunɛ, aru shɔgbete ji masi nya ɓa ukɔɔni ɓa upɛ u ɓɛɛ.<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ Samariya jakomɔɔ i ɓẽẽ Yesɔ naa tɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Naa Yesɔ ɗagbete yɛ gẽ kolapa atɛ maani, kɛɗɔn a ã sisɨn rɛ yɛkɛ Urushalima. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Sho jashonɛyi a ɗɛkɨn, jashonɛyi tokɛ jakomɔɔ a Samariya, aru i tɔ̃riu vi tɛlɛ, <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />ama shɔ jakomɔɔwi i bɛ̃ɛ̃ Yesɔ naa tɛnɛtɔ, aru siyi zɛtɛttɔ Yesɔ pɔ̃ Urushalima yɛnɛ ɗekɨn. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Naa Yesɔ jaɗɔyi Yakub a Yɔhana i zɛtɛ nami i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa a kasinɛ u ãsinya yaa u shɛ lapa u shayirɛ ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Ama Yesɔ rinɔɔ a lasitɔ, <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />kɛɗɔn Yesɔ au jaɗɔyini i yɛkɛ jakomɔɔ wɔɔ.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Raɓoonɛ a Yesɔ gɨnnɛni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Aɗagbete Yesɔ au jaɗɔyini i ɗɔɔ ranɛ a nyaba, kɛɗɔn jawɔɔ geli Yesɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt; N yɛn gɨn atɔ ɗɔgbete akɛ yɛnɛ piti kpai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesɔ risinya nɛ, zakula ma i too aɗɔn, janɔɔyi i ɗɔɔ roonɛ aɗɔn, ama Shɔzɛja u ɗɔɔ roonɛ ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 9:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Yesɔ geli jawɔɔ nɛ &lt;&lt;Gɨnnɛ. &gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Ama jau risinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa, n yɛpɛ n gbã maye pɛtɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesɔ kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt; yaa vɔrɔyi i gbã zɔji ai nɔɔ, ama yɛrɛ a nwari shɔ Ɗa ruu kpati roonɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Shɔ wɔ sɔ̃n ɗɔn shanɛ, Uɓeyelapa, n yɛn gɨn atɔ, ama n yɛrɛ n vasi n shɔwɛrɛyi nya pɛgo.<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesɔ geliu nɛ, shɔgbete sã naatɛ a laɓuti jalanɛ u ɗɔɔ zaanɛ kɛ gbɛɛ nɔɔnɛ akɨntini, Ɗa lakpati ɔ̃nɛ ɓau ɓɛɛ ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ sho u jadɔyi laa taati au jaa kopi tu ziti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Akɨntini Yesɔ lɔ shɔwɔyi laa taati au jaa kopi tu ziti (72) a shoyirɛ ziti-ziti, nɛi yɛ ang ɗekɨn a komɔɔ a ɗɔgbete kasi yanɛ yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Yesɔ geliyinɛ, Visha gbete shɔ yeerɛ waanɛ, ama shovishonɛyi i ɓa bang ɓa. Aruumkɔ ɔ gaki Uɓeyelapa u dɔ̃ shɔgbete yɛ yeruu visha, i toliurɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Ɔ yɛnɛ, n showɔrɛ naa jamɛrɛ̃ɛ̃ atette viɓiliyi. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Ɔkɔɔ tuu lazɔrɔ nɛ naani ko kurãtinɛ a naani; wɔsɔ̃n ɔkɔɔ gee shɔwɔyi nyanɛ dɔkɔkɔ a nyabani.<verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />&lt;&lt;Ɔkɛ to ko wɛrɛ shɔpiyanɛ, vi gbete ɔ gaa shanɛyɛ, Ɔ̃nɛ binyatɔ̃nɛ u ɔ̃ a wɛrɛni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Shɔ binyatɔ̃nɛ ɔrinɛ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ a wɛrɛuni, kɛɗɔn ɔ nya geenɛ binyatɔ̃nɛ yɛ ɔ̃rɛ awuni, shɔ binyatɔ̃nɛ ɔrinɛ ji ɔ̃ ɓa a wɛrɛni ɓa, ɔ nya geenɛ binyatɔ̃nɛ yɛ sɔɔ sɔ̃n ɔ ɗɔbii. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Ɔ ɔ̃ a wɛrɛukɔ shɔ kɛ tɛwɔɔ naa nɛ yɛ setɛ ɔ yaa koutɛ, vigbete shɔ kɛ ãwɔnɛ ɔ sharɛ ɔ ɓoorɛ aru kopiya shɔ shoriu jou vi ɗɔnwanɛ, ama ɔkɔɔ ranɛ wɛrɛ -wɛrɛ.<verse eid="LUK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Komɔɔ gbete ɔ toyɛ piti kpai shɔkɛ tɛ ɔ naa nɛ, ɔ sha vigbete shɔ n-tɔɔyɛ piti kpai. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Ɔ gati shɔ vɔrɔtɔ gbete a ɗɔuni ɔ geliyinɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɗa kpati roonɛ atɛ māāni awɔ ɗɔbii.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Ama ɔkɛ to komɔɔnɛ gbete shɔ ji tɛwɔɔ naa ɓa, ɔ yɛ a nyaɓa ɔ shanɛ, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />aru gbete ɔ bẽẽ u ruu ntanɛtɔ, ɔ zaburu ko gbete rɛɛ au dɔɔ ma u kutɔɔtɛ, ama ɔ zɛtɔnɛ Ɗa kpati roonɛ atɛ awɔ ɗɔbii māāni. <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />N gelɔɔtɛ a lee gadi shɔ sɔdomyi Ɗalapa yɛ nta raa ba ikɔ, u tɛɛ komɔɔ watɔ!<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ yuukɔnɛ aɗɔn Komɔɔ gbete i ji yaa ruuvini ɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />Ɔ kɔɔ yuutɔ, korazin! ɔ kɔɔ yuutɔ, Besaida! Aru vibii zaanɛ gbete shɔ tasɔɔ yɛ shɔ si tasi Taya a sɔdom, i si kɔsi sisɨntɛ tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃, i tosi fãrã hɨmri a tɛ̃ɛ̃ pnti ai yuu, aru u tasinɛ i yaa ruuvinitɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />A lee gadi Ɗalapa yɛ nta raa ba shɔ Taya a sɔdom u tɛɛ ɔ ɓɛɛtɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Shɔzɛ gbete i a kapanahum ɔ sinnɛ a sisɨnni nɛ Ɗalapa yɛ tɛwɔ naatɔ kunyasini ya? Yɛ pɛli ɓa, ɔ yɛ to yaa wɛrɛ.<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Yesɔ geliu jadɔyi nɛ, shɔ gbete kɛ weshonɛ awɔ nyani, wesho ang nya; shɔ gbete kɛ bɛ̃ɛ̃ ɔnɛ bɛ̃ɛ̃ nkɔng; &lt;&lt;ama shɔgbete kɛ bɛ̃ɛ̃ n ruubiinɛ bɛ̃ɛ̃ shɔgbete shongyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ jadɔyi laa taati au jaa kopi tu ziti i sɔnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Shɔzɛ laa taati au jaa kopi tu ziti (72) i sɔɔ a sisɨn puru ai shanɛ, Uɓeyelapa, &lt;&lt;ko suru kɔ̃liyi ma i ntau nyatɔ aɗagbete u ãsinya āā niiǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yesɔ kasinyanɛ, n zɛ japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ shishi a kolapa naa jalɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Weshopɛ n ãwɔ kakatɛ ɔ naa sɔɔyi a nɛngyi wɔsɔ̃n ɔ tɛɛ shɔnɔpɔ̃yi i kaka piti kpai; viwɔ yɛ kpawɔ ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />piti kpai ɔkɔɔ nta sisɨn purunɛ aru suru kɔ̃linɛ i ntawɔ nyatɔ, ama ɔ nta sisɨn puru nɛ Ɗalapa bee ɔ niitɛ a kolapa.<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ nta sisɨn puru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />A ɗaukɔ Ɗa suru pɔ̃ Yesɔ nta sisɨn puru ɓolong-ɓolong a shanɛ, maye, Uɓeyelapa shɔ kolapa a kotipiǃ N dɔ̃raatɛ aru gbete a ɓusi shɔsẽrẽ a shɔruzɛnɛyi vimtɔ a arɛ a tasi jajjayi, nankɔ uɓeye, ukɔ vigbete tɔ̃ràà yɛ.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />&lt;&lt;Maye ãng vi tɛttɔ piti kpai, shɔwɔɔ ji zɛ jau ruubii ɓa see ji ɓeye kɔ sheeli, toti shɔwɔɔ jɛ zɛ maye ɓa see ji ɓɛjaa kɔ sheeli a shɔgbeteyi ɓɛjaa lɔyɛ nɛn kasiyi vi tasinɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ rinɔɔ au jaɗɔyi ɗɔbii aɗagbete shɔwɔyi ɓa aɗɔn ɓa shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɗalapa u tasɔɔ vɔɔ susãri biini aru ɔ zɛ vigbete n pɛliyɛtɛ! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />N gelɔɔtɛ Ɗa jashɔnɛyi waanɛ a kpatiyini i kãtɛ nɛi zɛ vigbete ɔ zɛɓangkɔ iji zɛɓa, i kãtɛ nɛi nta vigbete ɔ ntaɓangkɔ iji ntaɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruɓusinɛ ayuu shɔ Samarita tɔ̃vɨn wɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Kɛɗɔn shɔmala nya-ãsinɛ Musa a Yesɔ ɗɔbii nɛn ɗautɔ a hɨunɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔmala, n pɛlikɛ ivi n kpaa suru gbete sɔ̃nyaɓa yɛ viya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesɔ kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔ beenɛ ivi a Ɗa nya ruubiini viya? A taudɔɔ nɛ iviya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Jau kasinya nɛ:&lt;&lt;A ɔrii Ubeyelapa a Ɗalapa piti a sisɨnni kpai, piti a suruni kpai, piti a kakani, a piti a ɓoroni kpai; wɔsɔ̃n a ɔrii a shɔ nyakasiri naa a ɔrii a yuu yɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yesɔ risinyanɛ, &lt;&lt;A shatɛ tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ, pɛli vimnɛ a yɛ ɔ̃ a suruni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Ama shɔmala nya-ãsinɛ Musa kasinɛn tasinɛn ruuvini ɓa, kɛɗɔn hɨ Yesɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt; N shɔ nyakasiri piya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesɔ kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔwɔɔ siɗɔn shɛ a Urushalima u ɗɔ ɓakinɛ yɛnɛ Yariko. Kɛɗɔn kpɛsi zɔ a shɔ nyabazẽnɛyini a nyaɓa, i saurɛ i rau vi piti kpai i wau dasak i yɛrɛ a yau suru a Ɗa naa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Kɛɗɔn shɔ nya-waanɛ a jaa Ɗa arɛ tɛɛ ji nyaɓaukɔ, naa zɛ jautɛ a ɗɔɔ roonɛ a tɛɛ kagbete sãnyaɓa a yɛrɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Sɔ̃nji nankɔ, jawɔɔ arɛ shɔ laduru lawi, naa atɛ a ɗɔuni a zɛ jaurɛ, tɛɛ sɔ̃njo kagbete a nyabaukɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Ama shɔ Samariya u ɗɔɔ zati yɛnɛ a nyabaukɔ, naa zɛutɛ, raa pɛliurɛ awuni. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Yɛu ɗɔbii a sɔɔriu nɔrɔ a mii inabi a nteriu nɔɔ a marɛ, Kɛɗɔn tuurɛ a pɔ̃u a gãtɔla a n-tiu ɗɔɔ susunɛ, a kɔurɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />A dii ɓuru tuu saa gbete shɔ ɓaanɛ siliva ziti, a ã shɔ ɗɔ susunɛrɛ, nɛu zɛsiungtɔ, a geliunɛ, nɛnkɛ sɔɔnɛ nɛn yɛn sɔriu vigbete kɛ nyɔnɛ piti kpaitɔ.<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Yesɔ yisi nya ruu nɛ&lt;&lt;Áá zɛnɛ pi ɔ̃rɛ shɔ nyakãsiri atette shɔzɛ taati miyi, aru jaa gbete shishi a shɔ nyabazẽnɛyi naa piya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Shɔmala nya-ãsinɛ Musa kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔ gbete ntau raayɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yesɔ risiunya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Yɛnɛ a pɛlijo nankɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ yɛ Marata a Mariyamu i ɗɔbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Aɗagbete Yesɔ au jaɗɔyini i a nyaɓa yɛnɛ, naa atɛ a jakomɔɔ wɔɔ aɗɔgbete suwɔɔ u niinɛ Marata, suu tɛ Yesɔ naarɛ au wɛrɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Marata ɓɛzɔ̃ wujaa aɗɔn u niinɛ Mariyamu, ɓɛzɔ̃ wujau ɔ̃ a Yesɔ ɗɔbii maani u ɗɔu wesho au vimatinɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Ama Marata siu sisɨn a ɗɔɔ vishaanɛ nwanɛ, kɛɗɔn Marata a Yesɔ ɗɔbii a hɨunɛ, Uɓeyelapa, yuu ji yɔraa ɓa nɛ mazɔ̃ Marata yantɛ nɛn nwa vishaanɛ ang yɔbm ɓaya! geliunɛ u pɔ̃sing naa jo.<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Ama Uɓeyelapa kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Marata, Marata, a yɔri yuutɛ, a yukɔni ayuu vi waanɛ i yuu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Ama vitɔ̃vɨng ji gbete sheeli gbete Ɗalapa kasiyɛ, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vigbete mariyamu loyɛ shɔwɔɔ yɛ raabau naani ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ mati shɔvi ayuu Ɗa gakinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Lewɔɔ Yesɔ u ɗɔɔ Ɗa gakinɛ a ɗɔwɔɔ, naa yisi Ɗa gakinɛtɛ, u jaɗɔ gbete wɔɔ geliunɛ, &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa, matiu nɔgbete u gaki Ɗa pɛ, nɔgbete Yɔhana mati u jaɗɔyiyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesɔ geli u jadɔyi nɛ, ɔkɛ tɔnɛyi gaki Ɗa ɔ shanɛ: &lt;&lt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">&lt;&lt; &lt;Uɓeye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">mɛnɛ shɔu bassaa niitɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">mɛnɛ a kpati roonɛ u atɔ.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />ãu vishaanɛ gbete u kasitɔ a lee-lee.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />A yasiu ruuvini gbeteu pɛliyɛ tɔ, nagbete u yasi shɔ gbeteyi pɛliu ruuvini yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">mɔkɔ yaa japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ nɛ u ntau sisɨn a vigbete yɛ tɛu kaka yɛ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />A Yesɔ geliu jaɗɔyinɛ, shɔu tɔpɛnɛ shɔzɛ gbete awɔ tetem u ɓɛsa ɗɔn, yɛu wɛrɛ a atette zɨmba a shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Wesa, kɔ̃sing borodi pɛ taati,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />&lt;&lt;Masa wɔɔ a zati ang wɛrɛ dɔdɔrim, ama n vishaanɛ gbete n yɛn ãwuyɛ ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Kɛɗɔn shɔu tɔnɛ mɛsau kasinya au ɓuzɨn wɛrɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Yɛ kawa mɔkɔ ãng yukɔnɛ nɛ. Shɔ ku nyaɓa wɛrɛtɛ gboti, majaayi i to ɗɔɔ roonɛtɛ gboti a nkɔni, n yɛn zɛnɔɔ lapa yunɛ ɓa n ãa viwɔɔrɛ ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />N gelaatɛ kooji kasi ɓa nɛn yulapa u ãu viwɔɔ aru naapɛ u ɓɛusa ɓa, ama aru a yɛ ɗekɨn a ji nta yusẽ vi gakinɛ ɓa au naani ɓa, yɛ yulapatɔ u ãu vigbete kasiyɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />N gelɔɔtɛ: Ɔ gakinɛ Ɗalapa yɛ ãwɔtɔ; ɔ kãnɛ ɔ yɛ kpaatɔ; wáánɛ shɔ yɛ ɓelaa nyejaatɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Shɔu kɛ gakinɛ yɛ tɛttɔ, shɔu kɛ kãnɛ yɛ kpaatɔ, shɔgbete kɛ waa nyejanɛ shɔyɛ ɓɛliutɔ.<verse eid="LUK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />&lt;&lt;Pi awɔ tetteni naa ɓɛjaa kɛ gaki jazɨng nɛ au naa nɛn shaatɔ yɛ ãu sɔɔ piya? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Ko ɓɛɛ jaa kɛ gaki angki nɛ au naa yɛ ãu nɛng piya? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />piti awɔ kɔ̃linɛni kpai ɔ zɛnɔɔ mɛjaayi vi tɔ̃vɨn ãnɛtɛ, a ntasɛrɛ mɛye gbete kolapa yɛ zãri shɔ gbete i gaki Ɗa Suru pikoviya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ a Bazabul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Kɛɗɔn Yɛsɔ u ɗɔɔ suru kɔ̃linɛ shɛshinɛ a jawɔɔ shɔ nyalutu bi. naa suru kɔ̃linɛ yaa jautɛ, shɔ nyalutu nwanyarɛ, vibii-zaanɛ sã shɔgbete i a ɗɔu piti kpai. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Ama shɔzɛ gãsiyi i shanɛ, shɔmpɛǃ Bazabul, kpati rãman ãu kakanrɛ, shɛshi suru kɔ̃linɛnrɛ awuni. <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Shɔ gãsiyi nta Yesɔ sisɨn i hɨurɛ nɛu tasiyi vibii zaanɛ pɛ gbete yɛ tasinɛ Ɗalapa ãu kaka a kolapa.<verse eid="LUK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Yesɔ zɛ vigbete ai sisɨn tɛttɔ a shanɛ:&lt;&lt;koo gbete kɛ waabanɛ ai nɔɔ, kou yɛ shiɓa, toti wɛrɛ gbete kɛ vɔsinɛ ɗɔɔ ziti, wɛrɛu yɛ shiɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ kpati roonɛ kɛ vɔsinɛ kn ziti i ɗɔɔ bawaanɛ a zɔni, i kpati roonɛ yɛ shi pikoviya? Ɔ shanɛ n shɛshi suru kɔ̃linɛ Bazabul ãng kakarɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />N kɛ shɛshi suru kɔ̃linɛ nɛ a Bezabu kaka, ɔ jaɗɔyi i shɛshi ɓɛkɛpi kaka piya? Ɔ jaɗɔyi ikɔi yɛ ɔ̃rɛ ɔ shɔ ruu nwaanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Ama nkɛ shɛshi suru kɔ̃linɛ nɛ a Ɗalapa kaka, si Ɗa kpati roonɛ atɛ awɔ ɗɔbii gboti.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Naa shɔ kaka gbete u viyaa a naani waanɛ, u ɗɔɔ gbeteu ga wɛrɛ a viyaani naa, u vi wɛrɛ piti kpai ɓɔɔyi n ti naa ɓa ɗɔmɓa. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Ama shɔgbete kɛ tɛu kakanɛ, kanɛ kɛ waunɛ kɛ rau viyaa gbete pɔ̃ sisɨn a ɗɔnnɛ, kɛɗɔn yɛ sii vigbete kasi siinɛ piti a wɛrɛu kpai. <verse eid="LUK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Shɔgbete u ɓa a nkɔng ni ɓa, u pɛ n shɔnɔpɔ̃, shɔgbete ji pɔ̃sing naa ɓa a ɗɔɔ vi tolinɛni ɓa u ɗɔɔ sãtinɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Suru kɔ̃linɛ sɔɔnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Naa Suru kɔ̃linɛ kɛ shɛnɛ shɔ bi, witikɛ ɗɔgbete mii ɓa ɗɔm ɓa, aru u kpaa ɗɔɔ susunɛ, naa ji kpaa ɓa, kɛɗɔn geliu yuu nɛ n yɛn sɔɔsɔ̃n wɛrɛ gbete n shɛ ɗɔnyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Naa kɛ sɔɔnɛ kɛ kpaa wɛrɛunɛ shɔ kootɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ, shɔ tɔ̃ritɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Kɛɗɔn sɔɔrɛ ɓaa suru kɔ̃linɛ wɔɔ maanzii gbete i tɛu tɛttɔ a lanani, i to shɔu bi i ɔ̃ ɗɔn, a kɨntiuni biu yɛ yusurɛ u tɛɛ gbete si tɛ̃ɛ̃-tɛ̃ɛ̃tɔ.<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛti puru nizɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Aɗagbete Yesɔ sha nam, suu wɔɔ atette shɔzɛ, ɓaa Yesɔ nya a geliunɛ, suu gbete yee a yɛ a bààrɛ, a barɛ Ɗalapa u tasi u susãri biini.<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Yesɔ kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ama Ɗalapa u tasi ba shɔgbete i nta Ɗa nyaruubii i ɗɔgbete i gɨnyɛ vɔɔ susãri abiini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ kã vibii zaanɛ tasinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Naa mɔɔyi i ɗɔɔ nya toli waanɛ a Yesɔ ɗɔbii, shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔ jakɨntimiyi dɔdɔrim i pɛ shɔ kɔ̃linɛyi. I kãnɛ n tasi pɛ vibii zaanɛ u tasi kɛkn nɛn a a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii, ama n yɛn tasiyi ɓa see vibii zaanɛ Jona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Jinankɔ vigbete Ɗalapa pɛli Jona yɛ ukɔ tasi shɔ Nenivarɛ nɛ Ɗa shourɛ, Shɔzɛja ukɔ yɛ ɔ̃rɛ vitasinɛ a jakɨntimiyi ɗɔbiini. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Suu gbete roo kpati Sheba yɛ yulapa yɛ tẽriyi shɔ jakɨntinimi ruuvini ayuu a lee gadi gbete Ɗalapa yɛ vɔsi ruu yɛ, aru shɛ a koo kpɛlɛ, u geliyinɛ ɔ ji pɛli ɓa tɔ̃vɨn ɓa, aru gbete apɛ ɗɔ kpɛlɛ-kpɛlɛ u nta vimatinɛ sẽrẽ a Solomon nya. Ama vigbete pẽniba tɛɛ kpati Solomon tɛ dɔdɔrim u yɛm. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />A lee gadi shɔ Nenivayi wɔsɔ̃n shɔ jakɨntimiyi i yɛ yulapa i geliyinɛ i ji pɛli ɓa tɔ̃vɨn ɓa, aru gbete i yaa ruuvinitɛ i kɔsi sisɨn tɛttɔ a Jona nyawaanɛ au pɛliyɛ. Ama vigbete pẽniba tɛɛ Jona tɛ dɔdɔrim u yɛm.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗɔsẽsẽ abi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />&lt;&lt; Shɔwɔɔ ɓa gbete dɔ̀ɔ́ yaa pitila u pɔ̃ a ɗɔɔ ɓusinɛyɛ ɓa, ko u zuu à ɓɛsɛ. Ama shɔ dɔ̀ɔ́ yaa pitila shɔ pɔ̃ a laa ɔ̃nɛ lapa, nɔgbete kopiya kɛ tonɛ yɛ zɛ ɗɔsẽsẽ kɛkn. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Ɔ nɔɔ kɔ ɔ̃rɛ pitila a bi, naa ɔ nɔɔ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn, a bi piti kpai yɛ ɔ̃ sɔ̃njo sẽsẽ. Ama ɔ nɔɔ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ vɔrɔ a bi piti kpai yɛ ɔ̃ ɗɔkɨnri gbiti-gbiti. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Zɛpɛ tɔ̃vɨn ko ɗɔsẽsẽ gbete ɔwuni pɛ ɗɔkɨnri. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Aruumkɔ a bi piti kpai kɛ ɔ̃nɛ sẽsẽ ɗɔwɔɔ ɓa kɨnri àá biini ɓa, a bi yɛ ɔ̃ sẽsẽ piti kpai, nɔgbete pitila ã ɗɔsẽsẽ yɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ mari shɔ Farasiyayi a shɔmala nya ãsinɛ Musani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Naa Yesɔ yisi nyanwanɛtɛ, kɛɗɔn shɔ Farasiya ɓaa Yesɔ nyanɛ u arɛ u shaa vishaanɛ au wɛrɛ. Yesɔ yɛrɛ a ɔ̃rɛ nɛn shaa vi. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Ama shɔ Farasiya zɛrɛ Yesɔ ji sɔ̀ɔ̀ naa ɓa gaa vishaanɛrɛ, vim ãkɛ vibii zaanɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Kɛɗɔn Uɓeyelapa geliunɛ, ɔ shɔ Farasiya ɔ sɔ̀ɔ́ ɓɛɛjo jawàá mii u bi ɓilikɔ sheeli. Ama awɔ sisɨn ɓuzun see ba vikɔ̃linɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Ɔ shɔ rãngyi weze! Ɓa ji Ɗalapa kɔ, shɔ gbete pɛli ɔ bi ɓili a ɓuzɨn biini ɓaya? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Ama ã vi awɔ sisɨn shɔ raayi, vigbete ɔkɛ pɛlinɛ piti kpai bi yɛ tɔ̃ Ɗalapa nyatɔ a ɔkɔni.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />Yɛ ɔ̃rɔɔ vi yukɔnɛ ɔ shɔ Farasiyayi! Ɔ ã Ɗalapa vinaa tɔ a vigbete ɔ la awɔ jaa naa gãsãsã, timba gapayi ni piti kpai, ama ɔ yaa tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛtɛ a ɔrinɛ Ɗalapa ni. Ɔ pɛli vishonɛ a vimkɔ piti kpai ɔkɔɔ yaa wɔɔnɛ knti.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Ɔ kɔyuutɔ shɔ Farasiya! Aru ɔ kasinɛ shɔ ai ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛ pẽniba aɗɔgbete shɔ Yahudawayi i toli nya ɗɔnyɛ i nwa ruuyɛ, shɔu gee ɔ nya a lumɔɔyi.<verse eid="LUK 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Ɔ kɔyuutɔ, ɔ ɔ̃tɛ naa yusààyi gbete i tasi ɓa, shɔzɛyi raki ɗɔn ɓayi zɛnɛni ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Kɛɗɔn shɔzɛ gbete atette shɔmala nya-ãsinɛ Musa kasi Yesɔ nyanɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔmala, akɛ shanɛ nankɔ a dãu tɛjo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesɔ risinya nɛ, ɔ shɔmala nyaãsinɛ Musa ɔ kɔyuutɔ! Aru gbete ɔ tusu shɔzɛyi nyaãsinɛ gbete tɛɛ i kakatɛ nɛi gɨntɔ, ama ɔ piti kpai ɔ n ti jaanaa ɓa gbete nɛi pɔ̃sii naa pɛ a ɗɔnni ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Ɔ kɔyuutɔ, aru ɔ maari janyagadiyi sàà tɔ ɔ bɛrɛkitɔ tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ, janyagadiyi gbete mɛuruyi nyoyi yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Ɔ ji ɔ yuu ɔ kasinyatɛ a vigbete mɛuruuyi pɛliyɛ. I nyɔ janyagadiyi vɔrɔ, ɔkɔɔ ma ɔ bassi janyagadi ɓa, ɔ gbãriyi ɓɛɛ jo sàà kɔ sheeli. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Aruumkɔ Ɗalapa u sẽrẽ aɗɔn shanɛ, &lt;&lt; N yɛn shoshiyi Ɗa jashonɛyi a Yesɔ jashonɛyi, i yɛ nyo wɔyitɔ, i tasi wɔyi raa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Aru nankɔ Ɗalapa yɛ tasi shɔ jakɨntimiyi raatɔ, aru gbete shɔ nyoki Ɗa jashonɛ piti kpaa si tɛ̃ɛ̃-tɛ̃ɛ̃ a ɗagbete koo shɛyɛ, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />Yunɛ Habila bi yɛnɛ Zakariya bi gbete shɔ nyokiyɛ atette lazãã a ɗɔ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ a ɓuzɨn jàà Ɗa. Nn, n gelɔɔtɛ, Ɗalapa yɛ tasi shɔ jakɨntimiyi raatɔ ai yuuni!<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />&lt;&lt;Ɔ kɔyuutɔ shɔmala nya-ãsinɛ! Aru gbete ɔ ji yaa shɔ ɓa nɛ shɔu zɛ Ɗalapa nya ruubiirɛ ɓa, ɔ yɛ to ɓuzɨn wɛrɛ ɓa awɔ yuuni ɓa, ɔ yɛ yaɓa nɛ shɔyi torɛ ɓa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Akɨnti gbete Yesɔ yisi nya vim shanɛtɛ a yaa ɗɔurɛ, Kɛɗɔn shɔ Farisiya a shɔmala nya-ãsinɛyi i gaa Yesɔ pɔ̃nɛ kɛ dekɨn, i kãu a ɗɔnya i ɗɔgbete i hɨliu ruu ayuu vi waanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />I ɗa tari aru i nta vikɔ̃linɛ au nya nɛmɛnɛ yɛ wiitɔ aɗɔn.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yusho gɔ̃nɛ aru shɔ-shɔ ɗakinɛyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Kɛɗɔn moo lazɔrɔ waanɛ i toli nya, i ɗɔzɔɔ nalinɛ a dɔɔ, Yesɔ gaa u jaɗɔyi ruu geli a shanɛ: &lt;&lt;Ɔ kɔyuutɔ aru ɔkɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ vuru Farasiyayi ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔ ɗakinɛ, i vikɔ̃linɛ raa shɔ ɗɔbii weze mɛɛli naa vuru. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Vigbete shɔkɛ kuki u nyanɛ shɔyɛ ɓɛlitɔ piti kpai, toti vigbete shɔkɛ ɓusinɛ dɔdɔrim shɔyɛ shɛshi ɓili sɔ̃ntɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Vigbete akɛ shanɛ dɔkɨnri shɔyɛ ntatɔ ɗɔsẽsẽni piti kpai. vigbete ɔkɛ shanɛ a ɓusɨn jaa ɔ kuki nya jaatɔ, shɔyɛ shi sɔ̃n yujàá lapa a sharɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔgbete shɔ ntau setiyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />N gelɔɔtɛ, masayi, ɔkɔɔ nta seti shɔ gbete i nyɔ jazɛ binɛ ama i kɛ nyɔnɛ i zɛnɔɔ viwɔɔ pɛlinɛ toti ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />N yɛn tasɔɔ shɔgbete ɔ yɛ nta setitɔ: Ɔ nta seti Ɗalapa, shɔgbete akɨnti bi nyɔnɛ u kaka aɗɔn u lɔkaa a wɛrɛ yaa a suruni. Ã sisɨn nɛ ang nyani, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔ gbete ɔ ntau seti yɛ! <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Shɔ mɛli jajjanɔ ɓa maani kobo ziti ɓaya? Piti kpai a shomni Ɗalapa ji suki ɓa yini niɓa. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Ko ɔ shɛnti yuu ma Ɗalapa gai tɛtɔ piti kpai. Ɔ kɔɔ nta setinɛ aru ɔ tɛɛ mashigãmɓolo tɛttɔ kiririni.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kirisi ruubii bẽẽnɛ a kasinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />N gelɔɔtɛ shɔ gbete kɛ pɔ̃naanɛ a shɔ ɗekɨn nɛ ipɛ n maa, shɔzɛja yɛ pɔ̃naa ji a Ɗa jashonɛyi lapa a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn nɛ i pɛng ɓɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Ama shɔ gbete kɛ bɛ̃ɛ̃ n ruubiinɛ a shɔ ɗekɨn n yɛn bɛ̃ɛ̃yi i ruubii jo a Ɗa jashonɛyi lapa ɗekɨn. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Shɔ gbete kɛ nwaanyanɛ kɔ̃linɛ a shɔzɛja yuu Ɗalapa yɛ yasiu ruuvinitɔ, ama shɔgbete kɛ nwaanya kɔ̃linɛ nɛ aru Ɗa suru Ɗalapa yɛ yasiu ruuvini ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />Naa shɔkɛ n-tɔɔ nɛ a shɔ ɗekɨn aɗɔgbete Yahudawayi i toli nya aɗɔn, ko kpatiyi a shɔ yupɛ̃ni ɗekɨn ɔkɔɔ nta setinɛ nɔgbete ɔ yɛ raa ɔ yuunɛ, ko vigbete ɔ yɛ shayɛni, <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />aru Ɗa Suru yɛ matɔɔ vigbete ɔ yɛ shayɛ ɓɛjitɔ ko piɗaviya.<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruɓusinɛ a shokɔ shɔvinaa wɔɔ yuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Jawɔɔ atette mɔɔyi geli Yesɔ nɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔmala, geli mazɔ̃ pɛ u vɔsiu vivɔ gbete uɓeye vɔrɛ yasiu yɛ pɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesɔ kasiunya nɛ, masa, pi ang naa pi nɛn ɔ̃ shɔ ruu yenɛ, ko nɛn vɔsi ɔ vivɔ gbete meyeu vɔrɛ yasɔɔ zitim piya? <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Yɛ ɗekɨn a shanɛni nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ kɔyuutɔ ɔkɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ shɔ mang pɛlinɛ, shɔzɛ suru tɔ̃vɨn ɔ̃nɛ a koo ɓa ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vinaa gbete u awuni ɓa, ko u vinaa u ɔ̃ waanɛ pikoviya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geliyi kɛ ruɓusinɛm: Shɔwɔɔ siɗɔn shɔ vinaa u vishaanɛ ntɔtɔ a jaa waanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />A geliu yuunɛ, n ji zɛ vigbete n yɛn pɛliyɛ ɓa, aru n mbuntɛ vishaamiyi tɛ̃nɛ ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Kɛɗɔn a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;N zɛ vi pɛlinɛtɛ, n yɛn zɨngli mbuntɛyi gbete a wɛrɛm kpai, n maa wɔɔ sɔɔ pẽniɓa-pẽniɓa, n tɛ̃ɛ̃ n visha gbete n kpaa a jaa ang vinaa ni kpai a ɓuzɨn. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Kɛɗɔn n yɛn gelin yuu kɛnɛ, Ɗa shaarintɛ n vi aɗɔn gbete n yɛ shaa saa waanɛ, n yɛn ɔ̃ saa waanɛ n kpaa yukɔnɛ ɓa n shaarɛ n ɓoorɛ n pɛli vigbete n kasi pɛlinɛyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Ama Ɗalapa geliunɛ, apɛ shokɔ! a zɨmbangkɔ a yɛ vɔrɛ, dɔdɔrim vigbete a tolaa yuu ɓam yɛ ɔ̃kɛ shɔwɔɔ ɓɛɛ, toti a ɓɛɛ ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geli u jaɗɔyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔmpɛ vigbete yɛ kpaa shɔyi toli vinaa aru i yuu, ama a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn i vinaa ɓa ɗɔmɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ Ɗalapa bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geli u jaɗɔyi nɛ: &lt;&lt;Aru nankɔ n gelɔɔtɛ ɔ yɔri yuu ɓa aru vishaanɛ gbete ɔ shaarɛ ɔ ɔ̃ a suru ni ko aru fãrã gbete ɔ kasi tosinɛ abi yɛ ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Suru tɛɛ vishaanɛ tɛttɔ, bi maa tɛɛ fãrãyi tɛttɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Kɨnnɔɔ pɛ a janɔyi: I ji ɓaa visha ɓa i ji yee visha ɓa, i jàá ɓa ko mbuntɛ gbete i pɔ̃ visha a ɗɔnni ɓa; Ɗalapa shaaritɔ! Ama tɛɛ janɔyi ɓa ya? <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Pi awɔ tetteni pi kɛ yɔriyuunɛ yɛ zɛnɔɔtɔ u gesi dɔɔɗa a ɗekɨn a dɔɔɗa gbete yɛ ɔ̃ a suruni a koo piya? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Ɔ ji zɛnɔɔ vishonɛ ɓa a vi pɛ̃tɛ̃rɛ̃ ni ɓa, ɔ yɔri yuu kɛnɛ aru gãsini viya?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Kɨnnɔɔ pɛ a kowa laayi nɔgbete i bayɛ: i shovi ɓa ko i fãrã i tɔ̃ri ɓa, ama n gelɔɔtɛ kpati Sulemanu au vinaa ni kpai u fãrã wɔ ji yɛ kowa laa ɓa a kɔrinɛ niɓa. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Pɛ Ɗalapa kɔ barɛki wisi birɛ gbete shɔ kpaa nem ɗɔm ɓuru shɔ too a yaa. A ntasɛrɛ pɛ ɔkɔɔ ya? Ɔ shɔgbete ɔ ɔ̃ a koo u tɛɛ wisi tɛttɔ a saani, aru ivi ɔ sisɨn ãnɛ kɛ pẽtẽrẽ viya!<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Ɔkɔɔ pɔ̃ sisɨn nɛ aru vigbete ɔ yɛ shaayɛ a vigbete ɔ yɛ ɓooyɛni. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />(Aru shɔgbete i gɨn Ɗalapa ɓa a koo(pegan), i sɨn sisɨn jo a vishaanɛ a ɓoonɛ lee-lee) meyeu kolapa zɛ tɛttɔ nɛ ɔ kasitɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Ɔ kã ɓɛjo Ɗa kpati roonɛ, Ɗalapa yɛ ãwɔ vimiyitɔ piti kpai.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vinaa pɔ̃nɛ a kolapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />N jàá vivaa pẽtẽrẽm ɔkɔɔ nta setinɛ, meyeu nta sisɨn purutɔ naa ɔkɛ kpaa tonɛnɛ a ɗɔgbeteu roo kpati aɗɔn. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Mɛli vi gbete awuni kpai a ã saa u kɛ shɔ raayi. Ɔ kãri ɔ yuu vi pɔ̃nɛ gbete yɛ lɛsi ɓa, ɔ pɔ̃ vinaa a kolapa, a ɗɔgbete shɔyɛ sẽu nɔɔ ɓa, aru ɓɔɔ yɛ zɛnɔɔ tunɛ ɓa, páà zɛnɔɔ lɛsinɛ ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Aru ɗɔgbete a vinaa aɗɔn a sisɨn ji a ɗɔwakɔ.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jawɛrɛ gbete ɔ̃ a nɔkãkãri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />&lt;&lt;Ɔ ma ɔ ɔ̃ nokãkãri aru vigbete yɛ a sɔɔ yɛ kpai, ko pi lee piya, ɔ yaa ɔ pitila ɗɔɔ shaanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Naa Jawɛrɛ gbete u ɗɔɔ ɓɛɛ shɔwɛrɛ ganɛ nɛu sɔɔ wɛrɛ a ɗɔɔ yumusinɛ so tɛnɛ. Naa kanɛ kɛ waa nyejaanɛ, tɛ̃ɛ̃ti i yɛ ɓɛliu nyabatɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Yɛ ɔ̃pɛ vibii nyantonɛ a jawɛrɛyi i ɗɔbiini naa i shɔwɛrɛ kɛ kpainɛ i ma rii sãn tɛ, n gelɔɔtɛ i shɔwɛrɛ yɛ zɔ̃ fãrã gbete hãyɛ, u geliyinɛ ɔ ɔ̃nɛ tipi, u ã ko pi gbete piya vishaanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Shɔwɛrɛu yɛ nta bi nyantɔnɛtɔ kɛ kpaa jawɛrɛyi nɛ i ma rii sãntɛ ko a tete zɨmɓa ko a gadi! <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Ɔ zɛ tɛttɔ shɔwɛrɛ si tɔnɛn zɛ ɗagbete ɓɔɔ yɛ tou wɛrɛ yɛtɔ, si yɛ yaa ɓa nɛi torɛ i ɓɔɔ virɛ au wɛrɛni ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Ɔkɔɔ maa ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jɨng akɔrɔ ɔ ɔ̃ abi manɛni, aru jashɔzɛ anɛ yɛ ɔ̃ a ɗagbete ɔji pɔ̃ ɓa sisɨn niɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jawɛrɛ tɔ̃vɨn a Jawɛrɛ kɔ̃linɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Bituru hɨnɛ, &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa, a sha ruuɓusinɛm ji au yuu ya, ko aru shɔzɛ piti kpai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Uɓeyelapa kasinyanɛ,&lt;&lt;Pi jawɛrɛ shɔpiya gbete u sẽrẽ aɗɔn gɨn u shɔwɛrɛ nyatɔ piya? Ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete u shɔwɛrɛ yɛ pɔ̃u au wɛrɛ u zɛtɔ, u ã ɓɛzɔɔ jawɛrɛyi vishaanɛ a ɗagbete tɔ̃vɨn. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Naa jawɛrɛ kɛ pɛli vishonɛm nɛ, ɓɛɛ shɔwɛrɛ kɛ sɔɔ wɛrɛnɛ kɛ kpaunɛ a ɗɔɔ pɛlinɛ yɛ nta yɛti puru waanɛǃ <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />N gelɔɔ vimtɛ, shɔwɛrɛu yɛ ã jawɛrɛu u vinaa kɛ piti kpai nɛu zɛsintɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Ama naa jawɛrɛu kɛ shanɛ a sisɨn nɛn shɔwɛrɛ yɛtɛ kpɛlɛ nɛ yɛ a ɓa tɛ̃ɛ̃tini ɓa, u gaa ɓɛzɔɔ jawɛrɛyi wāānɛ, vɔshɔ a soro ni kpai, u gaa vishaanɛ shaanɛ a ɓoonɛni, gbete n-tiu sinɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Kɛɗɔn lewɔɔ shɔwɛrɛ yɛ a wɛrɛtɔ a lee gbete jawɛrɛu ji pɔ̃ ɓa au sisɨn niɓa, sɔ̃n a ɗagbete ji zɛɓa. Kɛɗɔn u shɔwɛrɛ yɛ koliu kɛra-kɛra, u pɔ̃urɛ aɗɔgbete shɔ tasi shɔ ruuviniyi raa. <verse eid="LUK 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Jawɛrɛ au zɛ vigbete u shɔwɛrɛ kasinɛ u pɛliyɛ, ama ji mabii ɓa, ji pɛli vigbete u shɔwɛrɛ kasiyɛ ɓa, shɔ yɛ wau waanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Ama jawɛrɛ gbete ji zɛ vigbete ɓɛɛ shɔwɛrɛ kasinɛu pɛlinyɛ ɓa, a pɛli vi gbete yɛtɛ nɔgbete shɔ wauyɛ, shɔ yɛ wau ɓa bang ɓa. Shɔ gbete shɔ kɛ ãu vinɛ a naa ɓang, shɔ kã sɔ̃njo ɓang au naani, shɔ gbete shɔ kɛ ãu vinɛ a naa ɓang mɛɛsẽ, shɔ kã sɔ̃njo au naa ɓang mɛɛsẽ.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ n ti yuu vɔsinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />&lt;&lt;N adɔɔ yaa ɗɔɔnɛ a koo, nɔgbete n kasiyɛ shɔ si dɔɔtɛtɔǃ&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />N batizima aɗɔn gbete shɔ yɛ pɛling yɛ, n yɔri yuutɛ waanɛ setɛ n raaɓoonɛ yisi nyatɛ, <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />si ɔ pɔ̃ sisɨn nɛ ang ruu anɛnkɔ, yɛ pɔ̃ shɔzɛrɛ i ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔnɛ a koo ya? ɓa, ɓa ɔ̃nɛ binyatɔ̃nɛ ɓa, ama yuu vɔsinɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Yunɛ dɔdɔrim yɛnɛ ɗekɨn wɛrɛ gbete shɔzɛ aɗɔn maani i yɛ vɔsikɛtɔ, shɔ taati i yɛ ɔ̃kɛ shɔnɔpɔ̃ a shɔ zitiyini, shɔ ziti ma i yɛ ɔ̃kɛ shɔnopɔ̃ a shɔ taatiyini. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Jaa ɓeye yɛ ɔ̃ nɔpɔ̃ a ɓɛɛ javɔshɔyini, javɔshɔyi i yɛ ɔ̃ nɔpɔ̃ a ɓeyeni, jaa ɓini yɛ ɔ̃ nɔpɔ̃ a ɓɛɛ jasoroyini, jasoroyi i yɛ ɔ̃ nɔpɔ̃ a ɓini ni, jaa ɓini yɛ ɔ̃ nɔpɔ̃ a ɓɛkpɛni soroni, jaa ɓeso yɛ ɔ̃ sɔ̃nji nɔpɔ̃ a ɓɛkpɛni soroni.<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dɔɔɗa zɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geli shɔ sɔ̃nɛ, Ɔ kɛ zɛnɛ kunyasi kɛ rinɛ ɓiti-ɓiti ɔ shanɛ mii ɓutɛ a paa, ɔ shanɛ mii kolapa yɛ atɔ, see mii arɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Ɔ kɛ ntanɛ sɔrɔ kɛ dusunɛ a ka nagang ɔ shanɛ, ɗɔɔ yɛ nwaatɔ ɔ̃rɛ nankɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Shɔ-shɔɗakinɛyiǃ Ɔ zɛnɔɔ nɔɔ kɨnnɛtɛ, ɔ sharɛ nɔgbete ɗɔ ɔ̃ a bi, tipi a kolapani; Ama aru ivi ɔ zɛnɔɔ vi shanɛ ɓa a vi gbete Ɗalapa pɛliyɛ a jakɨntimini ɓa?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ ã zɔɔ naatɔ àà shɔnɔpɔ̃ni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Aru ivi ɔ yee ruu ɓa awɔ yuu aru vi tɔ̃vɨn gbete ɔ yɛ pɛli ɓa? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Naa shɔwɔɔ kɛ n taanɛ shɔ ruu yeenɛyi i ɗekɨn, pɛli nɔgbete a yɛ pɛliyɛ ɔ ã zɔɔ naa siwɔ doo nyaɓa. A ji pɛliɓa yɛ n taa shɔ ruu yeenɛ ɗekɨn, shɔ ruu yeenɛwu yɛ ã yɛ ãã jadiyi manɛ a naa, jadiyi manɛ i lokaa a jaahm. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />A yɛ ɔ̃ a jaahm a ɗɔwakɔ, n gelaatɛ, setaa sho vi gbete shɔ yeraatɛ piti kpai.<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yaa a ruuvini nɛ ko a votɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />A ɗaukɔ shɔgãsi gbete isi a ɗɔu i geli Yesɔ shɔ Galili ruubii gbete Bilatu pɔ̃rɛ shɔ nyoyiyɛ aɗagbete i n ti Ɗalapa vi yuu ãnɛ yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesɔ kasiyinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Aru gbete shɔ nyo shɔ Galili wɔɔ yɛ, ɔ pɔ̃kɛ sisɨn nɛ ikɔi tɛɛ shɔ Galili gãsiyirɛ a ruuvini ni piti kpai ya? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Ɓa nankɔ ɓa! N gelɔɔtɛ ɔ ji kɔsi sisɨn ɓa ɔ yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛtɔ ɓa, ɔ piti kpai ɔ yɛ vɔ sɔ̃njo nagbete i vɔliyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Ɔ tɔnɛ shɔ kopi tu maantaa gbete i vɔliyɛ a Suluwam aɗagbete jàá shɔ dɔsi a lapa zɨnli ai yuu? Awɔ shanɛ ikɔi tɛɛ shɔ Urushalimayirɛ piti kpai a ruuvini ni ya? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Ɓa nankɔ ɓa! N gelɔɔtɛ ɔ ji kɔsi sisɨn ɓa ɔ yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛtɔ ɓa, ɔ piti kpai ɔ yɛ vɔ sɔ̃njɔ nagbete i vɔliyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruɓusinɛ aru laa sɨti gbete ji rɛɛ jaa ɓayɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geliyi kɛ ruɓusinɛm:&lt;&lt;Jawɔɔ siɗɔn u laa sɨnti a ɗɔɔ banɛ au jaa. Yɛrɛ nɛn hãu jaa pɛ ama ji kpau jaa ɓa kɔ gbete. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Kɛɗɔn geli shɔ gbete zɛ jau nɛ, kn nɔɔpɛ yɛtɛ saa taati n ɗɔgbete n a ɗɔɔ jaa laa sɨnti kãnɛ ama n arɛ n kpau jaa ɓa. kowunɛ a tipi! Aru ivi shɔ yaurɛ u ɗɔgbete lɛsi ɗɔ wese viya? <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Ama shɔ gbete zɛ jau kasinya nɛ, &lt;Shɔwɛrɛ, yaupɛ nankɔ, u ãu pɛ saa gbete; N yɛn gbãliu gɨnri kororo n tɛ̃ruu hɨmjaa pɛtɔ samni. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Naa kɛ rɛɛ jaa nɛ saa wɔɔni ukɔ tɔ̃vɨn, ji rɛɛ ɓa ma shɔ kou kɛkn a tipi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ gati suu gbangbutu a lee susunɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />A lewɔɔ Yuhuwayi lee susunɛ, naa Yesɔ u dɔgbete vimatinɛ shɔ aɗɔgbete Yahudawayi i toli nya aɗɔnyɛ i nwaruu, <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />ama zɛ suu wɔɔ gbete suru kɔ̃linɛ pɛliu vɔrɔ gbãngbutu. Suu vɔrɔu ɗàutɔ zɛnɔɔ bi shirinɛ ɓa saa kopi atu maantaa. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Naa Yesɔ zɛ suutɛ, a ɓau nyarɛ,&lt;&lt;Suum shɔ raatɛ a vɔrɔ gbete sã ayɛniǃ&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ pɔ̃ naa a suu bi, tɛ̃ɛ̃ti suu shiri birɛ, a bɛli Ɗalapa rɛ.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Yupɛ̃ni a ɗɔgbete Yahudawayi toli nya aɗɔnyɛ i nwaruu i lɛsi sisɨn nɛ Yesɔ gati shɔ a lee susunɛ, kɛɗɔn geli shɔ gbete i a ɗɔunɛ,&lt;&lt;Lee mangbete aru u shovi shonɛ; ɔ a leemiyi kɔ shɔu gati ɔrɛ, ama ɓa lee susunɛ ɓa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Kɛɗɔn Uɓeyelapa kasiunyanɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔ-shɔɗakinɛyi! Awɔ tetteni ɔ zɛnɔɔ napu kalinɛ ɓa ko gãtola kalinɛ ɓa ɔ n-tiu ɗɔ gbete yɛ ɓoo mii a lee susunɛni ɓaya? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Suum Ibirayi ɓɛuru gbete japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ mauɓa saa kopi tu maantaa; ji nto ɓa shɔu raaurɛ a lee susunɛni ɓaya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Naa Yesɔ sha vimtɛ, u shɔnɔpɔ̃yi piti kpai i nta yusẽtɔ, ama shɔ gãsiyi gbete a ɗɔu kpai i nta yɛti purutɔ a vibii zaanɛ gbete Yesɔ pɛliyɛ.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruɓusinɛ ayuu zɔvi gbete shɔ ɓanɛ musita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ hɨnɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɗa kpati roonɛ yɛ ɔ̃ naa piviya? N yɛn tasi nɔgbete ɔ̃yɛ a iviya? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Pɛ naa shom. Jawɔɔ too zɔvi musita weze jaa fɛ̃ɛ̃ a ɓaa au jaa. barɛ a tɛɛ laa gãsiyi piti kpai, janɔyi i arɛ i ntori satirɛ a naa laauni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruɓusinɛ ayuu yisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Toti Yesɔ hɨnɛ,&lt;&lt;N yɛn teesi Ɗa kpati roonɛ a iviya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />pɛ naa shom. Suu wɔɔ tuu gãsi yisiti a rãã a zɨng gbete shɔ tɔ̃ri borodi awuni waa taati, kɛɗɔn yisiti tɛɛ zɨng kpai.<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyɛ jaa tɔ̃rɔ̃rɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yesɔ sã nyaɓa u ɗɔ yɛnɛ au jaɗɔyini, zaa jakomɔɔyi piti kpai a komɔɔyini u ɗɔɔ shɔ vimatinɛ a nyaɓa yɛnɛ Urushalima. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Kɛɗɔn shɔwɔɔ hɨunɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔwɛrɛ, nizɛ kɔya shɔ pẽtẽrẽ i yɛ ranarɛ ya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Yesɔ kasinyanɛ, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />pɛli nɔgbete a yɛ zɛnɔɔtɔ a to a nyaɓa tɔ̃rɔ̃rɔ̃; aru shɔzɛ waanɛ i yɛ ntali tonɛ a nyaɓangkɔ ama i yɛ zɛnɔɔ ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Naa shɔwɛrɛ kɛ yunɛ kɛ ku nyaɓa wɛrɛnɛ; ɔ yɛ shi a ɓili ɔ waa nyejaa ɔ shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔwɛrɛ, ɓeliu nyejaa pɛǃ Yɛ kasɔɔ nyanɛ, n ji zɛ ɗɔgbete ɔ shɛyɛ ɓaǃ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Kɛɗɔn ɔ yɛ kasinyanɛ, &lt;U shaavi jo u ɓoo mii jo a mɔkɔni nyazɔnkaa; a matiu vi au komɔɔǃ&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Ama yɛ sha sɔ̃nnɛ,&lt;N ji zɛ ɗɔgbete ɔ shɛ aɗɔnyɛ ɓa, ɔ piti kpai ɔ yɛ kawa, shɔ kɔ̃linɛ!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Kɛɗɔn ɔ ɗɔ sɨnnɛ a ntari shanɛni ɔ kɛ zɛ Ibirayi, a Ishayaku, a Yakubu, a Ɗa jashonɛyini piti kpai a Ɗa ɗɔ kpati roonɛ, ama ɔkɔɔ ɔ yuu shɔ yɛ nyiki ɔrɛ ɔ yɛ kawa! <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Shɔ yɛ arɛ a ka gɨnri a paa, ka nagang a ka nakɨn, i ɔ̃rɛ i ɗɔ yumusinɛ Ɗa kpati roonɛ shaanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Kɛɗɔn shɔgbete i knti i yɛ ɔ̃kɛ ɗekɨn, a shɔ gbete i a ɗekɨn dɔdɔrim i yɛ ɔ̃ kɛ knti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ Urushalima ɔrinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />A ɗauni shɔ Farasiyayi gãsiyi i a Yesɔ ɗɔbii i geliu nɛ,&lt;&lt;Yunɛ a ɗɔnni a yɛ ɗɔwɔɔ, aru Hirudu kasaa nyɔnɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesɔ kasinyanɛ, Ɔ yɛnɛ ɔ geli Zakulaunɛ, n ɗɔgbete n shɛshi suru kɔ̃linɛyi, n ɗɔ shɔ gatinɛ, nɛm a ɓuru, n yɛn yisi n vishonɛ sapu. <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Ama ɔ̃rintɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ n a nyaɓa yɛnɛ nɛm, ɓuru, a sapu; ji kɔriɓa shɔu nyo Ɗa jashonɛ ko a ɗɔpiya ɓa see a Urushalima.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />Urushalima! Urushalima! Ɔkɔɔ shɔgbete ɔ nyɔ Ɗa jashonɛyimi, ɔ lo shɔgbete Ɗalapa shoyi awɔ ɗɔbiitɛ a tari! Ɓa nɛkɨnya n kasi n toli ɔ nya ɗɔ gbete naa kɔ̃ɔ̃ toli jaa nya a nakosẽri, ama ɔ ji kasi ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Kɨnnɔɔ pɛ ɔ wɛrɛ yɛ ɔ̃ waati, n gelɔɔtɛ, ɔ zɛn tɔɓa see lee gbete ɔ shatɛnɛ, Ɗalapa u tasi shɔ gbete arɛ a Uɓeyelapa nii vɔɔ susãri biini!<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ gati shɔ vɔrɔ a lee susunɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />A lee susunɛ Yesɔ yɛ ɗɔɔ vishaanɛ a yupɛ̃ni Farisiya wɛrɛ; shɔ ɗɔgbete shɔ tẽriu nɔɔbii. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Kɛɗɔn jawɔɔ u dɔni au naa puutɔ a dɔɔni arɛ shi a Yesɔ ɗɔbii. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesɔ hɨ shɔmala nya-ãsinɛ Musa a shɔ Farisiyayi nɛ, &lt;&lt;U nya-ãsinɛ yasiu nyaɓa tɛttɔ nɛ shɔ gati shɔ a lee susunɛ niya ko ɓa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Ama i ji sha viwɔɔ ɓa. Yesɔ tuu jaurɛ, a gatiurɛ, a geliunɛ u yɛ wɛrɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geliyinɛ, Naa shɔzɛ gbete awɔ tete u jaa ko janapu aɗɔn, kɛ shishinɛ a too mii a lee susunɛ, yɛ zɔ̃u ɓa aru pɛ lee susunɛ ya?<verse eid="LUK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Ama i ji zɛnɔɔ Yesɔ nya kasinɛ ɓa a ruumni ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tasaa yuu naa a ɓa viwɔɔ ɓa a ɔri shɔ piti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yesɔ zɛrɛ shɔzɛ gbete shɔ ɓayi nya aru yumusunɛ i ɗɔgbete lɔ ɗɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨnyɛ, kɛɗɔn a geliyi kɛ ruɓusinɛm: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />Naa shɔwɔɔ ikɛ ɓawɔ nyanɛ aru yumusunɛ so tɛnɛ, ɔkɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ a ɗɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ pẽniɓa. Yɛ pɛlitɔ shɔwɔɔ pẽniɓa gbete tɛɛ a tɛttɔ shɔ wau nya sɔ̃ntɛjo, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />shɔgbete ɓaa ɔ nya ziti piti kpai yɛ arɛ u gelaa nɛ, &lt;&lt;Yunɛ, a ã jam ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛ pɛ.&gt;&gt;kɛɗɔn shɔyɛ ãã yusẽrɛ a tasaa ɗɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ pẽtẽrẽ naa ɔ̃nɛ ɗɔn. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Ama shɔkɛ waa nyanɛ a ɗɔɔ yumusinɛ a yɛrɛ a ɔ̃ a laa, ɔ̃nɛ gbete pẽtẽrẽ, nɔgbete shɔu waa nya yɛ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Anɛ masa a ɔ̃ la ɔ̃nɛ kiriri-pẽniɓam.&gt;&gt;Shɔm yɛ pɔ̃rɛ shɔ gãsiyi gbete shɔ wayi nya aru yumusinɛ i bassaa waanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Aru shɔgbete ikɛ basiyi yunɛ Ɗalapa yɛ rooriyi a tipi ama shɔgbete ikɛ rooriyi yunɛ Ɗalapa yɛ basiyitɔ pẽniba.<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geli shɔgbete wau nya aru binyatɔ̃nɛ yumusinɛ nɛ, Akɛ waa shɔ nyanɛ aru vishaanɛ ko binyatɔ̃nɛ yumusinɛ mɔkaa ɓaanɛ mɛsayi ko mɛzɔ̃yi ko a shɔbiiyi ko a shɔ nyakãsiri ko shɔ vinaayi aru lewɔɔ i yɛ ɓaa nya sɔ̃njirɛ, a nyaɓangkɔ i yɛ shoraa vigbete a pɛliyitɔ. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Ama a kɛ tɔnɛn waa shɔ nya aru yumusinɛ vishaanɛ, a waa shɔ raayi, shɔgbete i dɔɔ gbangbutu, shɔ gbete u bi vɔkagbete a shɔnɔgbãti. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Ɗalapa yɛ tasaa vɔɔ susãritɔ biini, aru gbete shɔmiyi i yɛ zɛnɔɔ a shorinɛ ɓa. Ɗalapa yɛ shɔraa a lee gbete shɔ tɔ̃vɨn i yɛ yulapa a sàà a suruni.<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruɓusinɛ ayuu yumusinɛ pẽniɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Shɔzɛ gbete atette shɔ gbete i ɔ̃ a la ɔ̃nɛ vishaanɛ a Yesɔ ni, geli Yesɔ nɛ, Ɗalapa u tasi shɔgbete i yɛ shaavi a ɗɔɔ yumusinɛ a Ɗa Kpati roonɛ vɔɔ susãri a biini!<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesɔ geliunɛ, &lt;&lt;Jawɔɔ siɗɔn gbete washɔ nya aru yumusinɛ pẽniɓa, ɓaa shɔzɛ nya waanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Naa ɗaa yumusinɛ vishaanɛu pɛlitɛ, a sho u jawɛrɛ nɛu geli shɔgbete wayi nyanɛ,&lt;Ɔ anɛ, shɔ sɔ̃nri nya vishaanɛ pɛlinɛtɛ!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Ama i piti kpai i gaa nya walinɛ. Shɔ gbete gaa yɛ geli jawɛrɛu nɛ, N woo ɗɔɔ ɔ̃ringtɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ n zɛtɔ, n gakaatɔ, tang gakinɛtɔ. <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Wɔɔ sha sɔ̃nnɛ, &lt; N woo napu jaa lanɛ kopi, n nyaba gbete n kasiyi matinɛ; gbee tang gakinɛtɔ.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Wɔɔ gbete sha sɔ̃njinɛ,&lt; N tɛ so ji dii zitimtɔ, aruumkɔ n yɛn kpaa anɛ ɓa.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />&lt;&lt; Jawɛrɛu sɔrɛ a geli ɓɛshɔwɛrɛ vim piti kpai. Ɓɛshɔwɛrɛ sisɨn lɛsirɛ waanɛ a shanɛ, pɛli tɛ̃ɛ̃ti a gɨn nyaba-nyaba, a ɗɔɔ gogoti komoo, a toli shɔraayi nya, a shɔ dɔɔ gbangbutuyi, a shɔnɔgbãtiyi a shɔ gbete i bi vɔkagbete a n-tiyi arɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />tɛ̃ɛ̃ti jawɛrɛu shanɛ,&lt;Shɔwɛrɛ, a nya-ãsinɛ shɔ pɛlitɛ, ama nyaba doo aɗɔn aru wɔɔ pɛlinɛ.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Kɛɗɔn shɔwɛrɛ geli jawɛrɛu nɛ, &lt; Yɛnɛ a nyaba lanɛ pẽniba a nyaba wujaa a toli shɔ i atɔ, aru n wɛrɛ u yiitɔ. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />N gelɔɔtɛ, shɔzɛ gbete atette shɔgbete shɔ ɓayi nya siyɛ i yɛ ntang vishaanɛ ɓa!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yukɔnɛ aru Yesɔ jadɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />A lewɔɔ shɔzɛ waanɛ i ɗɔgbete i gɨn Yesɔ yɛ, kɛɗɔn a riinɔɔ a geliyinɛ, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />Shɔgbete kasing gɨnnɛ piti kpai, setɛ ɔringtɛ u tɛɛ ɓeye, ko ɓiini, ko ɓeso, ko ɓɛjaayi, ko ɓɛzɔ̃ a ɓɛnaani, u bɛ̃ɛ̃ au yuuni piti kpai. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Shɔgbete ji tuu u laa gbete shɔyɛ ɓau naa aɗɔnyɛ u gɨnrɛ ɓa, yɛ ɔ̃ n jadɔɔ ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />&lt;&lt;Naa shɔwɔɔ awɔ tete kasinɛn maa ɗɔɔ tarara, setɛ ɔ̃tɛ u ɓasi saa vigbete yɛ woliyɛ kɛ ɓasinɛ u zɛkɛkɨn ko u saa aɗɔn gbete yɛ yisi nya ɗɔɔ maanɛtɔ aɗɔn ya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Ama ji pɛliɓa, yɛ zɛnɔɔ ɗɔ gbete gaa maanɛ yisinɛ ɓa; shɔgbete kɛ zɛ vishonɛu nɛ piti kpai yɛ laatiutɔ. <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />I yɛ shanɛ, jam gaa ɗɔɔ maanɛtɛ ama ji zɛnɔɔ yisinɛ ɓa! <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Naa kpati kɛ shɛ ɓilinɛ a shɔ bawaanɛyini lazɔrɔ kopi nɛn tasɨn a kpati wɔɔ, shɔ gbete shɛ sɔ̃njo a shɔ bawaanɛyini lazɔrɔ kopi, kpatiu yɛ ɔ̃ pɛtɔ u gɨn sisɨn ko u kaka aɗɔn gbete shaa kpati wa a sɨn aɗɔn ya. <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Naa kɛ zɛnɛ yɛ zɛnɔɔ ɓa, yɛ sho jashonɛyi i yɛrɛ i kpaa kpati wa i ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ binyatɔ̃nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Yesɔ yisi nyaruu shanɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ji nanko kopiya awɔ tete setɛ yaa vigbete u a wunitɛ piti kpai, nɗau ɔ̃ n jadɔɔ kn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruɓusinɛ ayuu ntayɛ gbete u nya shɔ̃tinɛ ɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Ntayẽ pɛ vitɔ̃vɨng, ama ntayẽ kɛ yaa u nya shɔ̃tinɛnɛ, nyaɓa gbete shɔ sɔriu nya shɔ̃tinɛ toti ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />U vishonɛ toti ɓa a tipini ɓa, ko a dɔjaa, ama see wɛsinɛ weze. Shɔgbete u sho ntanɛ aɗɔn, u ntarɛǃ<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ruɓusinɛ ayuu mɛrɛ̃ɛ̃ gbete niiyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Lewɔɔ siɗɔn shɔ saabɛnɛ tɛnɛ a shɔ ruuviniyini i arɛ aru i nta Yesɔ vimatinɛ, <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />ama Farasiyayi a shɔmala nyaãsinɛ Musa i gaa nya kɨnkɔrɔ nwanɛ i ɗɔgbete shanɛ, jam risiu yuutɛ shɔ ruuviniyi i ɓɛsa, shaa vishaanɛ a yini a ɗɔzɔǃ <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geliyi kɛ ruɓusinɛmː<verse eid="LUK 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />Shɔ tɔpɛnɛ shɔzɛ gbete awɔ tete nɛu mɛrɛ̃ɛ̃ aɗɔn laa maani kɛɗɔn gbete atete ni nii rɛ, yɛ pɛlikɛ pikoviya? Yɛ yaa mɛrɛ̃ɛ̃ gãsiyi laa nɛ̃ɛ̃ti au jaa kopi tu maannɛ ɓa a ɗɔɔ nya shaanɛ, u kãɗɔɔ mɛrɛ̃ɛ̃ gbete au niiyɛ setɛ kpaa ɗɔtɛ ɓaya. <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Kɛ kpaa ɗɔnɛ, yɛ nta sisɨn purutɔ u tuu au lakɔrɔ, <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />u n ti wɛrɛrɛ. Kɛɗɔn yɛ ɓaa ɓɛsayi nyarɛ au shɔnyakãsirini u geliyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ arɛ ɔ pɔ̃sing naa jo a yɛti puru ntanɛmni, aru n kpaa mɛrɛ̃ɛ̃ gbete niiyɛtɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Jinankɔ, n gelɔɔtɛ Ɗalapa yɛ nta yɛti puru waanɛ a kolapa aru shɔ ruuvini gbete yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛtɛ, u tɛɛ shɔzɛ laa nɛ̃ɛ̃ti au jaa kopi tu maanɛɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ gbeteyi i ji kãɓa ruuvini yaanɛ ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruɓusinɛ ayuu saa gbete niiyɛ u niinɛ siliva koin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Yesɔ geliyi ruɓusinɛ wɔɔ sɔ̃nnɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔu tɔɔpɛnɛ suu wɔɔ u saa gbete shɔ ɓaanɛ siliva Koin aɗɔn kopi, u gbete kɛ niinɛ, ɔ zɛnaa yɛ pɛli kɛpikoviya, suu yɛ dɔɔ yaa pitila u koo wɛrɛu rɛ, u kãli ɗɔɔ ko-piɗɔpiya setɛ kpaa ɗɔtɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Naa kɛ kpaanɛ yɛ ɓaa ɓɛsayi nya kpai au shɔ nyakãsirini a ɗɔzɔ u geliyinɛ, &lt;N ɗɔɔ yɛti puru ntanɛ aru n kpaa saa siliva gbete niiyɛtɛ. Ɔ pɔ̃sing naa jo a yɛti puru ntanɛniǃ&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />N gelɔɔtɛ, Ji nankɔ, Ɗa jashɔnɛyi lapa i nta yɛti purutɔ aru shɔ ruuvini gbete yaa ruuvini pɛliyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruɓusinɛ ayuu javɔshɔ gbete niiyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesɔ yɛ ɗekɨn a shanɛni nɛ,&lt;&lt;Jawɔɔ siɗɔn u javɔshɔ ziti.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Shɔ wujaa geli ɓeye nɛ, &lt;&lt;N kasirɛ a ang a vivɔ gbete a yɛ ang yɛ dɔdɔrimkɔ,&gt;&gt; Kɛɗɔn jau vɔsi ɓɛjaayi zitiwi u vinaa rɛ.<verse eid="LUK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />A kɨntiuni ji ɔ̃ɓa dɔkɔkɔni ɓa, shɔ wujaa mɛli u vinaa gãsi, a toliu saa a vi gãsiyini kpai a yaa wɛrɛrɛ. A yɛkɛ tipi kpɛlɛ-kpɛlɛ a ɗɔuni, a ɗɔwakɔ nyo sãu piti kpai a nyaɓa sɔrɔɔ a suu kpangtangyi yuu kpai. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Akɨnti gbete nyo vi gbete u a wuniyɛtɛ piti. kɛɗɔn vaanwo shɛrɛ waanɛ a tipiuni ko-piɗɔpiya, siu vi sɔ̃nyatɛ kpai. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Kɛɗɔn a yɛrɛ kã vishonɛ a shɔzɛ gbete naa, jaa tipiu kɔ, kɛɗɔn jau dɔ̃u naarɛ nɛu gasin ganya au jaa, <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />A kãrɛ nɛn shaa vishaanɛ gbete ganya i shaayɛ, ama shɔwɔɔ ji ãwu viwɔɔ ɓa nɛu shaarɛ ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Akɨntini kpai naa gɨn ruumtɛ au sisɨn a shanɛ, Maye jawɛrɛ piti kpai i ɗɔgbete shaavi i yaa gãsi a tipi waanɛ ama nkɔng yɛm a ɗɔɔ vɔnɛ a nwoniǃ <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />N yɛn yulapa n sɔɔ mayɛ ɗɔbii n geliunɛ, &lt;&lt;Maye n pɛli Ɗalapa ruuvinitɛ a mokɔni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />N ji yɛɓa nɔgbete shɔu ɓannɛ mɛjau toti ɓa; ama a tunkɛ naa shɔzɛ gbete atette mɛjawɛrɛyi. <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Kɛɗɔn a yurɛ sã nyaɓa yɛnɛ ɓeye ɗɔbii</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">Ama siu doo aɗɔ kpɛlɛ a nyaɓa wɛrɛ ɓeye zɛurɛ; raa sã ɓeye rɛ, a yurɛ a kɔ̃ti ɓɛjaa naa abi u ɗɔgbete tasiu ɔrinɛ.<verse eid="LUK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Ɓɛjaa shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Maye, n pɛli Ɗalapa ruuvinitɛ, a mokɔni. N ji yɛɓa shɔu ɓannɛ mɛjau toti ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Ama ɓeye ɓaa u jawɛrɛyi nyarɛ, a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Radɔɔ ɗɔnǃ Ɔ n ti fãrã tɔ̃vɨn ɔ tosiu abi. Ɔ tosiu saa jana a korãtini a dɔɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Kɛɗɔn ɔ yɛnɛ ɔ n ti gunapu gbete nutɔ ɔ yeerɛ, u musiyuu u shaarɛ u nta yɛti puru! <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Aru si majam vɔtɛ, ama dɔdɔrim u a suruni; si niitɛ, ama dɔdɔrim n kpautɛ. Kɛɗɔn i piti kpai i gaa yumusinɛrɛ.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />Kɛɗɔn u jaa pẽniɓa u si ɓili a jaa. Aɗagbete a wɛrɛ yɛ, naa atɛ a nyaɓa wɛrɛ maani, a nta viwaanɛ a soni a sasanɛni. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Kɛɗɔn a ɓaa jawɛrɛ wɔɔ nya gbete a hɨu nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ivi a ɗɔɔ yɛnɛ viya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Jawɛrɛu kasiu nyanɛ&lt;&lt;Mɛzɔ̃u sɔɔ wɛrɛtɛ, meye pɔ̃rɛ shɔ yeeriu gunapu aru sɔɔ wɛrɛtɛ a suruni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Ama ɓɛjaa pẽniɓa tuu sisɨn waanɛ ji to yɛti wɛrɛ ɓa; kɛɗɔn ɓeye shɛrɛ a gakiu nɛ u to yɛti wɛrɛ nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Ama kasi ɓeye nya a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Kɨnnɔɔ pɛ, saa piti kpai n pɛlaa vishonɛ naa jawɛrɛ, n ji ɓɛ saa nyaɓa ɓagbete niɓa.&gt;&gt; A ãnkɛ i vi ɓa gbete niviya? ko jàà ma a ji ang ɓa ɓagbeteni ɓa nɛn musi yuu nɛn nta yɛti puru a masayi ni ɓa! <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Ama mɛjam zɔ a vinaa tɛ piti kpai a suu kpangtanyi yuu, naa a wɛrɛ tɛ a yeeriu gunapu nonɛtɛ!<verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Ɓeye kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Majaa, a ɓɛɛjo nkɔni a lee-lee a ɗɔzɔ, vigbete n a wuniyɛ ji a ɓɛɛko. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Ama ntootɔ u musiyuu tɔ u nta yɛti puru aru mɛzɔ̃m si vɔtɛ, ama dɔdɔrim u a suruni, si niitɛ ama dɔdɔrim n kpautɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ruɓusinɛ aru shɔ-viganɛ gbɔrki wɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesɔ geliu jadɔyinɛ&lt;&lt; Shɔ vinaa wɔɔ siɗɔn gbete ãu shɔviganɛ u vinaa nɛu kɨnrin nɔɔ aɗɔn. A kɨntiuni shɔ geli shɔvinau nɛ, nɛu shɔviganɛ u ɗɔgbete u zɔki u saa yɛ, <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Kɛɗɔn shɔwɛrɛu a ɓau shɔviganɛu nyarɛ a geliu nɛ, N nta ivi aa yuuni viya? Ɔ̃nɛ a ɓasi n vinaa gbete aa ɗɔbii piti kpai, aru a yɛ ɔ̃ toti n shɔviganɛ ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Kɛɗɔn shɔviganɛu hɨu yuu nɛ, &lt; N shɔwɛrɛ yɛ nyikin kɛtɔ ang vishonɛni, n pɛli kɛpikoviya? N kaka jasaa lanɛ sɔ̃n ɓa, n usẽ vi gakinɛ sɔ̃n ɗɔn. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />N zɛ vigbete n yɛn pɛliyɛtɛǃ Naa shɔ kɛ nyikinnɛ ang vishonɛni, n yɛn sã wesayi ai yɛ tɛng naa ai wɛrɛ yɛ.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Kɛɗɔn ɓaa shɔ gbete ɓɛshɔwɛrɛ gɨyi vi nya rɛ piti kpai. A hɨ shɔ gbete a ɗekɨn nɛ,&lt;Mashɔwɛrɛ gɨn a nɛkɨnya&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />A kasinya nɛ, &lt;Nɔɔ zeetun tutu laa maani&gt; nkɔ a vi n ɓasaa yɛ yɛm, Shɔviganɛu geliu nɛ; ɔ̃nɛ a bee laa ziti atu kopi. <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Kɛɗɔn a hɨ shɔgbete pɛsiyɛnɛ, mɔkɔ ma shɔ gɨn a nɛkɨn ya? A kasinyanɛ, &lt;Lazɔrɔ vishaa laa taati, nkɔ a vi n ɓasiyɛ yɛm,&gt; Shɔviganɛu geliu nɛ; &lt;Beenɛ laa ziti au jaa mantaa.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />&lt;&lt;Kɛɗɔn shɔwɛrɛu bɛli shɔviganɛ nyayeenɛ aru u ruu kpɛ̃nɛ aɗɔn. Jakɨntiyi zɛnɔɔ gɨnnɛtɛ a ɓɛzɔɔyi jakɨntini a ruu kpɛ̃nɛ u tɛɛ shɔ gbete i ɗɔsẽsẽ tɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yesɔ yɛ ɗekɨn a shanɛ ni nɛ,&lt;&lt;N gelɔɔtɛː Ɔ sho vishonɛ awɔ vinaa aru ɔ kãrɔɔ yuu wesayi, nɔgbete ɔ vinaa kɛ yisinyanɛ, Ɗalapa yɛ tɛwɔ naatɔ a kolapa ɗɔgbete suru yisinya ɓa dangdang. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Shɔgbete kɛ pɛli tɔ̃vɨnɛ a vi fɛ̃ɛ̃ ni, yɛ pɛli tɔ̃vɨntɔ a vi pẽnibani, shɔgbete ji pɛli tɔ̃vɨn ɓa a vi fɛ̃ɛ̃ ni ɓa, yɛ pɛli tɔ̃ɓa a vi pẽnibani ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />A ji zɛnɔɔ saa gbete Ɗalapa ãyɛ sãnɛ ɓa a kotipimni ɓa, a yɛ sã suru gbete sɔ̃ nyaɓa yɛ kɛpikovi a lapa niviya? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Ɔ ji kɔ shɔwɔɔ vinaa ɓa, pi yɛ ãwɔ vigbete ɔ ɓɛɛyɛ piya?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />&lt;&lt;Jawɛrɛ wɔɔ ɓa gbete yɛ ɔ̃ foo a shɔwɛrɛ ziti i dɔɔ yɛ ɓa; ko u bẽẽ gbete u ɔri gbete, ko u ã sisɨn a gbete nya u bɛsi wɔɔ nyatɔ. A yɛ gɨn Ɗalapa dɔɔɓa a saani ɗɔzɔɔni piti kpai ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ ruu shanɛ wɔɔyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Naa Farasiyayi i nta vigbete Yesɔ shayɛtɛ piti kpai, i latirɛ aru i ɔri saa bang. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yesɔ geliyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔkɔɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete i kasi tasinɛ a shɔ ɗekɨn nɛyi pɛ shɔ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔyi.&gt;&gt; Ama Ɗalapa zɛwɔ sisɨnyi tɛttɔ, vi gbete shɔzɛ bassi yɛ, ikɔ vigbete Ɗalapa kasi zɛnɛ ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Nya ãsinɛ Musa a laabeenɛ Ɗa jashonɛyi shɔ gɨnjo ukɔ anɛ ɗagbete Yɔhana shɔ Batizima a yɛ; ama sãnɛ ɗagbete shɔ nwa ruu tɔ̃vɨn aru Ɗa kpati roonɛ yɛ, kopiya u ɗɔgbete kã nyaba tonɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Ama yɛ ɔ̃ pɛlaa kolapa a kotipi ni i yisinyarɛ, a nogbete shɔ tɔnɛ javi dɔnɛ gbete a yɛti labee Musa u nii rɛ.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Kopiya kɛ yaa ɓeso naa nɛ a tɛ so wɔɔ pɛli kpangtangtɛ, shɔ gbete kɛ tɛ so gbete shɔ yau naa nɛ pɛli kpangtang a suuni.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔvinaa a Liyazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Shɔwɔɔ siɗɔn shɔ vinaa gbete tosi fãrã gbete u saa a yuuni, shaa vishaanɛ gbete tɔ̃vɨn ko-pi lee-piya. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Ama shɔwɔɔ si sɔ̃n ɗɔn, shɔ raa u niinɛ Liyazaro, u nɔrɔ abi vɔ̃sɔ̃k, shɔ n-tiu a shɔ vinaa nyaba wɛrɛ a lee-lee, <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />liyazarɔ kasinɛn shaa vishaanɛ gbete tẽli a tipi a shɔ vinaa la-ɔ̃nɛ vishaanɛ. ko zaayi ma i arɛ i ɗɛɛtiu nɔ̃rɔ̃tɔ.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Kɛɗɔn shɔ rau vɔrɛ, Ɗa jashonɛ lapa i tuurɛ, i ãu ɗɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ kiriri a ɗɔɔ yumusinɛ a Ibirayi ɗɔbii a kolapa. Shɔ vinaa vɔrɛ shɔ gbãurɛjo. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />A wɛrɛ yaa, shɔ vinaa u ɗɔɔ raɓoonɛ waanɛ, kɛɗɔn a ɗee yuu a zɛ Ibirayi aɗɔ kpɛlɛ a Liyazaroni au kagɨn. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />kɛɗɔn a ɓaa nya, maye Ibirayi! Ntang raajo, a sho Liyazaro pɛ u ɗii janaa a mii u ɗii ang ɗɛɛti n nta ɗɔ bàànɛ pɛjo, aru n a ɗɔɔ raɓoonɛ waanɛ a yɛti yaam!<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Ama Ibirayi shanɛ, kpaasisɨn pɛ majaa, aɗagbete a si a kotipi yɛ, a si a vigbete tɔ̃vɨn ni kpai, Liyazaro kpaa ɓɛjo vi kɔ̃linɛ piti kpai. Ama dɔdɔrim u ɗɔgbete nta binyatɔ̃nɛ aɗɔm, a sɔ̃nji ɗɔɔ raaɓoonɛ waanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Ɓa shɔnkɔ sheeli ɓa, au tete a ɔkɔɔni too pẽniɓa aɗɔn gbete shɔ pɛliyɛ, aru u zããri shɔgbete kasi tɛɛnɛ yɛnɛ ɔ ɗɔbii ko anɛ u ɗɔbii.<verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Shɔ vinaau shanɛ, N gakaatɔ, maye Ibirayi, sho Liyazaro pɛ yɛnɛ mayɛ wɛrɛ, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />aru mazɔ̃yi aɗɔn maani, u yɛrɛ u gɔ̃yi yuushopɛ nɔgbete ikɔ sɔɔnɛ toti a ɗɔgbete n ɗɔɔ raaɓoonɛ waanɛ a ɗɔmi.<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Ibirayi shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Mɛzɔ̃yi i shɔ yuusho gɔ̃nɛ aɗɔn Musa a Ɗa jashonɛyini; mɛzɔ̃yi i weshopɛ jo ai nyakɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Shɔ vinaa kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ji tesi ɓa, maye Ibirayi! Ama shɔwɔɔ kɛ yunɛ sàà kɛ yɛ i ɗɔbiinɛ, i yɛ yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛtɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Ama Ibirayi shanɛ, i ji wesho ɓa Musa nyani a Ɗa jashonɛni ɓa, ko shɔwɔɔ u yurɛ a sàà i yɛ wesho ɓau nyani ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Ruuvini,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesɔ geliu jadɔyi nɛː &lt;&lt;Ɔ̃tɛ lakɔrɔ shɔu kpaa vigbete pɔ̃ shɔ wẽsinɛ a ruuvini yɛtɔ, ama shɔgbete i pɔ̃ shɔ i pɛli ruuviniyɛ i yukɔnɛ aɗɔn. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Yɛ ɔ̃riu pɛlaa shɔu masiu rɛɛ pẽniba akɔrɔ shɔu lɔkiu a wapo a no gbete yɛ pɔ̃ shɔzɛ gbete atette jajjamiyi nɛi pɛli ruuvini yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Ɔ kɨnɔɔtɔ vigbete ɔ pɛliyɛni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">&lt;&lt; Mɛzɔɔ kɛ pɛli ruuvininɛ a lasiutɔ, ama kɛ kɔsi sisɨn nɛ, a yasiu ruuvinitɔ. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Naa mɛzɔ̃u kɛ pɛlaa ruuvininɛ lee gbetenkɔ ɓa maazii, ko piɗagbete piya naa kɛ sɔɔnɛ aa ɗɔbii kɛ shanɛ, &lt;N yaa ruuvini tɛ,&gt; ɔ̃raatɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ a yasiu ruuvini tɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sisɨn ãnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ jashonɛyi i geli Ubeyelapa nɛ,&lt;&lt;ãu sisɨn ãnɛ pɛ u ɔ̃ pẽnibaǃ&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Ubeyelapa kasinya nɛ, naa ɔ sisɨn ãnɛ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ ɗɔn pẽniba naa zɔvi gbete shɔ ɓaanɛ musita, ɔ yɛ zɛnɔɔ laa pẽniba gbete shɔ ɓaanɛ mobari nya ãsinɛtɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Aa yuunɛ àà gɨnrini a yɛrɛ a shɔ a yuu atette wapo!&gt;&gt; Lawu yɛ gɨn a nyatɔ.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jawɛrɛ u vishonɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Shɔu tɔpɛnɛ a jawɛrɛ ɗɔn gbete lasaa gbaa napu ko gasaa mɛrɛ̃ɛ̃ yɛ. naa kɛ sɔɔ wɛrɛ nɛ a jaa, a yɛ geliu kati nɛ,&lt;&lt;Anɛ tɛ̃ɛ̃ti a shaa a vishaanɛ ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Ɓa, yɛ pɛli ɓa nanni ɓa! Ama yɛ shanɛ, Yɛnɛ a nwarin vishaanɛ ɗarɛ pɛtɔ, tosaa fãrã vishonɛ pɛ a gantɔ n shaa pogo a ɓoonɛ ni, n yisi pogo n ɗaa a shaa ɓɛɛ kɨn? <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Jawɛrɛu ji yɛɓa a nɔgbete shɔ dɔ̃riu yɛɓa aru nya ãsinɛ gbete gɨnyɛni ɓa, yɛtɛ ya? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Ji nankɔ a ɔkɔni; naa ɔkɛ pɛli vigbete shɔ gelɔɔyɛ nɛ piti kpai, ɔyɛ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;U ɓɛɛjo jawɛrɛ weze; U pɛli bɛjo u vishonɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ gati shɔ vibiiyi kopi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Naa Yesɔ sã nyaba tɛ yɛnɛ Urushalima, sɔɔ nyaɓala tipi Galili a Samariya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Siyɛ tokɛ jakomɔɔ wɔɔ, kɛɗɔn kpaa shɔzɛ kopi gbete i ɗɔɔ raɓoonɛ a vibiini, i shi a ɗɔɔ kpɛlɛ au ɗekɨn <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />I shati nya i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Yesɔ! shɔwɛrɛ ntau raa joǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Naa Yesɔ zɛirɛ a geliyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ yɛnɛ ɔ tasɔɔ yuu a shɔu pɛli vi yuu ãnɛ a jaa Ɗa ɗɔbii i zɛutɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">I ɗɔɔ yɛnɛ nyaba, i gatirɛ.<verse eid="LUK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Shɔzɛ gbete atette shɔ vibiiyi, naa zɛtɛ nɛn gati tɛ, sɔɔ Yesɔ ɗɔbiirɛ u ɗɔgbete bɛli Ɗalapa nii a yenya pẽniba. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Kɛɗɔn jau arɛ a ɓaki a tipi a Yesɔ dɔɔ a dɔ̃riurɛ. Jau usi shɔ tipi Samariya.<verse eid="LUK 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yesɔ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔ ji gati ɓa shɔzɛ kopi ɓaya? Shɔ gãsi mannɛ̃ɛ̃wi i kɛpiya? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Aru ivi ji shɔzatinkɔ sheeli sɔɔrɛ nɛn dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa pɛ viya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geliu jaunɛ, &lt;&lt;Yunɛ a yɛrɛ; a sisɨn ãnɛ gataatɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗa kpati roonɛ anɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Kɛɗɔn gãsi farasiyayi i hɨ Yesɔ nɛ, Ɗa kpati roonɛ yɛ a pi ɗaviya, Yesɔ kasiyinya nɛ, Ɗa kpati roonɛ a ɓa nɔgbete shɔ zɛyɛ ɓa, <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Shɔ wɔ yɛ shaɓanɛ, &lt;&lt;Kɨnnɔɔ pɛ u yɛm! ko Nkɔu yɛwa!&gt;&gt; Ama Ɗa kpati roonɛ jo awɔ tete bimkɔ.<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geliu jadɔyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;ɗaa kaanɛ gbete ɔ yɛ kasi nɛi zɛɛ dii gbete atette Shɔzɛja dii, ama ɔ yɛ zɛ ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Shɔwɔyi i yɛ gelɔɔnɛ, &lt;&lt;Kɨnnɔɔ pɛ yɛwa, ko Kɨnnɔɔ pɛ yɛm,&gt;&gt; Ama ɔkɔɔ gɨyinɛ nɛi zɛpɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Dii gbete Shɔzɛja yɛ a yɛ, yɛ ɔ̃ naa ɗɔ kɔlinɛ a koo nyasi, yɛ koli yaa aɗɔgbete koo doonya yɛnɛ kolapa. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Ama Shɔzɛja yɛ ɓoo ɗekɨn pɛ raa waanɛ, shɔ jakɨntimiyi i yɛ bɛ̃u ruubiitɔ.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Nogbete ɔ̃ si a ɗaa Nuhu yɛ, yɛ ɔ̃ ji nankɔ aɗagbete n Shɔzɛja n yɛ sɔɔyɛni. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />A ɗauni si kopiya ɓɛɛ jo ɗɔɔ vishaanɛ a boonɛ ni, shɔ ɗɔɔ zɔɔ tɛnɛ, a jaa wɛrɛ dɔ̃nɛni yɛnɛ leegbete Nuhu to latosi yɛ. Kɛɗɔn mii sãnɛ arɛ a siyirɛ piti kpai.<verse eid="LUK 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Yɛ ɔ̃ naa ɗaa Loti, kopiya u ɗɔɔ shaanɛ a boonɛ ni, kopiya u ɗɔɔ vi wɔnɛ a mɛlinɛ ni, kopiya u ɗɔɔ vi ɓaanɛ a ɗɔɔ wɛrɛ maanɛni. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Ama alee gbete Loti yaa sɔdom yɛ, yaa shɛ a lapa a tari yaani a nyoyi piti kpai.<verse eid="LUK 17:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />&lt;&lt;Yɛ ɔ̃ ji nankɔ alee gbete n Shɔzɛja n yɛ sɔɔyɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Alee wakɔ shɔgbete kɛ ɔ̃nɛ yujaa gbete pɛtɛlɛ lapa ukɔ nonɛ nɛn tuu viwɔɔ a yɛti wɛrɛ; Jinankɔ shɔgbete u a jaa ukɔ sɔu wɛrɛnɛ nɛn tuu viwɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Ɔ kpaa sisɨn a vigbete kpaa Loti ɓeso yɛ! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Shɔgbete kɛ tonɛ nɛn raa u suru, yɛ rariu naatɔ, ama shɔgbete u suru kɛ rariu naa nɛ ang yuu yɛ kpaa sɔ̃ntɔ. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />N gelɔɔtɛ a zɨmbawakɔ, shɔyɛ kpaa shɔzɛ ziti i ɗɔɔ roonɛ a laroonɛ, shɔyɛ tuu gbete a ya gbete ɗɔn. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Shɔ kpaa suuyi ziti a ɗɔɔ vi nanɛ rɛɛ shɔ yɛ tuu gbete ama shɔyɛ ya gbete aɗɔn. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />(Shɔzɛ ziti i ɗɔɔ jalanɛ shɔ yɛ tuu gbete a yaa gbete aɗɔn.)<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Yesɔ jadɔyi i hɨunɛ&lt;&lt;Vim yɛ pɛli pi ɗɔpiya, Uɓeyelapa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Yesɔ kasiyinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɗɔgbete vivɔrɔ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ ɗɔnyɛ, gãshavɔrɔ i toli nya ji ɗɔukɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Ruɓusinɛ ayuu suvɔ a shɔ ruu vɔsinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geliu jadɔyi rubusinɛ aru u matiyi nɔgbete i gaki Ɗa ko-pi lee piya ikɔ nyo sisɨnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Yesɔ shanɛː Shɔ ruvɔsinɛ wɔɔ siɗɔn a koo wɔɔ gbete nta seti Ɗalapa ɓa, bassi shɔ ɓa <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Suvɔ wɔɔ si sɔ̃njo a kouni, gbete ali shɔ ruu vɔsinɛ ɗɔbii, u ɗɔɔ gakinɛ nɛu ãng tɔ̃vɨn, a shanɛ, sɔkkɔ yeerin ruumpɛ tɔ̃vɨn aru nya yeerinɛ gbete n shɔnɔpɔ̃ i yeerimɓa yuumǃ<verse eid="LUK 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Shɔ ruu vɔsinɛu ɓɛ̃ɛ̃pɛ a ɗauni anɔni, ama a kɨntiuni a geliu yuu nɛ, Ko n nta Ɗalapa seti ɓa, n bassi shɔ ɓa, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />ama aru gbete suvɔm yɔrintɛ bang, n yɛn pɛli nɔgbete n pɛliyɛ u kpaa vigbete gaki yɛ, n ji pɛli ɓa, yɛ yɛ ɗekɨn ang ɗɔbii alinɛni u pɔ̃nrɛ n yɔɔ waanɛǃ<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Kɛɗɔn Ubeyelapa shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ nta vigbete shɔ ruvɔsinɛ gbete kuli shɔnɔmi shayɛ pɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Ɗalapa yɛ yeeruu tɔ̃vɨn ɓaya, u ãu shɔbiiyi gbete i sɨnriu niti a zɨmɓani tɔ̃vɨn ɓaya? Yɛ wari yuutɔ ai ɗɔɔ naa pɔ̃sinɛnin ya? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />N gelɔɔtɛ, yɛ ntayi nyavɔtɔ, u shorii vigbete i kasiyɛ tɛ̃ɛ̃tiǃ Ama naa n Shɔzɛja nkɛ sɔɔnɛ, yɛ kpaa shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ kati a kooni ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rubusinɛ a Farasiyayi i yuu a shɔ sabɛnɛ tɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yesɔ sha ruɓusinɛm aru shɔ gbete i tuyi yunɛ ikɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbeteyi pɛli vi tɔ̃vɨn ama i risi shɔwɔɔ pɛtɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />Yesɔ shanɛ, Shɔwɔyi siɗɔn ziti i yɛ ɗɔ Ɗa jaa yuu ãnɛ: gbete si Shɔ Farasiya wɔɔ si shɔ sabɛnɛ tɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Kɛɗɔn shɔ Farasiyau yurɛ gaa Ɗa gakinɛ a shanɛ, n dɔ̃raatɛ Ɗalapa, nɔgbete mɓa naa shɔzɛ gãsiyi gbete i rari shɔ vi a kaka ɓa, mɓa shɔgbete i sha ruu kɔ̃linɛyi ɓa, ko, mɓa kpãngtãng ɓa, mɓa naa shɔwɔɔ ɓa, n dɔ̃raatɛ mɓa naa shɔ sabɛnɛ tɛnɛm ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />A lumɔ gbete n manyatɔ lee ziti, atette vi kopi gbete n kpaayɛ n ã gbetetɔ a ɓuzɨn ni.<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Ama shɔ sabɛnɛ tɛnɛu shi a a ɗɔɔ kpɛlɛ, ji ɗeu nɔɔ ɓa kolapani ɓa, ama a waa naa au nɔsisɨn u tasinɛ u pɛ shɔ ruuvini yaanɛ a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɗalapa ntang rajo, n pɛ shɔruvini!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Yesɔ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;N gelɔɔtɛ, shɔ ruuvinim sɔɔ wɛrɛ rɛ a sisɨn puru a Ɗalapa dekɨn, ɓa naa Farasiyam ɓa. Shɔgbete kɛ tuu yuunɛ shɔyɛ rooriu a tipi, ama shɔgbete kɛ roori yuunɛ shɔyɛ basiu pẽniba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ tasi jajjayi bẽrẽti vɔɔ susãri bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Shɔwɔɔyi n ti Yesɔ jabẽrẽtiyi nɛu pɔ̃siyi naa a yuu. Yesɔ jadɔyi naa i zɛtɛ nankɔ, kɛɗɔn i lasi shɔtɔ, <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />ama Yesɔ ɓaa jajjayi nya au ɗɔbii a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ yaa jabɛ̃rɛ̃tiyitɔ i ang ɗɔbiirɛ, ɔkɔɔ zãriyinɛ, aru Ɗa kpati roonɛ naa shɔmiyi i ɓɛɛkɔ. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Ɔ kpaa sisɨn tɔ! Shɔgbete ji tɛ ruu Ɗa kpati roonɛ ɓa naa jajjaa ɓa, yɛ to ɗɔu ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ vinaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Yupɛ̃ni Yuhudawa wɔɔ hɨ Yesɔ nɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔmala tɔ̃vɨn, n yɛ pɛlikovi n kpaa suru gbete yisi ɓa yɛ viya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Hɨunɛ, &lt;&lt;A ɓang pi ruu ivi nɛn shɔ tɔ̃vɨn viya?&gt;&gt;Shɔ tɔ̃vɨn ji gbete ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Ɗalapa sheeli, <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />a zɛ nya ãsinɛ tɛttɔː &lt;&lt;Mokaa roonɛ shɔwɔɔ soni, mokaa nyɔ shɔnɛ, makaa ɓɔɔ shɔ vinɛ, mɔkaa shinɛ ayuu vigbete ɓa nizɛ ɓa; a bassi meyetɔ a minini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Jau risinya nɛ&lt;&lt; N gɨn nya ãsinɛm tɛttɔ piti kpai sing doo pẽtẽrẽ anɛ dɔdɔrim.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Naa Yesɔ nta vigbete jau shayɛtɛ, a geliu nɛ,&lt;&lt;Rosaatɛ vi gbete a yɛ pɛliyɛ. Mɛlaa vinaa piti kpai a ã saa shɔ raayi, a yɛ kpaa vinaa kɛ kolapa. Kɛɗɔn a arɛ a gɨnrɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Naa nta vigbete Yesɔ geliu yɛtɛ, u sisɨn lɛsirɛ waanɛ, aru u vinaa siɗɔn waanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesɔ zɛrɛ u sisɨn lɛsitɛ a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Yɛ ɔ̃ri shɔ vinaayi yukɔnɛ pẽniba i to ɗɔɔ Ɗa kpati roonɛrɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Yɛ ɔ̃ri woba pɛlaa u to nɔɔ ɓoo a no gbete shɔ vinaa yɛ to ɗɔgbete Ɗa roo kpati aɗɔn yɛrɛ.<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Shɔgbete i nta ruum i hɨ Yesɔ nɛ, piyɛ ranaa kɛpiya?<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesɔ kasiyinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Vigbete shɔzɛ zɛ naa yɛ pɛli dɔɔɓa yɛ, a Ɗalapa bi yɛ pɛlitɔ. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Bituru geli Yesɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt; Kɨnnɔɔ pɛ, u yau u vigbete u a wuniyɛtɛ piti kpai u gɨn atɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesɔ geliyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;N gelɔɔtɛ, shɔgbeteu kɛ yaa wɛrɛnɛ ko ɓeso, ɓezɔ̃yi, Beye a ɓinini wɔsɔ̃n ɓɛɛ jaayini aru u ã yuu aru Ɗa kpati roonɛ, shɔwɔɔ ɓa atette mini ɓa a shɔ yɛ raau ɓa yɛ, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />vigbete yaa yɛ piti kpai Ɗalapa yɛ ãu wɔsɔ̃n u tɛɛ vigbete siu a wunitɔ, yɛ kpaa suru gbete yɛ yisi nyaɓa sɔ̃n a koo gbete kanɛ yɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ nwanya sɔ̃n au yuu vɔnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesɔ tuu u jadɔyi kopi tu ziti kagbete a geliyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ weshopɛ! U yakɛ Urushalima vigbete Ɗa jashonɛyi i bee a n Shɔzɛja yuu yɛ ɔ̃ nizɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Shɔyɛ ãu shɔgbete i ɓa Yahudawa ɓa a naa, i yɛ ãriu nya, i dãurɛ, i tulu susãri bi. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />I yɛ waurɛ a nyɔu vɔrɔ, ama lee taati yɛ yulapa a suruni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Ama Yesɔ jadɔyi iji kpaa kara ruugbete Yesɔ nwanya au yuuni ɓa. Shɔ ɓusi ruu dɔɔtɔ ai ɗɔbiini, i ji zɛ vigbete Yesɔ nwanya au yuuni ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ gati shɔ vi gakinɛ nɔgbãti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Naa Yesɔ atɛ maani a Yerikoni, shɔ nogbãti wɔɔ si ɗɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ a nyakara nyaba uɗɔɔ vi gakinɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Naa shɔ nogbãti nta mɔɔyitɛ i ɗɔɔ tɛnɛ kɛɗɔn a hɨnɛ, &lt;&lt;Ivi ɗɔɔ yɛnɛni viya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Shɔ geliu nɛ,&lt;&lt;Pɛ Yesɔ shɔ nazara tɛrɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Kɛɗɔn shɔ nogbãtiu ɓaa nya a gãgãni,&lt;&lt;Yesɔ Dauda ɓɛjaa ntang raajoǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Shɔgete isi dekɨn yɛ, i lasiu nɛ, zẽnyanɛ, ama jau kaa nya sɔ̃n a gãgãni bang nɛ, &lt;&lt;Dauda ɓɛjaa nta raajoǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ shirɛ a ãsi nyanɛ shɔu n-tiu arɛ yɛm au ɗɔbii. Naa atɛ maani Yesɔ hɨunɛ, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />&lt;&lt;A kasi nɛn pɛlaa iviya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Jau kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔmala n kasirɛ n zɛɗɔ sɔ̃ntɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesɔ geliu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Zɛ ɗɔnɛ! A sisɨn ãnɛ gataatɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Tɛ̃ɛ̃ti kpaa ɗɔ zɛnɛrɛ a gɨn Yesɔ rɛ, u ɗɔgbete dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa yɛ. Naa mɔɔyi zɛtɛ, kɛɗɔn i piti kpai i bɛli Ɗalapa rɛ.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ a Zakka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesɔ to Yeriko u ɗɔɔ tɛnɛ yɛti kou. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Yupɛ̃ni saa bɛnɛ tɛnɛ wɔɔ ɗɔn gbete u niinɛ Zakka. U si shɔ vinaa. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Zakka kasinɛn zɛ shɔgbete shɔ ɓaunɛ Yesɔ pɛ, ama aru upɛ shɔ terere ji zɛ Yesɔ ɓa aru mɔɔyi si bang. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Kɛɗɔn Zakka yurɛ yɛ ɗekɨn a gẽ laa sɨnti wɔɔ pẽniba aru u zɛ Yesɔ, si Yesɔ yɛ sɔɔji ɗɔukɔ.<verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Naa Yesɔ to dɔɔ laautɛ, a ɗee nɔɔ a lapa, a geli Zakka nɛ, &lt;&lt;Nonɛ tɛ̃ɛ̃ti, Zakka n yɛn roo nɛmjo aa wɛrɛkɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Kɛɗɔn Zakka norɛ tɛ̃ɛ̃ti, a tɛ Yesɔ naarɛ a sisɨn puru.<verse eid="LUK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Naa shɔwi piti kpai i zɛ vimtɛ kɛɗɔn i gaa nyanwalinɛ a kn kɔrɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Jau witi zatitɛ a shɔ ruuvini wɛrɛǃ &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Kɛɗɔn Zakka yurɛ a shi Uɓeyelapa ɗekɨn a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Weshopɛ, shɔmalaǃ Ãng tete vinaa n yɛn vɔsi ɗɔ ziti n ã shɔ raayi ɗɔgbete, shɔgbete n kuliyi nɔɔtɛ kpai, n yɛn sɔriyi ɓa nɛ̃ɛ̃ti a vigbete n tɛ ai naa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesɔ geliu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Nɛm raanɛ aa wɛrɛmtɛ, aru ukɔ ma uji Ibirayi ɓɛurukɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Shɔzɛja arɛ nɛn raa shɔ u kã shɔgbeteu niiyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruɓusinɛ a jawɛrɛ kopi i yuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Aru si mɔɔyi i doo ɗɔgbete i wesho a Yesɔ nya yɛ, Yesɔ yɛ ɗekɨn u ɗɔgbete geliyi ruɓusinɛ yɛ. Aru si Yesɔ atɛ maani a Urushalimani, shɔ tee sisɨn nɛ Ɗa gaa kɛ kpati roonɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ shanɛː Shɔwɔɔ siɗɔn pẽniba gbete sã nyaba yɛnɛ komɔɔ wɔɔ kpɛlɛ aru shɔ ãu kpati, a kɨntiuni pɛli nyaba wɛrɛ sɔɔnɛrɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Naa yuu zati yɛnɛtɛ, a ɓaa u jawɛrɛ kopiwi nya, a vɔsi ko-pi shɔpiya saa tarimɛɛ a geliyi nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔ riki naa a saa mini setɛn sɔɔtɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Ama u shɔbiiyi i bɛ̃ɛ̃ u ruubii noni, kɛɗɔn i sho jashonɛyi a kɨnti gbete yɛtɛ, nɛyi shanɛ, u ji kasi ɓa jam u ɔ̃ u kpati rɛ ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Naa shɔ ã jau kpatitɛ a sɔɔrɛ. Tɛ̃ɛ̃ti a ɓau jawɛrɛyi nyarɛ nɛi apɛ ang ɗɔbii, aru nɛn zɛkɨn nɛi kpaa nɛkɨn ayuu saa gbete n ãyɛ niya.<verse eid="LUK 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Jawɛrɛ gbete gaa anɛ yɛ shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔwɛrɛ n rikinaatɛ a saa tarimɛɛ gbete a ang yɛni n kpaaraaɓa lazɔrɔ kopi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />U shɔwɛrɛ risinya nɛ, nn bee, a pɛ jawɛrɛ tɔ̃vɨn! Aru gbete a pɛli vi pẽtẽrẽ tɛ sisɨn gbete, n yɛn sing arɛ a ɔ̃ kpati a komɔɔ pẽniba kopi,<verse eid="LUK 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />U jawɛrɛ gbete pɛsiyɛ arɛ a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpati, n rikinaatɛ n kpaaraatɛ saa tarimɛɛ maani ayuu vi gbete aa ang yɛni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Geliu jawɛrɛn nɛ, &lt;&lt; A yɛ ɔ̃ kpati komɔɔ maani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />&lt;&lt; Kɛɗɔn jawɛrɛ wɔɔ arɛ a shanɛ, Kpati, nkaa saa tarimɛɛ yɛm; n ma a nya jafãrã n ɓusitɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Seti pɛlintɔ mɔni, aru a pɛ shɔ lanɛ. A tɛ vigbete ɓa a ɓɛɛ ɓa, a yee vi aɗɔgbete a ji ɓaa ɓa yɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />U shɔwɛrɛ geliu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Apɛ jawɛrɛ kɔ̃linɛǃ N yɛn shovi jo a nyakɔ n shataarɛǃ A zɛtɛttɔ n pɛ shɔ lanɛ, n tɛ vigbete ɓang nɓɛɛ ɓa n yee sɔ̃n aɗɔgbete ɓang nkɔng ɓaarɛ ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />A ji pɔ̃sin saa u ɓa, a mbuntɛ saa ɓa a ruuviya? N sikɛ sɔɔnɛ n kpaa javiwɔɔ a yuuni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Kɛɗɔn Kpatiu geli shɔgbete i ɗɔ shinɛ a ɗɔuni nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ tɛ saa tarimɛunɛ au naani ɔ ã jawɛrɛ gbete u ɓɛɛ kopim.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Ama i geli i shɔwɛrɛu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔwɛrɛ, u saa tarimɛɛ wɔɔ ɗɔn kopi viyaǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Shɔwɛrɛu risinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;N gelɔɔtɛ, shɔgbete u vi aɗɔnyɛ, shɔ ãvi ba sɔ̃njo ikɔ;&gt;&gt; ama shɔgbete u viɓa, ko ja shɔgbete au naa yɛ shɔ yɛtɛkati au naani. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Dɔdɔrim n shɔnopɔ̃ gbete iji kasing ruubii ɓa, shɔgbete iji kasiɓa nɛn ɔ̃rii kpati ɓa yɛ, ɔ n ti nɛ yɛm ɔ nyɔi ang dekɨn.<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ to Urushalima a kakani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Naa Yesɔ sha vimtɛ a yɛkɛ Urushalima ai ɗekɨnkɔ a yai knti. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />A ɗagbete Yesɔ atɛ maani a Betafaji a Betani ni gbete a kɔpɔ zeetung, a shou jaɗɔyi ziti a ɗekɨn. <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />A nya ãsinɛ miyi nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔ yɛnɛ a jakomɔɔ gbete au dekɨn miyi; ɔkɛ tonɛ, ɔ yɛ zɛ jagãtola wɔ shɔ matɔ gbete shɔ ji gẽ ɓa au yuuni ɓa, ɔ kaliurɛ ɔ n-tiu arɛ yɛm. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Shɔwɔɔ kɛ hɨ ɔnɛ, ɔ kali pɛ ruu iviya? Ɔ geliu nɛ, Uɓeyelapa kasitɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />U jaɗɔyi i yɛrɛ i kpaa jo nɔgbete geliyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Naa i kɛ kali jagãtolaunɛ, shɔ gãtolauyi i geliyinɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ kali jagãtolau aru iviya? &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />I kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa kasitɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />I n ti Yesɔ jagãtolaurɛ. Kɛɗɔn i pɔ̃li i fãrã rɛ a yuu jagãtolauni Yesɔ gẽrɛ aɗɔn. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />U ɗɔɔ yɛnɛ shɔ ɗɔgbete shɔ ɓati fãrã a nyaba.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Naa Yesɔ atɛ maani a Urushalimani, a ɗɔgbete nyaba ɓakirɛ yɛnɛ dɔkɔpɔ zeetung, kɛɗɔn u jadɔyi waanɛ gbete i toli nyayɛ i ɗɔɔ Ɗalapa dɔ̃rinɛ i ɗɔgbete i ɓɛliu yɛ a yeenya pẽniba aru vi pẽniba gbete i zɛyɛ:<verse eid="LUK 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />I shanɛ&lt;&lt;Ɗa u tasi kpati gbete arɛ a Uɓeyelapa nii vɔɔ susãri bi niǃ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">Ɔ̃nɛ binyatɔ̃nɛ a kolapa, bassinɛ yɛnɛ Ɗalapa biǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Kɛɗɔn gãsi Farasiyayi atette mɔɔ i nwari Yesɔ nya i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔmala, gelaa jadɔyi nɛ i ɔ̃ shokǃ&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesɔ kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;N gelɔɔtɛ, i kɛ vɨnyanɛ, tarimiyi ayuu i yɛ gaa nya shatinɛtɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsɔ sɨnrii Urushalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Naa Yesɔ atɛ maani a komɔɔ Urushalimani, kɛɗɔn a sɨnrɛ aru Urushalimani. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔkɛ zɛ vi gbete n ti ɔ̃nɛ binyatɔ̃nɛ nɛn nɛ! Ama dɔdɔrim ɔ yɛ zɛɓaǃ <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Ɗaa kanɛ ɔ shɔnopɔ̃yi i yɛ maanya kãsiri a tɔ̃pɔ̃ i kɨntɔɔ a tete ko-pi kapiya i tasɨn a ɔkɔɔni. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />I yɛ lɛsɔɔ piti a awɔ shɔbiiyini kpai; i yɛ yaa tari gbete ɔ maa ɗɔɔ awuni ɓa ko gbete ayuu zɔɔni ɓa, vim yɛ ɔ̃ nankɔ aru gbete ɔji kasiɓa nɛ Ɗalapa arɛ aru U raa ɔtɔ ɓa. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ to jaa yuu ãnɛ gaa shɔ vi mɛlinɛi yikinirɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />A geliyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔ bee tɛttɔ a Ɗa nya ruubiini nɛ Ɗalapa shanɛ, &lt;N jaa yɛ ɔ̃ wɛrɛ gbete shɔ gakɨn aɗɔnyɛ.&gt; Ama ɔ risitɛ ɓɔɔyi i ɗɔɔ ɓunɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />A lee-lee Yesɔ mati shɔ vi a jaa yuu ãnɛ. yupɛ̃ni au pɛli vi yuu ãnɛ a jaa Ɗa yɛ, a shɔmala nya ãsinɛ Musa, a yupɛ̃ni dɔlayi i kã nyaba gbete nɛi nyɔ Yesɔ yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Ama i ji kpaa nyaba ɓa, aru gbete kopiya wesho jo a vigbete kɛ shanɛkɔ, iji kasi ɓa nɛ ruuwɔɔ u tɛyirɛ ɓa ko gbete ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ruu hɨnɛ ayuu Yesɔ kaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Si lewɔɔ aɗagbete Yesɔ usi jaa gbete shɔ pɛli vi yuu ãnɛ aɗɔn u ɗɔgbete mati shɔ vi, u ɗɔu nwari shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn, yupɛ̃ni jaa yuu ãnɛ a shɔmala nya ãsinɛ Musa a yupɛ̃ni dɔlayi i arɛ, <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />i hɨunɛ,&lt;&lt;Geliu nɛ, a kpaa kaka gbete a pɛli vim awuni yɛ piya? pi ã kakau piya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesɔ kasiyinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Nkɔ ma n hɨ ɔ ruuwɔɔ pɛjo, ɔ gelin nɛ, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Yɔhana shɔ batizima u kaka shɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbiya ko a shɔzɛ ɗɔbii ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Kɛɗɔn i gaa nya masinɛ ai nɔɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt;U yɛ shakɛnɛ iviya? u kɛ shanɛ nɛ, &lt;A Ɗalapa ɗɔbii,&gt; Yɛ hɨunɛ, &lt;Aru ivi ɔji ã sisɨn ɓa Yɔhana biini ɓa viya? &gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Ama u kɛ shanɛ nɛ a shɔzɛ ɗɔbii, mɔɔmiyi kpai i yɛ loriu a tari, aru gbete kopiya ã sisɨn tɛttɔ nɛ Yɔhana u pɛ Ɗa jashonɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Aruumkɔ Shɔwiyi kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔ ji zɛ ɗɔgbete u kaka shɛ aɗɔnyɛ ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geliyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Nkɔ ma n yɛn gelɔɔ kaka gbete n pɛli vim awuni yɛ ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruɓusinɛ ayuu shɔ jalanɛyi gbete i tɛ ɗɔ a saa i lakɨn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geli shɔ kɛ ruɓusinɛmː Shɔ wɔɔ siɗɔn gbete lajaa inabi yɛ, a turɛ a ã shɔjalanɛ ai tɛ saa i lakɨn a naa nɛi kɔsintɔ, kɛɗɔn a sã nyaba a yɛ zati ji sɔɔ wɛrɛ ɓa tɛ̃ɛ̃ti ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Naa ɗaa vi yeenɛ pɛlitɛ, a shou foo wɔɔ a shɔgbeteyi tɛ ɗɔ au naa yɛ ɗɔbii, nɛu tɛsin nɔlaa inabi ai naa. Ama shɔ ɗɔ tɛnɛwiyi i waa foou i dɔ̃u wɛrɛ naa waati iji ãu viwɔɔ ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Kɛɗɔn a shou foo wɔɔ sɔ̃n, ama shɔ ɗɔ tɛnɛwiyi i wau sɔ̃nrɛ, i tasiu raarɛ vi yusẽkɔ sheeli i dɔ̃u sɔ̃nji naa waati. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Kɛɗɔn Shou foo gbete au pɛsi taati sɔ̃nrɛ, shɔ ɗɔ tɛnɛwiyi i waurɛ a ntariu nɔrɔ̃ vɔrɔ bi i turɛ i lokiu ɓili.<verse eid="LUK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Kɛɗɔn shɔ jau shanɛ,&lt;&lt;N yɛn pɛli kɛ iviya? N yɛn shokɛ n jaa gbete n ɔriyɛ waanɛ; N zɛtɛttɔ i yɛ ntau nyatɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Ama naa shɔ ɗɔ tɛnɛwiyi i zɛ shɔ jaa inabiu ɓɛjaatɛ , i geli zɔɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shompɛ shɔ jam ɓɛjaa gbete yɛ shau vivɔ yɛ,&gt;&gt;U nyounɛ nɔgbete u vinaa yɛ ɔ̃ u ɓɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Kɛɗɔn i tuurɛ a yɛti jauni i nyou vɔrɔ i lokiurɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Shɔ jau yɛ pɛli shɔgbete i tɛ jaa a saa i lakɨn kɛpikoviya? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />&lt;&lt;Shɔ jau yɛ arɛ u nyo jawiyitɔ, a tuu jaurɛ a ãkɛ shɔwɔyi naa nɛi kɔsintɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Naa mɔɔ i nta vimtɛ i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Mɛnɛ ukɔ ɔ̃nɛ nanniǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Yesɔ kɨnnɔɔ ai bi a shanɛ, Ɗa nya ruubiim u dɔɔ kɛnɛ iviya?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">&lt;&lt;Tari gbete shɔvi maanɛ i bɛ̃ɛ̃ yɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">ukɔ ɔ̃tɛ tari gbete au tɛɛ gãsiyi a vishonɛni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Kopiya au kɛ nwesinɛ tariu yɛ yeliu kɛra- kɛra, ama tariu kɛ shi-shinɛ a shɔwɔɔ yuu yɛ nau ɗete-dete u rii naa zɨng.<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruu hɨnɛ ayuu sabɛnɛ shonɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Shɔmala nya ãsinɛ a yupɛ̃ni gbete pɛli vi yuu ãnɛ a jaa Ɗa i kã nyaba nɔgbete i yɛ sã Yesɔ a ɗaukɔ, aru i zɛtɛttɔ nɛ nwa rubusinɛm ji ai yuukɔ, ama i nta seti aru mɔɔyi.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kayisa sabɛnɛ shorinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Kɛɗɔn shɔwiyi kã nyaba gbete i yɛ sã Yesɔ yɛ, i woo shɔwɔyi a saa nɛi tasiyi yuu naa i pɛ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn, i shoyirɛ a Yesɔ ɗɔbii nɛi hɨliu ruu i ɗasiu kɛ tari, ai sisɨn nɛi ãukɛ shɔ kaka gbete yeeruu Gɔmna Roma a naa . <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Jashonɛyi gbete shɔ shoyi a Yesɔ ɗɔbii i hɨunɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔmala u zɛtɛttɔ vigbete a shayɛ àà vimatinɛni pɛ tɔ̃vɨn, u zɛtɛttɔ a yukɔnɛ ɓa shɔwɔɔyi ruubiini ɓa, ama a mati shɔvi tɔ̃vɨn aru Ɗalapa sisɨn gbete.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Geliu pɛ, aa zɛnɛ pɛ tɔ̃vɨn ya au nya ãsinɛ, u shori japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ saa bɛnɛtɔ ya ko ɓa tɔ̃vɨn ɓa?<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Ama Yesɔ zɛi sisɨn tɛttɔ nɛi kasin ɗasinɛ, a geliyinɛ, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />&lt;&lt;Ɔ tasi saa silivau pɛ. Pi jasuru a nii ni a sauni piya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">I kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Kayisa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔ ã Kayisa jo vigbete ɔ̃ u ɓɛɛ yɛ, ɔ ã Ɗalapa sɔ̃njo vigbete Ɗalapa ɓɛɛ yɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />I ji kpaa nyaba gbete i yɛ sã Yesɔ a shɔ ɗekɨn aru kɔ̃linɛni ɓa, kɛɗɔn i ɔ̃ a nyani shok i bi zaatɔ aru gbete Yesɔ geliyɛni.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruu hɨnɛ ayuu vɔrɔ yunɛ sàà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Kɛɗɔn gãsi Sadukiyawayi gbete i shanɛ vɔrɔ yɛ yuu ɓa sàà ni ɓa, i a Yesɔ ɗɔbii i hɨnɛ, <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />&lt;&lt;Shɔmala, Musa bee ruu labeenɛ nya ãsinɛ shanɛ, &lt;Shɔgbete kɛ vɔnɛ ji yee jaa ɓa a ɓesoni ɓa, ɓɛzɔ̃ yɛ zɛnɔɔtɔ u sɔri suvɔrɛ u yeeri ɓɛzɔ̃ jaarɛ a suuni.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Shɔwɔyi isi ai yeenɛ maazii. Jamari tɛ sorɛ a vɔrɛ ji kpaa jaa ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Kɛɗɔn shɔu pɛsiyɛ tɛ suurɛ, a vɔrɛ ji kpaa jaa ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Shɔgbete pɛsi shɔ zitiu pɛli sɔ̃njo nankɔ, i piti gbete gbete yɛnɛ maazii i ji kpaa jaa ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />A kɨntiuni piti kpai suu vɔrɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Dɔdɔrim gelinɛ, leegbete vɔrɔyi yulapa a sàà yɛ, suu yɛ ɔ̃kɛ pi so atette shɔ maazii miyi gbete i tɛutɛttɔ piti kpai miyi piya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesɔ kasiyinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Vɔshɔyi i tɛ so tɔ a kotipini, shɔ ãi soro tɔ aru shɔ tɛyirɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Ama vɔshɔyi a sɔrɔyini gbete i yɛtɛ a nɔgbete Ɗalapa yɛ yusiyilapa atette shɔgbete i vɔ tɛttɔyɛ, ruu so tɛnɛ ɓa, a vɔshɔ tɛnɛni ɓa ɗɔmɓa. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Aruumkɔ i yɛ ɔ̃ naa Ɗa jashonɛyi lapa i yɛ vɔ tɔɓa. I kɛ Ɗa jaayi, aruviya i yulapatɛ a sààni. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Ko Musa ma tasi tɛttɔ wasa-wasa nɛ, shɔgbete i vɔtɛ i yɛ yulapatɔ a suru ni. Au laabeenɛ ayuu yaa shaanɛ jalaa, Musa nwanyatɔ a Ubeyelapa yuuni nɛu pɛ &lt;Ibirayi Ɗalapa, Ishayaku Ɗalapa a Yakubu Ɗalapa.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />U pɛ Ɗalapa gbete u suru aɗɔnyɛ, ama ɓa shɔgbete i vɔ tɛttɔ i ɓɛɛ ɓa, a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii i piti kpai i suru aɗɔn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Gãsi shɔmala nya ãsinɛ gbete i si ɗɔnyɛ i risi Yesɔ nyanɛ, &lt;&lt;A shatɛ tɔ̃vɨn tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ shɔmalaǃ&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Yunɛ ɗɔukɔ shɔwɔ ji hɨ Yesɔ ruuwɔ tokɨn ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruu hɨnɛ a kirisi yuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ hɨyinɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ sha pi aru iviya nɛ kirisi u pɛ Dauda ɓɛuruu viya? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Dauda au yuu shatɛttɔ labeene Zabura nɛː</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">&lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa gelin n Uɓeyelapa nɛː</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">Ɔ̃nɛ yɛm ang nakɨnmi<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />setɛ n pɔ̃ a shɔnɔpɔ̃yitɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:43">i ɔ̃ la ɔ̃nɛ gbete a pɔ̃ dɔɔ aɗɔn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Dauda kɛ ɓaa kirisi nɛ, Uɓeyelapa, &lt;&lt;Kirisi yɛ ɔ̃ u ɓɛjaa kɛpikoviya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ gɔ̃ shɔ yushoo aru shɔmala nya ãsinɛ Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Si mɔɔyi piti kpai i ɗɔɔ showenɛ a Yesɔ nya, Yesɔ geliu jaɗɔyinɛ, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />&lt;&lt;Ɔ kɔyuutɔ aru shɔmala nya ãsinɛyini, shɔgbete kasi rakinɛ a kpenti fãrã wɔsɔ̃n i ɔrinɛ shɔu kuuti a tipi shɔ geeyi nya a lumɔɔ, i kasinɛ shɔ yasiyi ɗɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ pẽniba aɗɔgbete Yahudawayi i toli nya ɗɔnyɛ aru ruu nwanɛ, wɔsɔ̃n shɔu yasiyi ɗɔ tɔ̃vɨn a ɗɔɔ yumusinɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Ikɔyi ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete ai shaa suvɔyi vi, i gaki Ɗa dɔkɔkɔ nɛ shɔ zɛyitɔ, i raaɓoonɛ yɛ tɛ shɔwɔɔ ɓɛɛtɔ piti kpai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Suvɔ vinaa ãnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yesɔ kɨnnɔɔ a zɛ nɔgbete shɔ vinaayi i ã vinaa a jaa gbete shɔ pɛli vi yuu ãnɛ aɗɔnyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Kɛɗɔn Yɛsɔ zɛ Suvɔ raawɔ arɛ u lokiu vinaa jaa saa gbete shɔ ɓaanɛ tagulla ziti gbete u a wuniyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Yesɔ geliu jadɔyi nɛ,&lt;&lt;N gelɔɔtɛ nizɛ, vigbete suvɔ raam ãyɛ tɛɛ shɔ wɔyi ɓɛɛtɛ piti kpai. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Aru shɔ wɔyi i lɔki ai tete vinaa gbete i a wuniyɛ, ama suvɔm loki ɓɛɛ jo vigbete siyɛ shaayɛ gbeteu ɔ a wuniyɛ piti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ nwanya ayuu jaa vi yuu ãnɛ zɨlinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Yesɔ gãsi jadɔyi i nwanɛ aru tari kɔ̃rinɛ gbete shɔ maa jàà Ɗa a wuniyɛ a nɔgbete jàu ɔ̃ yɛ, a vigbete shɔ ã Ɗalapa yɛni. Ama Yesɔ shanɛ, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />&lt;&lt;Yesɔ shanɛ, Vim piti kpai ɔ zɛ ɓankɔ ɗaa yɛ atɔ tariwɔ gbete yɛ. Ɔ̃ ɓa a ɓɛzɔ̃wɔ yuu ni ɓa, ko tari shopiya shɔyɛ lɔki a tipi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yukɔnɛyi a raaɓoonɛyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Yesɔ jadɔyi i hɨunɛ, &lt;&lt;shɔmala, vim yɛ a pi ɗaviya? Ivi yɛ tasiunɛ u ɗaa anɛ pɛlitɛ viya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesɔ risiyi nyanɛː &lt;&lt;Ɔ kɔyutɔ shɔ kɔ ɗakɔɔnɛ, aru shɔzɛ waanɛ yɛ aa ang nii, i yee nya nɛ,&lt;ikɔyi kirisi,&gt; i shanɛ, &lt;ɗau atɛ maaniǃ &gt;Ama ɔkɔɔ ã sisɨn nɛ ai nyani. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Naa ɔkɛ nta ruu sɨnɛ a yuu yɔrinɛni; Seti kɔ pɛlɔɔnɛ, vim piti kpai i yɛ pɛlitɔ, ama ji tasi ɓa nɛ koo nya yisinɛ atɛ maani ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geliyi sɔ̃n nɛ, tipi wɔɔyi i yɛ waaba a tipi wɔɔyini, lakpati shɔm i yɛ waaba a lakpati shɔwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />A ɗauni tipi yɛ ɓetɔ tɔ̃vɨn zããk pẽniba a nwobm a koo, wɔsɔ̃n vi sisɨn kɔnɛ yɛ ɔ̃ ko ɗɔpiya a kooni a vibii zaanɛ pẽniba gbete i yɛ shɛ a kolapa. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Ama vim ɓɛɛ ganɛ piti, shɔyɛ mawɔrɛ a tasɔɔ raa waanɛ, shɔyɛ n ti ɔ rɛ a shɔpẽni ɗekɨn aɗɔgbete Yahudawayi i toli nya i yeeruu aɗɔnyɛ wɔsɔ̃n gɔmna a kpati, i yɛ pɔ̃ɔ jaahm ang yuu. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Shomkɔ yɛ ɔ̃rɔɔ nyaba gbete ɔ yɛ nwari Ɗalapanya ruu bi tɔ̃vɨn yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Aru nankɔ ɔkɔɔ yɔri yuu nɛ aru nya risinɛ gbete ɔ yɛ risiyi yɛ naa ikɛ hɨ ɔ ruunɛ yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Aru gbete nkɔ yɛ ãwɔ kaka nya risinɛrɛ, gbete ɔ risiyɛ a sẽrẽni nɔgbete ɔ shɔnɔpɔ̃yi i yɛ zɛnɔɔ nya risinɛ a masinɛni ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Shɔyɛ ãwɔ a meyeyi naa, mɛzɔ̃yi, ko ɔ shɔ biyi, ko mɛsaayi, ɔ shɔ gãsi shɔyɛ wiriitɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Kopiya yɛ bɛ̃ɛ̃ ɔ ruubii ang yuu. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Ama ɔ shɛ̃nti yuu gbete yɛ nii ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Ɔ shi dɔɔ kaziti ɔ yɛ rawɔ yuutɔ.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ nwanya aru Urushalima lɛsinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Naa ɔkɛ zɛnɛ soja i knti tipi Urushalima tɛ atette, ɔ zɛ jo ukɔ yɛ wari yuu ɓa, nɛ shɔyɛ lɛsi Urushalimatɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Kɛɗɔn shɔgbete i a tipi Yahudiyayi, i yurɛ i gee kɔpɔ, shɔgbete ai komɔɔ pẽniba i yukati, shɔgbete i a tipi ɓili yɛ ikɔ sɔɔnɛ a komɔɔ pẽniba ni. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Aru nankɔ leewu yɛ ɔ̃ &lt;&lt;Lee yukɔnɛ gbete Ɗa nya ruu shanɛ u ɔ̃ nizɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Leeu yɛ ɔ̃ri suu jaa yɛti a suu jaa naayi vi yukɔnɛǃ Vi yukɔnɛ pẽniba yɛ to komtɔ, Ɗalapa sisɨn lɛsinɛ yɛ no ai yuu. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Shɔ gãsiyi shɔyɛ nyoyi a zali, shɔwɔyi shɔyɛ sãi rɛ shɔ risi foo ɓaa waanɛ a tipiwu piti kpai; Shɔgbete i ɓa Yaduwaya ɓa i yɛ ɔ̃ kpati a tipi Urushalima i tasi shɔ tipiwi raa waanɛ.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jashɔzɛ anɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />&lt;&lt;A leeuni shɔ yɛ zɛ vigbete shɔ ji zɛɓa leegbete ɓayɛtɔ gbete yɛ pɛli ɗaayɛ, shɛllɛ, see, tipi piti kpai a koo yɛ zɨtitɔ, shɔzɛ a koo piti kpai i yuu yɛ ritɔ aru wapo ãlinɛni a sɔrɔyi yenya dusunɛ gbete mii pẽniba n-tiyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />shɔ yɛti yɛ yi a setini a ɗagbete shɔ ga vigbete yɛ a a koo piti kpai, aru vigbete u kaka aɗɔn a lapa yɛ zɨntitɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Kɛɗɔn Shɔzɛja yɛ shɛkɛrɛ a ku-nyasi a kakani a basinɛni kanɛ a sabu. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Naa vim i gaa pɛlinɛtɛ, ɔ shi a kakani ɔ ɔ̃ nɔkãkãri si Ɗa shɔraanɛ atɛ maani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vimatinɛ a laa sɨnti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geliu jadɔyi rubusinɛm nɛː &lt;&lt; Ɔ lɛri pɛ a laa sɨnti yuu a gãsi laa yini piti kpai.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Naa kɛ shɛshi gapa nɛ ɔ zɛ jo ɗɔnkɔ nɛ goosi atɛ maani. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Aru nankɔ naa ɔ kɛ zɛ vimnɛ a ɗɔɔ pɛlinɛ, ɔ kpaa sisɨn jo a ukɔ nɛ Ɗa kpati roonɛ atɛ maani.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Ɔ kpaa sisɨntɔ vim piti kpai i yɛ pɛlitɔ, si shɔ jakɨntimiyi i ji vɔ ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Kolapa a kotipi i yɛ sɔ̃ nyatɔ, ama n nya ruubii yɛ sɔ̃ nya ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃ nɛ nɔkãkãri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />&lt;&lt;Ɔ kɔyuutɔ, ɔkɔɔ yawɔ sisɨn nɛ ruu vi shaanɛ a viɓoonɛ a saa gbete u kaka ɗɔnyɛ kɔ sheeli, a viu yɛ a suru a vikoo tipim kasinɛ u rawɔ rɛ ɓa, leeu yɛ awɔ kali u zɛ̃wɔ tɔ̃ naa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Leeu yɛ ɔ̃ naa tari ɗanɛ, yɛ aa shɔ yuu a koo tipi piti kpai. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Ɔ ɔ̃ nɔkãkãri ko ɗaviya, ɔ gaki Ɗa tɔ nɔgbete ɔyɛ ɔ̃ kakani aru gbete ɔyɛ zɛnɔɔ shinɛtɔ a Ubeyelapa Yesɔ jashɔzɛ dekɨn ni.<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Yesɔ mati shɔ vi ko lee shopiya a jaa Ɗa, naa ɗaddarɛ pɛlitɛ, Yesɔ shɛ a zɨnba lee-lee yɛnɛ kɔpɔ zeetung aɗɔ Ɗa gakinɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />A gadii zɨnkɔ mɔɔwi i shɛrɛ i yɛ jaa Ɗa aɗɔ showenɛ a Yesɔ nya aɗagbete nwariyi shɔ Ɗalapa nya ruubii yɛ.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Shɔ manya nɛ shɔ nyɔ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Naa ɗaa vishaanɛ gbete shɔ shaa a pasika gbete shɔ ɓaanɛ yisiti ate māāni. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Kɛɗɔn shɔ yupɛ̃niyi au pɛli vi yuu ãnɛ jaa Ɗa a shɔmala nya ãsinɛ Musa, i nta shɔ setitɔ, i kã nyaba gbete i yɛ sã Yesɔ nɛ shɔu nyou vɔrɔ kaali.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yahuza kasi nyanɛn mɛli Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Kɛɗɔn japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ tosi Yahuza sisɨn gbete shɔ ɓaunɛ Isikariyoti, u ji tete shɔzɛ gbete a Yesɔ jadɔyi kɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Yahuza yurɛ a yɛrɛ nwanya a yupɛ̃niyi gbete pɛli vi yuu ãnɛ a jaa Ɗa a yupɛ̃niyi jaa Ɗa tɛttinɛyi nɔgbete yɛ mɛliyi Yesɔ i nyou vɔrɔ yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />I nta yɛti puru tɔ waanɛ i marɛ nɛi yɛ ãu saa. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yahuza kasirɛ, kɛɗɔn gaa kɛ nyaba kãnɛ gbete yɛ ãi Yesɔ yɛ, ɓa mɔɔyi zɛnɛniɓa.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ tɔ̃ri vi aru dii vishaanɛ pasika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Naa dii yumusinɛ borodi gbete yisiti ɓa ɗɔn ɓayɛ pɛlitɛ, kɛ lee gbete shɔyɛ yee jamɛrɛ̃ɛ̃ pasika yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yesɔ sho Bituru a Yɔhana, a nya ãsinɛmiː &lt;&lt;Ɔ yɛnɛ ɔ nwariu vishaanɛ pasika n ɗau shaatɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />I hɨ Yesɔ nɛ&lt;&lt;A kasinɛ u nwaraa vishaanɛu pi ɗɔpiya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Yesɔ kasiyinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Naa ɔkɛ to yɛti komɔɔ nɛ, ɔ kpɛsi jawɔɔ tuu jakpari mii tɛ, ɔ gɨu akɨnti yɛnɛ wɛrɛ gbete yɛ to ɗɔnyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Ɔ geli shɔwɛrɛu nɛ: &lt;Shɔmala shɔunɛ u hɨ a pɛ, jaa gbete n yɛn shaa vishaanɛ ang jadɔyini a ɗɔnyɛ piya?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Yɛ tasɔɔ jaa pẽniba gbete shɔ maa a yuu ɓɛɛ zɔwɔyɛ. Ɔ yɛ kpaarɛ ko iviya shɔ tɔ̃ritɛ aɗɔn piti kpai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Yesɔ jadɔyi ziti i to yɛti komɔɔurɛ i kpaa ko iviya jo nɔgbete Yesɔ geliyɛ kɔ, kɛɗɔn i tɔ̃ri vishaanɛ pasikarɛ.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uɓeyelapa vishaanɛ ɗarɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Naa ɗaa vishaanɛ pɛlitɛ, Yesɔ au jashonɛyini i ɔ̃ a ɗɔzɔ aru i shaa vishaanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Yesɔ geliyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;N kasi tɛttɔ, n shaa vishaanɛ pasikami a ɔkɔni n ɗan ɓoo raayɛ! <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />N gelɔɔtɛ, n yɛn shaa vishaanɛ pasika toɓa, setɛ u ɗaa pɛlitɛ aɗɔgbete Ɗa roo kpati aɗɔn a lapa atɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ tuu kɔpii, dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa a shanɛ, &lt;&lt; Ɔ tɛɛnɛ ɔ vɔsirɛ awɔ nɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />N gelɔɔtɛ yuunɛ dɔdɔrim yɛnɛ ɗekɨn n yɛn ɓoo mii inabim toɓa, se leegbete Ɗa kpati roonɛ atɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ tuu borodi a dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa dalirɛ a ãyirɛ a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shompɛ n bi gbete n ãwɔyɛ, ɔ pɛli jo ɗɔkɔ nɔgbete ɔ kpaa sisɨn ang biiyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Sɔ̃njo nankɔ, ãi kɔpii rɛ a knti vishaanɛ ɗarɛ, a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shompɛ kɔpii gbete Ɗalapa maruu sɔɔ ang kpaa, gbete n yɛn ntee awɔ yuu. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Ama, ɔ kɨnnɔɔ pɛ! Shɔgbete au mɛlin yɛ u yɛm a ɗɔɔ vishaanɛ a nkɔni! <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Nkɔ Shɔzɛja n yɛ vɔ nɔgbete Ɗalapa kasiyɛ, ama shɔgbete au mɛliu yɛ u yukɔnɛ ɗɔn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ jadɔyi i gai yuu hɨnɛ, pi yɛ pɛli vi kɔ̃linɛm pi au tete ni piya?<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nya masinɛ aru pi ɔ̃rɛ pẽniba piya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ jadɔyi nya masinɛ yuu ai tete aru nɛ pi yɛ ɔ̃ pẽniba ai tetteni piya. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesɔ geliyi nɛ, Kpati shɔ tipim gbeteyi i ji zɛ Ɗalapa ɓa i kaka ai shɔbiiyi yuuni. yupɛ̃ni koomi i ɓai yuunɛ i pɛ &lt;&lt;Shɔ wesaayi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Ama yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa nankɔ awɔ tete niɓa; shɔ gbete yɛ ɔ̃ yupɛ̃ni awɔ tete ɔriutɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ u ɔ̃ naa jajja fɛ̃ɛ̃, yupɛ̃ni u ɔ̃ naa foo. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Pi ɔ̃rɛ pẽniba piya, shɔgbee au ɔ̃ tipi shaa vi shaanɛ ya ko shɔgbete ãli shɔ vishaanɛ ya? Pɛ Shɔgbete au ɔ̃ a tipi u ɗɔɔ vishaanɛ shaanɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ pẽniba. Ama nkɔng yɛm awɔ tete naa shɔgbete ãli shɔ vishaanɛ yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />&lt;&lt;Ɔ ɔ̃ tɛttɔ a nkɔni aɗagbete shɔ ntalin nyayɛni piti kpai;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Nagbete mayɛ ang kaka nɛn roo kpati a wuniyɛ, nkɔ ma n ãwɔ kaka sɔ̃njo nankɔ, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />ɔ yɛ shaarɛ ɔ ɓoorɛ a nkɔni ang ɗɔɔ kpati roonɛ, ɔkɔ yɛ ɔ̃rɛ a yulaa kpati shɔ Isirela laduru kopi atu ziti ɔ sãyirɛ.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ nwanya Bituru masiu nya ɗɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Bituru, Bituru Japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ kã nyaba tɛ aru u ntawɔ sisɨn piti kpai, u vɔsi tɔ̃vɨn a kɔ̃linɛ, naa shɔjalanɛ shɛshi sɛ̃ɛ̃ a tete visha. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Ama Siman n gakaa Ɗa tɛ, a sisɨn ãnɛ yɛ nwesiɓa. Ama naa akɛ sɔɔnɛ ang bi, a ã mɛzɔ̃yi kaka tɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Bituru kasinya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa, n yɛn gɨn atɔ yɛnɛ jaahm n vɔ a mɔkɔni!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesɔ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Bituru n gelaatɛ, Kpaasi kɔ̃ɔ̃ ɓɛɛ nyaɓaanɛ a zɨmbam setɛ a shatɛ ɓa taati nɛn ji zɛn nii ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baala, lazɔrɔ a zaali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ hɨu jadɔyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;A ɗagbete n showɔɔ siyɛ a ɗauni saa ɓa, jaduu ɓa, ko kodɔɔ ɓa, viwɔɔ leerɔɔ si tɛya?&gt;&gt;I kasinya nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ko vigbete ji leeriu ɓa,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Yesɔ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ama dɔdɔrim, shɔu saa ɗɔn a duuni u tuu naani; shɔu zaali sitɛɓa u mɛliu fãrã u wɔɔ zaali awuni. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Nagbete n gelɔɔ yɛ Ɗa nya ruubi gbete shanɛ, &lt;Shɔ ɓasiutɛ a shɔ ruuvini,&gt; ɔ̃tɛ̃ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ Ɗa nya ruubii u ɔ̃ nizɛ ang yuu, vigbete shɔ bee ang yuu u ɗɔgbete ɔ̃ nizɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Yesɔ jadɔyi i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Kn noopɛ! Uɓeyelapa nkɔ zaali yɛm ziti!&gt;&gt; Yesɔ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;tesitɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ gaki Ɗa a kɔpɔ zeetung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesɔ yaa ɗɔurɛ a gɛ̃kɛ kɔpɔ zeetung nagbete pɛli a lee-lee, u jadɔyi i gɨu dɔɔni. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Naa Yesɔ to ɗɔutɛ kɛɗɔn geliyi nɛ, ɔ gaki Ɗa tɔ, nɔgbete ɔ yɛ wẽsi ɓa japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ naani ɓayɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />kɛɗɔn Yesɔ yurɛ a yɛ ɗekɨn, yɛ ɔ̃ naa shɔ lo tari ni zali, kɛɗɔn a sɔ̃sirɛ a gaki Ɗa rɛ, a shanɛ <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />&lt;&lt;Maye, Kɛ ɔ̃nɛ a pɛlinɛ tusun jawaa raaɓoonɛm kati, ɓa n pɛlinɛ ɓa ama u ɔ̃ vigbete a kasiyɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗa jashonɛ lapa shɛrɛ au ɗɔbii a masiu bi rɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Yesɔ u atette raaɓoonɛ waanɛ, kɛɗɔn mabii u ɗɔɔ Ɗa gakinɛ, u dɔnwanɛ sɔ̃li naa kpaa nteli a tipi.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Naa Yesɔ yutɛ a ɗɔɔ Ɗa gakinɛ ni, sɔu jadɔyi ɗɔbii a kpai ɗɔɔ noroo-roonɛ aru si yɔtɔ i sisɨn vɨngtɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Yesɔ hɨu jadɔyi nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔ roo- noroo pi ruuviya? Ɔ yulapa nɛ ɔ gaki Ɗa nɔgbete ɔ yɛ toɓa japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ naa ni ɓayɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ sãnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Si Yesɔ ji yisi nyanwanɛ ɓa, kɛɗɔn mɔɔ waanɛ i arɛ a Yahuza Isikariyoti ni shɔzɛ gbete au tete jadɔ kopi atu ziti, arɛ a Yesɔ ɗɔbii nɛn kasi nya maanɛ nɔgbete geli shɔwi yɛ, <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />ama Yesɔ hɨ Yahuza nɛ, &lt;&lt;A mɛli Shɔzɛja a nya maanɛ ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Naa Yesɔ jadɔ gãsiyi i zɛ vigbete yɛ pɛliyɛtɛ nam, i hɨ Yesɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa u shovinɛ au zaali mini ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Shɔzɛ gbete atette Yesɔ jadɔyi shɛshiu zaali a kɔ yupɛ̃ni gbete pɛli vi yuu ãnɛ jaa Ɗa jawɛrɛ yushoo nakɨn.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Ama Yesɔ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Tesitɛǃ &gt;&gt; kɛɗɔn Yesɔ ɗi naa a jau shoo, a gatiurɛ.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Yesɔ geli shɔ yupɛ̃ni gbete pɛli vi yuu ãnɛ a jaa Ɗa a yupɛ̃niyi gbete i tɛtti jaa Ɗa yuu ãnɛyɛ a yupɛ̃ni dɔlaa gbete i au ɗɔbii nɛ sãutɔ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ ang ɗɔbii a laabaa a zaali ni aru ɔ sãngtɔ naa shɔ nyaba zɛnɛ ya? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />N ji a ɔkɔni lee-lee a Ɗa jaa yuu ãnɛ ɔ ji sãn ɓa. ama dɔdɔrim pɛ ɔ ɗaa vishonɛ arɛ, aru japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ u tasiu kaka vishonɛ pɛlinɛ shɔ ɗɔkɨnriyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bituru masi Yesɔ nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />I sã Yesɔ rɛ a n-tiu a yupɛ̃ni gbete pɛli vi yuu ãnɛ jaa Ɗa wɛrɛ, Bituru gɨu akɨnti si yɛtɛ kpɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Naa i wu yaa tɛ atette wɛrɛu i ɔ̃lirɛ aɗɔn, Bituru ma yɛrɛ ɔ̃jo atette shɔwini. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Shɔzɛ gbete a tete jasoro gbete shovi shonɛ a wɛrɛu zɛ Bituru ɔ̃tɛ a nyayau, kɨnnɔɔ au bi a hɨu nɛ, &lt;&lt; Jam kɔma u si jo Yesɔ ni ɗɔzɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Ama Bituru masi nya aɗɔn, a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Suum n ji zɛu jo ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />A kɨntiuni tɛ̃ɛ̃ti shɔwɔ arɛ hɨ Bituru sɔ̃n nɛ, &lt;&lt;Aji tete shɔzɛ gbete Yesɔ jadɔyi kɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Bituru risiu nya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Jam, mɓa tetteni ɓaǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Naa ɔ̃tɛ dɔɔɗa gbete jawɔɔ a sɔ̃n Bituru ɗɔbii a hɨu nɛ, &lt;&lt; Nya masinɛ ɓa, jam u si a Yesɔ ni ɗɔzɔ, aru ukɔma u shɔ Galili. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Ama Bituru risi jau nyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Jam, n ji zɛ ruugbete a nwanya au yuuni ɓaǃ&gt;&gt; si Bituru ji yisi nyanwanɛ ɓa kpaasi kɔ̃ɔ̃ ɓaa nyarɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Uɓeyelapa rinoo rɛ a zɛ Bituru tiriri, kɛɗɔn Bituru kpaa sisɨn rɛ aru gbete Uɓeyelapa geliu yɛ nɛ,&lt;&lt;zɨbankɔ kɔ̃ɔ̃ ɓɛɛ nya ɓaanɛ a yɛ masi shɔ nya ang yuu ɓa taati nɛn ji zɛn nii ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Bituru shɛ bili a sãki nyavɔ waanɛ.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ wa Yesɔ shɔ latiutɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Shɔ gbete i tɛttɛ Yesɔ yɛ i waurɛ i latiutɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Kɛɗɔn i ma Yesɔ noo a waurɛ i hɨu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Geliu nɛ akɛ ɔ̃nɛ Ɗa jashonɛ pi wa piya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />I shali vi kɔ̃linɛ wɔyi ayuu i dãli waanɛ.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ n ti Yesɔ a kpati shɔ ruu yeenɛyi ɗekɨn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />A gadii zɨɨnkɔ yupɛ̃ni dɔlaayi a yupɛ̃ni gbete i pɛli vi yuu ãnɛ a jaa Ɗa wɔsɔ̃n shɔmala nya ãsinɛ i toli nya a ɗɔzɔ, i n ti Yesɔ a kpati shɔ ruu yeenɛi ɗekɨn, <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />i hɨ Yesɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Geliu nɛ mokɔ a kirisi ya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Yesɔ risiyi nya nɛ, &lt;&lt; Nkɛ gelɔɔ nɛ, ɔ yɛ ã sisɨn ɓa ang ruuni ɓa, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />nkɛ hɨu ɔ ruu wɔnɛ, ɔ yɛ kasinnya ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Ama yunɛ dɔdɔrim yɛnɛ ɗekɨn Shɔzɛja yɛ ɔ̃ a kakani a shɔ gbete vi tɛu kaka ɓa Ɗalapa nakɨn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Shɔwiyi a ɗɔu piti kpai i hɨ Yesɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Mokɔ Ɗa jaa ya?&gt;&gt; Yesɔ risiyi nya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ shatɛttɔ pɛ nkɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Kɛɗɔn shɔwiyi shanɛ, &lt;&lt;U kãli kɛ ruu ivi totti viya? U au yuu u nta vigbete shatɛttɔ au nya gbɔ̃ti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ a Bilatu ɗekɨn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Kɛɗɔn mɔɔyi kpai i tuu Yesɔ i n-tiu Bilatu ɗekɨn rɛ, <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />a i gaa Yesɔ i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;U kpai jam u ɗɔgbete nisi u shɔbii yɛ, geli shɔ nɛ shɔkɔ shorii kayisar sabɛnɛ nɛ, tasiu yuu nɛn pɛ kirisi, kpati.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Bilatu hɨ Yesɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Mokaa kpati Yahudawa ya? &gt;&gt; Yesɔ risi Bilatu nyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ji nɔgbete a shabangkɔ. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Kɛɗɔn Bilatu geli yupɛ̃ni gbete pɛli vi yuu ãnɛ a jaa Ɗa a mɔɔyini nɛ, &lt;&lt;N ji kpaa jam ɓa vigbete tasinɛ pɛli ruuvinɛtɛ ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Ama mɔɔyi i yɛ ɗekɨn i ɗɔgbeteyi bɔ̃ɔ̃ Bilatu waanɛ, &lt;&lt;Au vi matinɛ shɔzɛ waanɛ a tipi Yahudiya kpai i ɔ̃nɛ binyatɔ̃nɛ ɓa, gaa vim a Galili dɔdɔrim anɛ ɗɔm. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ a Hiridu ɗekɨn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Naa Bilatu nta vigbete mɔɔyi shatɛ a hɨyinɛ, &lt;&lt;Jam upɛ shɔ galili ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Aɗagbete Bilatu ntatɛ nɛ Yesɔ upɛ Hirudu tipi, kɛɗɔn a ãi naarɛ yɛnɛ Hirudu ɗɔbii, a ɗauni si Hiridu u sijo Urushalimakɔ.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Naa Hirudu zɛ Yesɔ tɛ nta yɛti purutɔ waanɛ, kã Yesɔ zɛnɛ si tɛttɔ tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃, u sisɨn ɓɛɛ jo nɛn kasi Yesɔ zɛnɛ u ɗɔ vibii zaanɛ pɛlinɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Kɛɗɔn Hiridu hɨli Yesɔ ruu waanɛ ama Yesɔ ji risiu nyawɔ ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Yupɛ̃ni gbete i pɛli vi yuu ãnɛ a jaa Ɗa a shɔmala nya ãsinɛ Musa gbete i shili a ɗɔuniyɛ i a Hirudu ɗekɨn a sha vi kɔ̃linɛ a Yesɔ yuu. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Hiridu au sojayini i ã Yesɔ yusẽ a ãriu nya, kɛɗɔn i tosiu fãrã tɔ̃vɨn abi i sɔriurɛ a Bilatu ɗekɨn. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />A leeukɔ Bilatu a Hirudu i ɔ̃ ɓɛusa a zɔni, aru gbete siyi pɛ shɔnɔpɔ̃ a zɔni.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ yeeruu a Yesɔ yuu nɛ vɔtɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Bilatu ɓaa yupɛ̃niyi gbete i pɛli vi yuu ãnɛ a jaa Ɗa nya, a kpatiyini a shɔzɛ piti kpai nya au ɗɔbii, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />a geliyinɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ n ti jam ang ɗɔbii nɛ nisiu shɔbiiyi nɛi kɔi ntau nyanɛ, ama n hɨliu ruutɛ awɔ ɗekɨn, n ji kpau ɓa aru kɔ̃linɛ wɔni ɓa gbete ɔ ɓaanɛ pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Hiridu ma ji kpau ɓa aru kɔ̃linɛ wɔni ɓa sɔriutɛ au ɗɔbii, jam ji pɛli viwɔɔ ɓa gbete au yɛtɛ nɔgbete shɔ nyou vɔrɔ yɛɓa. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Aruumkɔ n yɛn pɔ̃rɛ shɔ waurɛ, n yau naarɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" /><verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Ama mɔɔyi i ɓaa nya a kakani nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ nyɔnɛǃ Ɔ yasiu Barnaba naa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />(Si shɔ ma Barnaba tɛ a jahm aru ba gbete n ti a komɔɔyɛ, a shɔ nyɔnɛ.)<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Bilatu kasi Yesɔ naa yaanɛ, kɛɗɔn a gaki mɔɔwiyi sɔ̃nrɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Ama i shati nya nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ bau naa a laa, Ɔ bau naa a laaǃ &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Bilatu geli mɔɔwiyi sɔ̃n au na taati nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ama pɛli pi ruuvini shopiya?&gt;&gt; N ji kpau ɓa a vigbete yɛtɛ nɔgbete shɔ nyou vɔrɔ yɛɓa. N yɛn pɔ̃rɛ shɔ waurɛ, shɔ yau naa u yarɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Ama moowi yɛ ɗekɨn a nya shatinɛ tɛɛ kaka, nɛ shɔu ɓaa Yesɔ naa laa, a kɨntini piti kpai i nya shatinɛu shaarirɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Kɛɗɔn Bilatu yee ruurɛ a Yesɔ yuu nɛ shɔu pɛli vigbete i kasiyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Bilatu yasiyi shɔgbete ai kasiyɛ naarɛ, shɔgbete a shɔ mau jahm aru ba waanɛ a shɔ nyɔnɛ, kɛɗɔn a ãi Yesɔ kɛkn naa nɛi pɛliu vigbete i kasiyɛ.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ ɓaa Yesɔ naa a laa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Aɗagbete sɔjayi i ɗɔɔ yɛnɛ a Yesɔ ni, i kpɛsi jawɔɔ a nyaba u niinɛ Siman gbete a Bakurani u ɗɔɔ komɔɔ tonɛ shɛ jakomɔɔ, i pɔ̃urɛ nɛu tusi Yesɔ laa gbete shɔ ɓau naa aɗɔnyɛ, pɔ̃siu laarɛ turɛ a gɨn Yesɔ akɨnti. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Mɔɔ waanɛ i gɨn Yesɔ akɨntini, ai tetteni suuwɔyi siɗɔn, i ɗɔɔ sɨnɛ a lɛrinɛni a Yesu yuu. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesɔ rinɔɔ ai bi a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Suu Urushalimayi ɔkɔɔ sɨn nyavɔnɛ ang yuu; Ama ɔ sɨn jo awɔ yuu a mɛjaayi. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Dii kanɛ gbete shɔyɛ shanɛ, &lt;Ɗa u tasi Suu gbeteyi i ji yee jaayi ɓa shãni ɓa, a suu gbete i yee jaa ɓa, wɔsɔ̃n shɔgbete i ji ã jaa mii ɓa shãni ɓa vɔɔ susãri biini!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />A ɗaukɔ shɔ yɛ geli kɔpɔ kɛnɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">&lt;&lt;Zɨnɛ au biǃ&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 23:30">I geli jakɔpɔ nɛ &lt;&lt;Kukiunɛǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Vim ɗɔm kɛ pɛlinɛ nankɔ a laa zazani, yɛ ɔ̃ kɛpikoviya a laa watinɛni viya?<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Shɔwɔyi si ziti, i piti kpai i shɔ ruuviniyi, shɔ n-tirɛ nɛ aru shɔ nyɔi vɔrɔ a nyazɔ a Yesɔ ni. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Naa atɛ aɗɔgbete shɔ ɓaanɛ, &lt;&lt; Yuu zɔ̃pu&gt;&gt; i ɓaa Yesɔ naa a laa a ɗoukɔ, a shɔ ruuvini zitiwini, gbete au nakɨn gbete au nagãng. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yesɔ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Maye, yasiyi ruuvinitɔ i ji zɛ vigbete i pɛliyɛ ɓa.&gt;&gt; Sojayi vɔsi Yesɔ fãrã bi ai nɔɔ, a nyaba laapa ntanɛ.<verse eid="LUK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Shɔgbete i shi a ɗɔu i shirɛ i ɗɔɔ zɛnɛ, yupɛ̃ni Yahudawayi i ãri Yesɔ nyanɛ, &lt;&lt;Raa shɔwɔyitɛ, u rau yuunɛ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ kirisi gbete Ɗalapa lɔuyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Sojayi i ãriu nyarɛ i a māāni au ɗɔbii, i tu mii gbari a ãurɛ shɔ jaa inabi, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;A kɛ ɔ̃nɛ kpati yahudawa raa a yuunɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />A yuu laa gbete i ɓau naa ɗɔnyɛ shɔ bee viwɔ au yuu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shompɛ kpati Yahudawa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Shɔzɛ gbete atette bɔɔyi gbete shɔ ɓai naa ayiniyɛ ãri Yesɔ nyanɛ, ɓa mokaa kirisi ɓaya raa a yuunɛ piti ukɔuni kpaiǃ<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Ama shɔ gbete wɔɔ lasiutɔ, a shanɛ, a nta seti Ɗalapa ɓaya? U tɛ yusho gɔ̃nɛ awuni zaali. <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Ù yusho gbete shɔ gɔ̃ ɓangkɔ ɓɛɛji aru vikɔ̃linɛ gbete ù pɛliyɛ, ama jam ji pɛli vikɔ̃linɛ wɔ ji ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Kɛɗɔn jau geli Yesɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt; Kpaa sisɨn tɔ Yesɔ ang yuuni, a kanɛ aa ɗɔɔ kpati roonɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesɔ geli jau nɛ, &lt;&lt;N gelaatɛ nizɛ, nam a yɛ ɔ̃ a nkɔni a ɗɔbii nyatɔ̃nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ vɔnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Atette niti ɗɔkɨnri kuki tipiu piti kpai yɛnɛ nya ɗarɛ, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />aru a leeu ɗaa ji too nya ɓa. Fãrã gbete shɔ ma a jaa Ɗa gbete shɔ pɛli vi yuu ãnɛ aɗɔn vɔsi ɗɔ ziti. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yesɔ ɓaa nya a kakani a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Maye n ãng surutɛ a naa.&gt;&gt;Naa Yesɔ yisi ruum shɛnɛtɛ a vɔrɛ.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Naa Yupɛ̃ni soja zɛ vigbete pɛliyɛtɛ, a bɛli Ɗalapa nii rɛ a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Nizɛ kɔ jam upɛ shɔ tɔ̃vɨnǃ&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Mɔɔ gbete i shili a ɗɔu aru i ã nɔɔ vishaanɛ, i zɛ nɔgbete Yesɔ vɔyɛtɔ, i piti kpai i sɔɔ wɛrɛ aɗɔ naa waanɛ a nɔsisɨn i tete sisɨn vɨnri. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Shɔgbete i zɛ Yesɔ tɛttɔ, a suu gbete i gɨu dɔɔ a tipi Galili i shi kpɛlɛ i ɗɔɔ nɔɔ kɨnnɛ.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ vɔrɔ gbãnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Jawɔ sidɔn u niinɛ Yusufu, u sijo atette kpati shɔ ruu yeenɛni. U pɛ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn shɔ ntau nyatɔ, <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />ji gɨn shɔwiyi ruumanɛ jo ɓa. Shɛ a Arimatiya a komoo Yahudiya, u ɓɛɛ jo ɗɔgbete ga Ɗa lakpati ɔ̃nɛ anɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />A yurɛ a yɛ Bilatu ɗɔbii a gakiu rɛ nɛu ã Yesɔ vɔrɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Kɛɗɔn yɛrɛ nosi Yesɔ birɛ a lirɛ a làá vɔrɔ gbãnɛwɔ shɔ ɓaanɛ lili, ama i tosi Yesɔ rɛ sàà sɔɔ gbete a nyapuru a shɔji gbã vɔrɔ ɓa ɗɔm ɓayɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Leu si lee bi manɛ aru vitɔ̃rinɛ lee susunɛ.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Suu gbete i gɨu Yesɔ yunɛ Galili, i yɛ a Yusufu nɛi zɛ ɗɔgbete shɔ pɔ̃ Yesɔ vɔrɔ aɗɔnyɛ pɛ anɔgbete shɔ yɔ vɔrɔu yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Naa i zɛ vɔrɔtɛ i sɔɔ wɛrɛrɛ nɛi kã ɗɔ nɔɔ sumu-sumu a nɔɔ pnnɛ gbete shɔ pn abi vɔrɔ yɛ pɛ. Alee susunɛ i susurɛ nagbete nya ãsinɛ Musa shayɛ.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ yunɛ sàà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />A gadi zɨɨnkɔ a lee susunɛ suwi yurɛ i yɛ yusàà, i tuu nɔɔ sũru-sũru gbete i tɔ̃ri yɛ i sã a naani. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />I kpaarɛ shɔ giri tariutɛ a nya sààuni. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Kɛɗɔn i to ɓuzɨn yusàurɛ; ama iji kpaa Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ bi ɓa ɗɔmɓa. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Aɗagbete i a ɗɔɔ yuyɔrinɛ, kɛɗɔn shɔwɔyi i ziti i shi ai ɗɔbii a fãrã ni a ɗɔɔ yaa kɔlinɛ waanɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Sijo vi seti kɔshe, suwi i ɓaki yuu a tipi, shɔwi i geli suwi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ kã shɔgbete u suru aɗɔn pikovi a tete vɔrɔ viya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />U ɓa ɗɔnni ɓa; yulapatɛ. Ɔ kpaa sisɨn aru gbete gelɔɔyɛ aɗagbete usi Galili yɛ: <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />Shanɛ ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ Shɔzɛja shɔu ãu shɔ ruuvini naa, nɛ shɔu ɓau a naa laa, akɨnti lee taati u yulapa a suruni.<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Kɛɗɔn suwiyi i kpaa sisɨn kɛkn aru gbete Yesɔ geliyɛni, <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Naa i sɔtɛ a yusàuni, i geli Yesɔ jadɔyi kopi tu gbete vimrɛ a shɔ gãsiyini. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Shompɛ suwiyi nii ikɔ ɔ̃rɛ Maryamu Magdaliya, Yuwana, a Mariyamu Yakubu ɓini; i a suu gãsiyi gbete isi a yiniyɛ i geli Yesɔ jashonɛyi vim piti kpai. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Ama Yesɔ jashonɛyi i tɔnɛ mɛnɛ ɓa ruu tɔ̃ɓa, iji ã tɔ̃vɨn ɓa ai nyani ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Ama Bituru yudeinɛ a yɛ yusàurɛ; a ta yugboti a kn nɔɔ yɛti sàuni ji zɛ viwɔ ɓa se làá vɔrɔ gbãnɛ. Kɛɗɔn sɔɔ wɛrɛ u bi a ɗɔɔ zaanɛ aru vigbete zɛyɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ jadɔyi a nyaba Imuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />A leeukɔ Yesɔ jadɔyi ziti i ɗɔɔ jakomɔɔ wɔɔ yɛnɛ gbete u niinɛ Imuwa, gbete siyɛ ɔ̃ kilomita kopi tu gbete yunɛ Urushalima; <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Isi ɗɔɔ ruu kɔrinɛ aru vigbete i zɛyɛ kpai. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Aɗagbete i ɗɔɔ ruu kɔrinɛ, Yesɔ kpaa bi a yini maani i ɗɔɔ ranɛ a nyazɔ; <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Ama i zɛu ɗɔkɔ i ji zɛ Yesɔ nii ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yesɔ geliyi nɛ, &lt;&lt; Ɔ kɔri pi ruu ivi a ɗɔɔ ranɛ ɗɔkɔviya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">kɛɗɔn i shirɛ shɔk, i nɔkɨn lɛsinɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Shɔzɛ gbete atete ni u niinɛ Kiliyobas, hɨ Yesɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt;A shɔzati a Urushalima ni ya, gbete ji zɛ vigbete a ɗɔɔ yɛnɛ dii ziti mini ɓaya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yesɔ hɨyinɛ, &lt;&lt;Viu piviya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">I kasi Yesɔ nyanɛ.&lt;&lt;Aru vigbete shɔ pɛli Yesɔ shɔ Nazara yɛ,&gt;&gt;I kasinyarɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Jam u pɛ Ɗa jashonɛ gbete u kaka vishonɛ a nyanwanɛni aɗɔn a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn a shɔzɛni. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />U yupɛ̃ni gbete pɛli vi yuu ãnɛ a jaa Ɗa a kpatiyini i tuurɛ i ãu shɔ a naa nɛ shɔ nyɔutɔ, shɔ ɓau naarɛ a laa. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Ama siu pɔ̃ sisɨn jo au bikɔ, utɔ ukɔ yɛ raa shɔ Isreilayi jo! Yɛ nemtɛ lee taati a vim pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Suu gãsiyi i ãù vibiizaanɛtɛ; i yɛ yusàà gadii zɨɨnkɔ, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />ama i ji kpai Yesɔ vɔrɔ ɓa, i sorɛ i ɗɔɔ shanɛ nɛ, u zɛ nɔrinɛ suru Ɗa jashonɛ lapayi gbete i geliunɛ Yesɔ u a suru ni. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Kɛɗɔn shɔ gãsiyi au tete i yɛtɛ a yusààni i kpaa jo nɔgbete suwi shayɛkɔ, ama i ji zɛu ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geliyinɛ, &lt;&lt;Gbee ɔ shɔgbete ɔ ruu ɓa yɛtini ɓam, ɔ shɔ gbete ɔ sisɨn kpete-kpete aru sisɨn anɛ a vigbete Ɗa jashonɛyi shayɛm!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Ɔ ji zɛɓa nɛ, ɔ̃rii kirisi tɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ u ɓooraatɔ aru vimni, kɛɗɔn yɛ to uɗɔ bassinɛ kn ɓaya? <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ tasiyidɔɔ ruu vigbete Ɗa nyaruubii sha ayuu piti kpai, gaanɛ a Musa labeenɛ a vigbete janyagadiyi bee yɛ piti kpai.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Nayi atɛ māāni a jakomɔɔni gbete i kasi yɛnɛ yɛ, kɛɗɔn Yesɔ pɛli naa yɛ tɛɛtɔ yɛnɛ ɗekɨn; <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Ama i bɔ̃urɛ i shanɛ, &lt;&lt; Ɔ̃nɛ a ukuni aɗɔm, ɗarɛ pɛlitɛ, ɗɔkɛ tɔɔnɛtɔ.&gt;&gt; kɛdɔn Yesɔ gɨnyi rɛ a ɔ̃rɛ a ikɔ ni. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Naa Yesɔ ɔ̃tɛ i shaakɛ vishaanɛ, a tuu borodi a dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa; kɛɗɔn a dali borodi rɛ a ãliyirɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Kɛɗɔn i nɔɔ ɓɛlirɛ i zɛu nii kɛkn, Ama nirɛ ai atete ni. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />I geli zɔnɛ, &lt;&lt;Aɗɔgbete u si a nyaba anɛ u sisɨn ji du ɓaya, a ɗagbeteu nwanya a ukɔni i tasiu dɔɔ Ɗa nyaruubii ɓaya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />I yurɛ tɛ̃ɛ̃ti i sɔkɛ Urushalima, ɗɔgbete i kpai gãsi kopi tu gbete i toli nyatɛ a shɔwɔɔni, <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />I shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa yuutɛ nizɛ kɔǃ shɛtɛ a Bituru ɗɔbiini.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Kɛɗɔn shɔ zitiwiyi i tasiyi dɔɔ vigbete i zɛ a nyaba yɛ, a nɔgbete i zɛ Yesɔ a ɗɔgbete dali borodi yɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ shɛ u jadɔyi bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Aɗagbete shɔ zitiwi i ɗɔɔ ruum shanɛ, kɛɗɔn ɓai zɛnɛni ɓa Yesɔ au yuu shɛrɛ a shi ai tete, a gelinɛ, &lt;&lt; Ɔ̃nɛ binyatɔ̃nɛ u ɔ̃ awɔ tetteni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Ama seti pɛlitɔ i tɔnɛ mɛnɛyi i zɛ rãmã. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Ama Yesɔ geliyinɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ nta seti pi ruu iviya? Aru ivi sisɨn vãnɛm shɛpi ruuvi au sisɨnni viya? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Ɔ kɨnnɔɔ pɛ ang naa ang dɔɔni, pɛji nkɔ ang yuu, ɔ ɗii naa pɛ ang bi, ɔ yɛ zɛtɔ, rãmã u yɔpɔ ɓa biini ɓa a kakani, nagbete ɔ zɛyɛ n awuni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Sha vimrɛ kɛɗɔn a tasiyi u naarɛ a dɔɔni. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Piti kpai i ji ã sisɨn ɓa aru gbete i si doo ɗɔɔ sisɨn puru ntanɛ a bi zaanɛni; kɛɗɔn Yesɔ hɨyinɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ vishaanɛ a ɗɔnni ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />I ãu jazɨng wɔɔnɛ gbete, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Tɛrɛ a shaa ai nɔɔ.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ geliyi nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shompɛ vigbete n gelɔɔ yɛ aɗagbete sin a nyazɔ a ɔkɔɔniː&gt;&gt; Vigbete shɔ bee ang yuu a labeenɛ nya ãsinɛ Musa, a Ɗa jashonɛyi vi beenɛ a Zabura ni ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ u ɔ̃ nizɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ ɓeli sisɨnrɛ nɛi zɛ Ɗa nya ruubii, <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />a geliyi nɛ, shompɛ vigbete shɔ bee yɛː Ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ kirisi u ɓooraatɔ, ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ u yulapa a sàà a lee taati. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Au niikɔ shɔyɛ nwari shɔ Ɗa nyaruubi a koo piti kpai, aru sisɨn kɔsinɛ a zɔɔ ruuvini yasinɛ. Shɔ yɛ gaa a Urushalima, <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Ɔkɔɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔ shinɛ knti ayuu vimni, <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />N ang yuu, n yɛn sho-shɔɔ vigbete maye ma a ɔkɔɔniyɛ. Ama setɛ shɔ awɔ kaka tɛttɔ a lapa.<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ tuu Yesɔ yɛnɛ kolapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Kɛɗɔn Yesɔ shɛshirɛ a kɔmɔɔni, yɛnɛ tipi Betani. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Aɗagbete Yesɔ u ai ɗɔɔ vɔɔ susãri tasi biiyɛ, Yesɔ yai ɗɔbiirɛ, kɛɗɔn shɔ turɛ yɛnɛ kolapa. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />I basiu rɛ kɛɗɔn i so tipi Urushalima rɛ, i sisɨn puru ɓolo-bolo. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Ko-pi lee piya i a jaa Ɗa gbete shɔ pɛli vi yuu ãnɛ aɗɔnyɛ i ɗɔɔ Ɗalapa dɔ̃rinɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>